msgid "Not running"
msgstr "停止中"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixFace.qml:36
msgctxt "@info what comes out of a One Ear Mix that is switched off"
msgid "Stereo, as it came"
msgstr "ステレオのまま"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixFace.qml:39
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix whose session is not running"
msgid "Session stopped"
msgstr "セッション停止中"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixFace.qml:64
msgctxt "@info what a One Ear Mix tile says, 'Left ear, L+R one mix to L'"
msgid "%1, %2"
msgstr "%1、%2"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:17
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Puts both sides of a stereo mix into the ear you choose, or one mix on both "
"sides for one earbud."
msgstr "ステレオの左右両方の音を選んだ耳にまとめるか、片耳イヤホン用に同じミックスを左右に出します。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Without it, what is panned to the other side is lost to the ear you use. A "
"plain mono mix, such as Mono in the Channels block, drops a sound panned to "
"one side by 6 dB, and cancels sound that is out of phase between the sides."
msgstr ""
"このブロックがないと、反対側に振られた音は、使っている耳には届きません。「チャンネル」ブロックの「モノラル」のような単純なモノラルミックスでは、片側に振られた音が"
" 6 dB 下がり、左右で位相が逆の音は打ち消し合ってしまいます。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"One Ear Mix first shifts the two sides a quarter of a cycle apart, then adds "
"them. A sound panned to one side comes through 3 dB lower, and sound out of "
"phase between the sides doesn't cancel the way it does in a plain mono mix."
msgstr ""
"「片耳ミックス」は、まず左右の音を互いに 4 分の 1 周期ずらしてから足し合わせます。片側に振られた音は 3 dB "
"低くなるだけで、左右で位相が逆の音も、単純なモノラルミックスのように打ち消し合うことはありません。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"When you pick an ear, the sound on that side goes on playing and what was on "
"the other side comes in over about five seconds. It does the same when the "
"session starts, when the block is switched back on, and when the sound "
"reaches a new output, such as a headset plugged in."
msgstr ""
"耳を選ぶと、その側の音は鳴り続け、反対側にあった音が約 5 "
"秒かけて加わります。セッションの開始時、ブロックをオンに戻したとき、ヘッドセットの接続などで音が新しい出力に届いたときも同じです。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:29
msgctxt "@title a part of the One Ear Mix block's help page"
msgid "What it cannot do"
msgstr "できないこと"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:31
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:416
msgctxt "@action:button show the figures behind the line beside it"
msgid "Figures"
msgstr "数値"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:34
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Direction doesn't come back: a mix in one ear can't tell you where a sound "
"is."
msgstr "方向感は戻りません。片耳で聞くミックスでは、音がどこから来ているかはわかりません。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:35
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"A sound a quarter of a cycle apart between the sides can get quieter. If a "
"track goes thin at one place, try Plain Mono."
msgstr "左右で 4 分の 1 周期ずれた音は小さくなることがあります。曲の一部で音が痩せて聞こえたら、「単純モノラル」を試してください。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:36
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Peaks can rise by several dB, so keep a limit after this block, as Volume "
"has."
msgstr "ピークが数 dB 上がることがあるので、「音量」ブロックにあるような制限を、このブロックの後に置いてください。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:37
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"If the block is switched off or the session stops, stereo comes back, and "
"what is on the other side is lost to that ear again."
msgstr "ブロックをオフにしたりセッションが停止したりするとステレオに戻り、反対側の音はまたその耳に届かなくなります。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:42
msgctxt "@title a part of the One Ear Mix block's help page"
msgid "What each mix does to sound"
msgstr "各ミックスによる音の変化"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:44
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block, one row of a table"
msgid "Centred sound: Plain Mono 0 dB, One Ear Mix about 0 dB."
msgstr "中央の音: 単純モノラルは 0 dB、片耳ミックスは約 0 dB。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:45
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block, one row of a table"
msgid "Sound on one side only: Plain Mono 6 dB lower, One Ear Mix 3 dB lower."
msgstr "片側だけの音: 単純モノラルは 6 dB 低下、片耳ミックスは 3 dB 低下。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:46
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block, one row of a table"
msgid ""
"Sound out of phase between the sides: Plain Mono cancels it, One Ear Mix "
"about 0 dB."
msgstr "左右で位相が逆の音: 単純モノラルでは打ち消され、片耳ミックスは約 0 dB。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block, one row of a table"
msgid "Unrelated left and right: Plain Mono 3 dB lower, One Ear Mix 0 dB."
msgstr "左右が無関係な音: 単純モノラルは 3 dB 低下、片耳ミックスは 0 dB。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block, one row of a table"
msgid "Peaks: no rise in Plain Mono, several dB in One Ear Mix."
msgstr "ピーク: 単純モノラルでは上がらず、片耳ミックスでは数 dB 上がる。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block, one row of a table"
msgid ""
"At 1 kHz and a 48 kHz rate, the right side leading the left by a quarter of a"
" cycle: Plain Mono 3 dB lower, One Ear Mix 30 dB lower."
msgstr ""
"1 kHz、サンプルレート 48 kHz で、右が左より 4 分の 1 周期進んでいる音: 単純モノラルは 3 dB 低下、片耳ミックスは 30 dB "
"低下。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:50
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block, one row of a table"
msgid ""
"The same with the right side lagging: Plain Mono 3 dB lower, One Ear Mix 3 dB"
" higher."
msgstr "同じ条件で右が遅れている音: 単純モノラルは 3 dB 低下、片耳ミックスは 3 dB 上昇。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:60
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:172
msgctxt "@label which ear a One Ear Mix sends the sound to"
msgid "Send to"
msgstr "送り先"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:62
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:24
msgctxt "@option:radio One Ear Mix leaves both sides alone"
msgid "No change"
msgstr "変更なし"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:63
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:26
msgctxt "@option:radio One Ear Mix sends the sound to"
msgid "Left ear"
msgstr "左耳"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:64
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:28
msgctxt "@option:radio One Ear Mix sends the sound to"
msgid "Right ear"
msgstr "右耳"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:65
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:30
msgctxt "@option:radio One Ear Mix sends the sound to"
msgid "Both ears"
msgstr "両耳"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"No change passes both sides as they came, and a new block starts there. Left "
"ear and Right ear put both sides into that ear and leave the other side "
"silent. Both ears puts one mix on both sides, for one earbud."
msgstr ""
"「変更なし」は左右をそのまま通し、新しいブロックはこの設定で始まります。「左耳」と「右耳」は左右両方の音をその耳にまとめ、反対側は無音になります。「両耳」は片耳イヤホン用に、同じミックスを左右に出します。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:74
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:273
msgctxt "@label which of two mixes to listen to"
msgid "Hear"
msgstr "試聴"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:76
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:265
msgctxt "@title:group a part of the One Ear Mix card"
msgid "Compare with Plain Mono"
msgstr "単純モノラルと比較"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:77
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:42
msgctxt "@option:radio which mix a One Ear Mix block plays"
msgid "One Ear Mix"
msgstr "片耳ミックス"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:78
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:44
msgctxt "@option:radio which mix a One Ear Mix block plays"
msgid "Plain Mono"
msgstr "単純モノラル"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:81
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Switches between One Ear Mix and Plain Mono, which adds the sides and halves "
"them. It is under Compare with Plain Mono. Plain Mono is also the better "
"choice for a mono recording in two channels."
msgstr ""
"「片耳ミックス」と、左右を足して半分にする「単純モノラル」を切り替えます。「単純モノラルと比較」の中にあります。2 "
"チャンネルで録音されたモノラル音源にも、「単純モノラル」のほうが適しています。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:87
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:314
msgctxt "@action:button read both mixes and lower the louder"
msgid "Match Levels"
msgstr "レベルを揃える"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:89
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:313
msgctxt "@action:button a One Ear Mix is reading the two levels"
msgid "Reading, 3 s"
msgstr "測定中（3 秒）"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:92
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Play something and press it. It reads both mixes for three seconds. One Ear "
"Mix usually reads louder, and by how much depends on the music, so if it was "
"the louder, the difference goes into Lower this mix by. If Plain Mono was the"
" louder, or the two are more than 6 dB apart, the card says so and changes "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"何か再生してから押してください。両方のミックスを 3 "
"秒間測定します。ふつうは「片耳ミックス」のほうが大きく測定され、その差は音楽によって変わります。そのため「片耳ミックス」のほうが大きかった場合は、その差が「このミックスを下げる量」に入ります。「単純モノラル」のほうが大きかった場合や、両者の差が"
" 6 dB を超える場合は、設定パネルにその旨が表示され、何も変更されません。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:98
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:337
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:346
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:373
msgctxt "@label:slider how far a One Ear Mix turns its mix down"
msgid "Lower this mix by"
msgstr "このミックスを下げる量"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:100
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Turns One Ear Mix down, from 0 to 6 dB, so that a comparison is about the "
"sound and not the level. A new block starts at 0 dB. The tile shows it while "
"it is above 0, so that it isn't forgotten. It never touches Plain Mono."
msgstr ""
"比較が音量の差ではなく音そのものの比較になるように、「片耳ミックス」を 0〜6 dB の範囲で下げます。新しいブロックでは 0 dB です。0 "
"より大きい間は、忘れないようにタイルに表示されます。「単純モノラル」には影響しません。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:107
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid "You want all of a stereo mix in one ear."
msgstr "ステレオのミックス全体を片方の耳で聞きたいとき。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:108
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid "You have one earbud in, and want all of the mix in it."
msgstr "イヤホンを片耳だけに着けていて、そのイヤホンでミックス全体を聞きたいとき。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:115
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Put it after anything that needs the two sides, just before a lane forks."
msgstr "左右の音を必要とするものすべての後、レーンが分岐する直前に置いてください。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:116
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"A Hearing Compensation block set to the same ear, after it, works on what "
"that ear receives."
msgstr "同じ耳に設定した「聴覚補正」ブロックをこの後に置くと、その耳に届く音を補正できます。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:117
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid "Set Lower this mix by back to 0 when you are done comparing."
msgstr "比較が終わったら、「このミックスを下げる量」を 0 に戻してください。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:133
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix's reading was cut short"
msgid "The session stopped, so nothing was measured."
msgstr "セッションが停止したため、何も測定されませんでした。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:142
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix's reading never ended"
msgid "No reading came back, so nothing was changed."
msgstr "測定結果が返ってこなかったため、何も変更されませんでした。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:215
msgctxt "@title a table on the One Ear Mix card"
msgid "What each mix does to sound"
msgstr "各ミックスによる音の変化"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:226
msgctxt "@title:column a kind of sound"
msgid "Sound in the mix"
msgstr "ミックス内の音"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:238
msgctxt "@title:column the One Ear Mix fold, in a table beside Plain Mono"
msgid "This mix"
msgstr "このミックス"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:316
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Run the session and play something to compare the two"
msgstr "比較するには、セッションを実行して何か再生してください"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:358
msgctxt "@label the unit of Lower this mix by"
msgid "dB"
msgstr "dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:394
msgctxt "@info why the comparison is not open to use yet"
msgid "Pick an ear first"
msgstr "まず耳を選んでください"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:407
msgctxt "@info what a One Ear Mix cannot do"
msgid ""
"Direction doesn't come back: a mix in one ear can't tell you where a sound "
"is. A sound a quarter of a cycle apart between the sides can get quieter. "
"Peaks can rise by several dB, so keep a limit after this block, as Volume "
"has."
msgstr ""
"方向感は戻りません。片耳で聞くミックスでは、音がどこから来ているかはわかりません。左右で 4 分の 1 周期ずれた音は小さくなることがあります。ピークが数"
" dB 上がることがあるので、「音量」ブロックにあるような制限を、このブロックの後に置いてください。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:430
msgctxt "@info the figures behind the quarter of a cycle"
msgid ""
"At 1 kHz and a 48 kHz rate, sound where the right side leads the left by a "
"quarter of a cycle comes through 30 dB lower, and sound where it lags comes "
"through 3 dB higher. Plain Mono puts both 3 dB lower."
msgstr ""
"1 kHz、サンプルレート 48 kHz では、右が左より 4 分の 1 周期進んでいる音は 30 dB 低くなり、遅れている音は 3 dB "
"高くなります。「単純モノラル」ではどちらも 3 dB 低くなります。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:54
msgctxt "@info what a One Ear Mix choice does"
msgid "Both sides pass as they came. Pick where the sound goes."
msgstr "左右がそのまま通ります。音の送り先を選んでください。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:57
msgctxt "@info what a One Ear Mix choice does"
msgid ""
"Puts both sides into the left ear. Sound panned to one side comes through 3 "
"dB lower. The right side is silent."
msgstr "左右両方を左耳にまとめます。片側に振られた音は 3 dB 低くなります。右側は無音になります。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:60
msgctxt "@info what a One Ear Mix choice does"
msgid ""
"Puts both sides into the right ear. Sound panned to one side comes through 3 "
"dB lower. The left side is silent."
msgstr "左右両方を右耳にまとめます。片側に振られた音は 3 dB 低くなります。左側は無音になります。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:63
msgctxt "@info what a One Ear Mix choice does"
msgid ""
"Puts both sides into one mix, the same on the left and on the right, for one "
"earbud. Sound panned to one side comes through 3 dB lower."
msgstr "片耳イヤホン用に、左右両方を 1 つのミックスにまとめ、左右に同じ音を出します。片側に振られた音は 3 dB 低くなります。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:72
msgctxt "@info where a One Ear Mix sends the sound"
msgid "No change. Both sides pass as they came."
msgstr "変更なし。左右がそのまま通ります。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:74
msgctxt "@info where a One Ear Mix sends the sound"
msgid "Left ear. The right side is silent."
msgstr "左耳。右側は無音です。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:76
msgctxt "@info where a One Ear Mix sends the sound"
msgid "Right ear. The left side is silent."
msgstr "右耳。左側は無音です。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:78
msgctxt "@info where a One Ear Mix sends the sound"
msgid "Both ears. One mix on both sides."
msgstr "両耳。左右に同じミックスを出します。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:85
msgctxt "@info a level in decibels, '1.4 dB'"
msgid "%1 dB"
msgstr "%1 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:92
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix is fading the right side in"
msgid "Bringing in R"
msgstr "R をフェードイン中"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:94
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix is fading the left side in"
msgid "Bringing in L"
msgstr "L をフェードイン中"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:96
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix is fading both sides in"
msgid "Bringing in both sides"
msgstr "左右をフェードイン中"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:105
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix plays Plain Mono to the left"
msgid "Plain Mono to L"
msgstr "単純モノラルを L へ"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:107
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix plays Plain Mono to the right"
msgid "Plain Mono to R"
msgstr "単純モノラルを R へ"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:109
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix plays Plain Mono to both sides"
msgid "Plain Mono to both"
msgstr "単純モノラルを両方へ"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:119
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix lowered by a number of decibels, to the left"
msgid "One mix −%1 dB to L"
msgstr "1 つにまとめ、−%1 dB で L へ"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:121
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix lowered by a number of decibels, to the right"
msgid "One mix −%1 dB to R"
msgstr "1 つにまとめ、−%1 dB で R へ"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:123
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix lowered by a number of decibels, to both sides"
msgid "One mix −%1 dB to both"
msgstr "1 つにまとめ、−%1 dB で両方へ"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:132
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix that has not been told where to send the sound"
msgid "Pick where it goes"
msgstr "送り先を選択"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:134
msgctxt "@info both sides as one mix to the left"
msgid "L+R one mix to L"
msgstr "L+R を 1 つにまとめて L へ"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:136
msgctxt "@info both sides as one mix to the right"
msgid "L+R one mix to R"
msgstr "L+R を 1 つにまとめて R へ"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:138
msgctxt "@info both sides as one mix to both sides"
msgid "L+R one mix to both"
msgstr "L+R を 1 つにまとめて両方へ"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:147
msgctxt "@item:intable a kind of sound in a mix"
msgid "Centred"
msgstr "中央"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:148
msgctxt "@item:intable level of a kind of sound in Plain Mono"
msgid "0 dB"
msgstr "0 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:149
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:159
msgctxt "@item:intable level of a kind of sound in One Ear Mix"
msgid "About 0 dB"
msgstr "約 0 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:152
msgctxt "@item:intable a kind of sound in a mix"
msgid "One side only"
msgstr "片側のみ"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:153
msgctxt "@item:intable level of a kind of sound in Plain Mono"
msgid "−6 dB"
msgstr "−6 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:154
msgctxt "@item:intable level of a kind of sound in One Ear Mix"
msgid "−3 dB"
msgstr "−3 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:157
msgctxt "@item:intable a kind of sound in a mix"
msgid "Out of phase"
msgstr "逆位相"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:158
msgctxt "@item:intable level of a kind of sound in Plain Mono"
msgid "Cancels"
msgstr "打ち消し"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:162
msgctxt "@item:intable a kind of sound in a mix"
msgid "Unrelated sides"
msgstr "無関係な左右"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:163
msgctxt "@item:intable level of a kind of sound in Plain Mono"
msgid "−3 dB"
msgstr "−3 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:164
msgctxt "@item:intable level of a kind of sound in One Ear Mix"
msgid "0 dB"
msgstr "0 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:167
msgctxt "@item:intable peaks of the sound"
msgid "Peaks"
msgstr "ピーク"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:168
msgctxt "@item:intable what happens to peaks in Plain Mono"
msgid "No rise"
msgstr "上昇なし"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:169
msgctxt "@item:intable what happens to peaks in One Ear Mix"
msgid "Can rise"
msgstr "上昇しうる"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:190
msgctxt ""
"@info:accessibility a cell of a table, 'One side only, Plain Mono: -6 dB'"
msgid "%1, %2: %3"
msgstr "%1、%2: %3"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:199
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix's reading met silence"
msgid "Nothing to measure yet. Play something first."
msgstr "まだ測定するものがありません。先に何か再生してください。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:207
msgctxt ""
"@info a One Ear Mix's reading, nothing changed; %1 is the most it can lower "
"by, '6 dB'"
msgid "The two mixes are more than %1 apart here, so nothing is lowered."
msgstr "ここでは 2 つのミックスの差が %1 を超えているため、何も下げません。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:208
msgctxt "@info a whole number of decibels"
msgid "%1 dB"
msgstr "%1 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:214
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix's reading, nothing changed"
msgid "Plain Mono was louder here, so nothing is lowered."
msgstr "ここでは「単純モノラル」のほうが大きかったため、何も下げません。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:220
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix's reading, nothing changed"
msgid "The two mixes read the same here, so nothing is lowered."
msgstr "ここでは 2 つのミックスの測定値が同じだったため、何も下げません。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:227
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix's reading; %1 is a level, '1.4 dB'"
msgid ""
"One Ear Mix was %1 louder here, so it is lowered by %1. Set it back to 0 when"
" you are done."
msgstr "ここでは「片耳ミックス」のほうが %1 大きかったため、%1 下げます。終わったら 0 に戻してください。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:19
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Plays the sound that reaches it on your speakers, your headphones or another "
"device. It is where a lane is heard."
msgstr "届いた音をスピーカー、ヘッドホン、またはほかのデバイスで再生します。レーンの音が聞こえるのはここです。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Put it at the end of a lane and choose a device. Everything that reaches the "
"block plays there, at the volume you set."
msgstr "レーンの最後に置いてデバイスを選んでください。ブロックに届いた音はすべて、設定した音量でそのデバイスから再生されます。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"On a stereo device, the left side of the lane plays on the left and the right"
" on the right. A device with one channel gets both sides mixed together. On a"
" device with more channels, such as surround speakers, the sound plays on the"
" front pair and the others stay silent."
msgstr ""
"ステレオのデバイスでは、レーンの左側が左、右側が右で再生されます。チャンネルが 1 "
"つのデバイスには、左右を混ぜた音が送られます。サラウンドスピーカーのようにチャンネルが多いデバイスでは、音は前方の 2 "
"つで再生され、ほかは無音のままです。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"If the device is unplugged, the block goes quiet and a warning says so. It "
"plays again by itself when the device comes back."
msgstr "デバイスが外されるとブロックは無音になり、警告が表示されます。デバイスが戻ると自動的に再生を再開します。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Several lanes can end in Output Devices on the same speakers. Their sound is "
"mixed there."
msgstr "複数のレーンの最後に、同じスピーカーを使う「出力デバイス」を置くことができます。それらの音はそこで混ぜられます。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid "Where the block plays. The list has the devices plugged in now:"
msgstr "ブロックが音を出す先です。一覧には現在接続されているデバイスが表示されます:"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:43
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block, a choice of Audio device"
msgid ""
"Default output: whatever your desktop plays to. When you change that in the "
"system's settings, or plug in headphones it switches to, the block follows. "
"This is what a new block uses."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトの出力: "
"デスクトップが音を出している先です。システムの設定でそれを変更したり、ヘッドホンを接続して切り替わったりすると、ブロックも追従します。これが新しいブロックの初期値です。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:44
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block, a choice of Audio device"
msgid "A device by name: that device, whatever the desktop's choice is."
msgstr "名前で選んだデバイス: デスクトップでの選択にかかわらず、そのデバイスです。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:45
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block, a choice of Audio device"
msgid ""
"Virtual devices, at the end of the list: microphones with no hardware behind "
"them, such as the ones you make in Reverblabr. Choose one, and other "
"programs, such as a call, can pick the lane up as if it were a microphone."
msgstr ""
"仮想デバイス（一覧の最後）: Reverblabr "
"で作成したものなど、背後にハードウェアのないマイクです。これを選ぶと、通話などのほかのプログラムが、レーンをマイクのように取り込めます。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"A device the block was set to that is not plugged in stays in the list, "
"marked unavailable, so opening the settings never moves the block to another "
"device."
msgstr ""
"ブロックに設定されたデバイスが接続されていない場合も、「利用不可」の印を付けて一覧に残るので、設定を開いただけでブロックが別のデバイスに移ることはありません。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:54
#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:127
msgctxt "@label:slider how loud the block plays to its device"
msgid "Output volume"
msgstr "出力音量"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:56
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"How loud the block plays, from 0 %, silence, to 100 %, the sound as it "
"reached the block. A new block starts at 100 %. It can only turn the sound "
"down; to make a lane louder, put a Volume block before it and turn on its "
"Overdrive."
msgstr ""
"ブロックが出す音の大きさで、0%（無音）から 100%（ブロックに届いたままの音）までです。新しいブロックは 100% "
"から始まります。音を下げることしかできないので、レーンの音を大きくするには、前に「音量」ブロックを置いて「オーバードライブ」をオンにしてください。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:57
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"It changes only this block. The device's own volume, and every other program "
"on it, stay as they are. A change glides in over a fiftieth of a second, so "
"moving the slider never makes a click."
msgstr ""
"変わるのはこのブロックだけです。デバイス自体の音量や、そのデバイスを使うほかのプログラムはそのままです。変化は 50 分の 1 "
"秒かけて滑らかに反映されるので、スライダーを動かしてもクリック音は出ません。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:63
#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:197
msgctxt "@label the highest level this block sends to the output"
msgid "Last limit"
msgstr "最終制限"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:67
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Last limit: the highest level this block sends to the output, in dBFS. It "
"appears only when a session needs it."
msgstr "最終制限: このブロックが出力に送る最大レベル（dBFS）です。セッションで必要なときだけ表示されます。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"On a chain with a Hearing block, the last thing the sound meets is a limit. "
"If a block that can add gain comes after the last limit, this block adds a "
"limit of its own and says which block caused it. It adds about 2 ms of delay."
" The limit keeps to the lowest Output ceiling on the way here."
msgstr ""
"「聴覚」カテゴリのブロックを含む信号経路では、音が最後に通るのは制限です。最後の制限の後にゲインを加えられるブロックがある場合、このブロックが独自の制限を加え、どのブロックが原因かを表示します。これにより約"
" 2 ms の遅延が加わります。この制限は、ここまでの経路で最も低い「出力の上限」に従います。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:69
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"It is a digital limit: it works on numbers inside the computer. How loud that"
" is at your ear depends on your volume, your sound card and your headphones, "
"which Reverblabr can't know."
msgstr ""
"これはデジタル上の制限で、コンピュータ内部の数値に対して働きます。それが耳元でどれだけの音量になるかは、音量設定、サウンドカード、ヘッドホンによって決まり、Reverblabr"
" にはわかりません。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Lowering it works at once. Raising it takes one more step, with Raise…, and "
"the sound rises slowly to the new limit."
msgstr "下げる操作はすぐに反映されます。上げるには「上げる…」でもう 1 段階の操作が必要で、音は新しい制限までゆっくりと上がります。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:77
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Click the heading to choose which of the device's channels the left and the "
"right side play on. Most devices never need it."
msgstr "見出しをクリックすると、左右の音をデバイスのどのチャンネルで再生するかを選べます。ほとんどのデバイスでは必要ありません。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:86
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Which of the device's channels the left side and the right side of the lane "
"play on. The lists show the channels by the names the device gives them, such"
" as FL and FR for front left and front right, or AUX0, AUX1 and so on."
msgstr ""
"レーンの左側と右側を、デバイスのどのチャンネルで再生するかです。一覧には、デバイスが付けた名前でチャンネルが表示されます。たとえば前方左と前方右の FL "
"と FR、または AUX0、AUX1 などです。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:87
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Default, what a new block uses, leaves it to the block, as described above. A"
" channel you choose gets that side whole, and nothing else: outputs 3 and 4 "
"of an audio interface for a second pair of speakers, for example."
msgstr ""
"「デフォルト」（新しいブロックの初期値）では、上で説明したとおりブロックに任せます。チャンネルを選ぶと、そのチャンネルにはその側の音だけがそのまま送られます。たとえば、2"
" 組目のスピーカー用にオーディオインターフェースの出力 3 と 4 を使う場合です。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:88
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Once you choose a channel for one side, the other side is not heard until you"
" choose one for it too."
msgstr "片側のチャンネルを選ぶと、もう片側のチャンネルも選ぶまで、そちらの音は聞こえません。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:95
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"You want to hear what a lane does, on your speakers or in your headphones."
msgstr "レーンの効果をスピーカーやヘッドホンで聞きたいとき。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:96
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"You want a call or another program to hear the lane as a microphone: choose a"
" virtual device."
msgstr "通話などのほかのプログラムに、レーンをマイクとして聞かせたいとき: 仮想デバイスを選んでください。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:97
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"You want one lane on the speakers and another in the headphones, each at its "
"own volume."
msgstr "あるレーンはスピーカーで、別のレーンはヘッドホンで、それぞれ独自の音量で聞きたいとき。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:104
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"When the session records from a virtual device, choose your real speakers "
"here by name. Left on Default output, the block could follow the default to "
"the very device the session records from; Reverblabr refuses that connection,"
" because the sound would go round in a loop."
msgstr ""
"セッションが仮想デバイスから録音している場合は、ここで実際のスピーカーを名前で選んでください。「デフォルトの出力」のままだと、ブロックがデフォルトに従って、セッションが録音しているまさにそのデバイスに出力する可能性があります。音がループしてしまうため、Reverblabr"
" はその接続を拒否します。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:105
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"If you hear a program twice, it is playing to the speakers itself as well as "
"through the lane. Move the program to another device in the system's sound "
"settings, or end the lane somewhere else."
msgstr ""
"プログラムの音が二重に聞こえる場合は、そのプログラムがレーンを通すだけでなく、スピーカーにも直接再生しています。システムのサウンド設定でプログラムを別のデバイスに移すか、レーンの最後を別の場所にしてください。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:106
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid "To check a speaker or a cable, wire a Wave block to an Output Device."
msgstr "スピーカーやケーブルを確認するには、「テスト信号」ブロックを「出力デバイス」に配線してください。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:69
msgctxt "@info why this block has a limit; the name of a block"
msgid ""
"This limit is here because %1 can add gain after the last limit. It adds "
"about 2 ms of delay."
msgstr "この制限があるのは、最後の制限の後で「%1」がゲインを加えられるためです。約 2 ms の遅延が加わります。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:73
msgctxt "@info why this block has a limit"
msgid ""
"This limit is here because two wires meet at one input, and their sum can go "
"past the last limit. It adds about 2 ms of delay."
msgstr ""
"この制限があるのは、2 本の配線が 1 つの入力に合流し、その合計が最後の制限を超える可能性があるためです。約 2 ms の遅延が加わります。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:76
msgctxt "@info why this block has a limit"
msgid ""
"This limit is here because both sides go to one channel, where together they "
"can pass the last limit. It adds about 2 ms of delay."
msgstr ""
"この制限があるのは、左右の両方が 1 つのチャンネルに送られ、合わせると最後の制限を超える可能性があるためです。約 2 ms の遅延が加わります。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:106
msgctxt "@info the chosen output is not plugged in"
msgid ""
"This output is not there at the moment. It comes back on its own when the "
"device does."
msgstr "この出力は現在ありません。デバイスが戻ると自動的に復帰します。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:136
msgctxt "@info:status a volume, as a percentage"
msgid "%1 %"
msgstr "%1%"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:154
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Output volume"
msgstr "出力音量"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:200
msgctxt "@info said at the end of a slider"
msgid "Last limit stops here. To raise it, use Raise."
msgstr "「最終制限」はここで止まります。さらに上げるには「上げる」を使ってください。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:201
msgctxt "@info the question over a number"
msgid "Last limit is %1 dBFS. Raise it to:"
msgstr "「最終制限」は現在 %1 dBFS です。新しい値:"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:214
msgctxt "@info a lower limit further up the chain is the one that holds"
msgid "Set lower by Output ceiling: %1 dBFS"
msgstr "「出力の上限」により引き下げ: %1 dBFS"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:17
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"Puts a sound at one place between the left and the right speaker, at the same"
" loudness wherever it sits."
msgstr "音を左右のスピーカーの間の 1 か所に配置します。どこに置いても音の大きさは変わりません。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"The block first makes one sound of the two sides, by averaging them. A sound "
"that was in the middle keeps its level; a stereo recording loses its own "
"spread of left and right."
msgstr "ブロックはまず左右を平均して 1 つの音にします。中央にあった音はレベルが保たれますが、ステレオ録音は元の左右の広がりを失います。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"It then sends that one sound to the two speakers in the proportion you set. "
"In the middle both carry it equally; all the way to one side, only that "
"speaker plays it."
msgstr ""
"次に、その 1 つの音を、設定した割合で 2 "
"つのスピーカーに送ります。中央では両方から同じだけ出て、片側いっぱいにするとそちらのスピーカーだけから出ます。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"The sound keeps the same loudness wherever you put it: in the middle each "
"side plays it a little quieter, so the two together are as loud as one side "
"alone at the end."
msgstr ""
"どこに置いても音の大きさは変わりません: 中央ではそれぞれの側が少し小さく鳴らすので、2 つ合わせると、端で片側だけが鳴らすときと同じ大きさになります。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"A change glides in over a fiftieth of a second, so dragging the slider while "
"the sound plays makes no click. The sound is not delayed."
msgstr "変化は 50 分の 1 秒かけて滑らかに反映されるので、音の再生中にスライダーをドラッグしてもクリック音は出ません。音は遅れません。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:35 blocks/pan/ui/PanUi.qml:23
#: blocks/pan/ui/PanUi.qml:29
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Pan"
msgstr "パン"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:37
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"Where the sound sits. L under the left end of the slider is the left side, R "
"under the right end is the right."
msgstr "音の位置です。スライダーの左端の下の L が左側、右端の下の R が右側です。"

#. i18n: keep the examples as the panel writes them: Centre, L 30, R 100.
#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"The number above the slider says where it is: Centre in the middle, then L or"
" R and how far, up to 100 at either end. L 30 is a little to the left; R 100 "
"is the right speaker alone."
msgstr ""
"スライダーの上の数値が位置を示します: 中央では「中央」、それ以外では L か R とその度合いで、両端で 100 になります。L 30 は少し左寄り、R"
" 100 は右のスピーカーだけです。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid "A new block starts at Centre."
msgstr "新しいブロックは「中央」から始まります。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"Two people talk in the same recording or call, and you want one on each side "
"so they are easier to tell apart."
msgstr "同じ録音や通話で 2 人が話していて、聞き分けやすいように 1 人ずつ左右に分けたいとき。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"A mono source, such as a microphone, should sound as if it comes from one "
"side."
msgstr "マイクなどのモノラルの音源を、片側から聞こえるようにしたいとき。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"Several sources play at once, and spreading them out keeps them from crowding"
" each other."
msgstr "複数の音源が同時に鳴っていて、左右に散らして互いにぶつからないようにしたいとき。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:56
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"To make one side of a stereo recording quieter and keep its stereo, use the "
"Balance block instead. Pan always makes one sound of the two sides first."
msgstr ""
"ステレオ録音の片側だけを小さくしてステレオを保ちたい場合は、代わりに「バランス」ブロックを使ってください。「パン」は必ず最初に左右を 1 "
"つの音にまとめます。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:57
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"Small moves go a long way. Try L 30 or R 30 before going all the way to one "
"end."
msgstr "少し動かすだけでも大きく変わります。端まで動かす前に、L 30 や R 30 を試してください。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"A Peak/RMS meter after the block shows the left and the right side apart, so "
"you can see where the sound went."
msgstr "ブロックの後に「ピーク/RMS」メーターを置くと左右が別々に表示されるので、音がどこへ移ったかを確認できます。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanUi.qml:22
msgctxt "@label what the setting on a Pan tile is"
msgid "pan"
msgstr "パン"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqFace.qml:42
msgctxt "@info:tooltip one band of an equaliser, 'Bell 250 Hz +9.0 dB'"
msgid "%1 %2 %3"
msgstr "%1 %2 %3"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqFace.qml:44
msgctxt "@info:tooltip one band of an equaliser with no gain, 'Notch 60 Hz'"
msgid "%1 %2"
msgstr "%1 %2"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqFace.qml:47
msgctxt "@info:tooltip an equaliser with no band switched on"
msgid "No bands"
msgstr "バンドなし"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:18
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Shapes the tone of the sound with up to ten bands that you place yourself, "
"each lifting, cutting or filtering the sound around a frequency you choose."
msgstr "自分で配置する最大 10 個のバンドで音色を整えます。各バンドは、選んだ周波数の周辺で音を持ち上げたり、下げたり、フィルタをかけたりします。"

#. i18n: Hz stands for hertz, kHz for kilohertz.
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Every sound is a mix of low and high pitches. Their frequency is counted in "
"hertz (Hz), vibrations a second: a deep bass is around 50 Hz, a voice mostly "
"between 100 Hz and 4000 Hz, and the hiss of a cymbal near 10 000 Hz, or 10 "
"kHz. An equaliser, EQ for short, makes some of those frequencies louder or "
"quieter."
msgstr ""
"どんな音も、低い音と高い音が混ざってできています。その高さ（周波数）は、1 秒あたりの振動の回数を表すヘルツ（Hz）で数えます。深い低音は 50 Hz "
"前後、声はおもに 100 Hz から 4000 Hz、シンバルのシャーという音は 10000 Hz（10 kHz）近くです。イコライザー（略して "
"EQ）は、こうした周波数の一部を大きくしたり小さくしたりします。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Each band works on one part of that range. You choose where it is, how wide "
"it is, and how much it lifts or cuts. The curve at the top shows what all the"
" bands do together: up is louder, down is quieter, from 20 Hz at the left to "
"20 kHz at the right."
msgstr ""
"各バンドはその範囲の一部に働きます。位置、幅、どれだけ持ち上げるか下げるかを自分で決めます。上部のカーブは、すべてのバンドを合わせた効果を示します。上が大きく、下が小さく、左端が"
" 20 Hz、右端が 20 kHz です。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Each band has a round handle on the curve. Drag it sideways to move the "
"band's frequency, and up or down to change its gain. Turn the mouse wheel "
"over a handle to make the band narrower or wider."
msgstr ""
"各バンドには、カーブ上に丸いハンドルがあります。左右にドラッグするとバンドの周波数が、上下にドラッグするとゲインが変わります。ハンドルの上でマウスホイールを回すと、バンドの幅を狭くしたり広くしたりできます。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"While the session runs, the sound leaving the block is drawn faintly behind "
"the curve, so you can see where its low and high parts are."
msgstr "セッションの実行中は、ブロックから出ていく音がカーブの後ろに薄く描かれるので、音の低い部分と高い部分がどこにあるかがわかります。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:28
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"A new block has three bands, at 100 Hz, 1 kHz and 8 kHz, all at 0 dB, so it "
"changes nothing until you move one. Every change glides in, and a band that "
"is added, removed or changed in type fades, so nothing clicks. The block adds"
" no delay."
msgstr ""
"新しいブロックには 100 Hz、1 kHz、8 kHz の 3 つのバンドがあり、どれも 0 dB "
"なので、動かすまで何も変わりません。変更はすべてなめらかに反映され、バンドの追加、削除、種類の変更もフェードで切り替わるので、クリックノイズは出ません。このブロックは遅延を加えません。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:38
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:437
msgctxt "@title:group the Parametric EQ's bands, one to pick"
msgid "Bands"
msgstr "バンド"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"A button for each band, named by its frequency, from low to high. Click one "
"to pick that band; the settings below are the picked band's. Clicking or "
"dragging a handle on the curve picks its band too. A band that is switched "
"off is drawn faded."
msgstr ""
"バンドごとのボタンで、周波数の名前が付き、低いほうから順に並びます。クリックするとそのバンドが選ばれ、下の設定は選んだバンドのものになります。カーブ上のハンドルをクリックまたはドラッグしても、そのバンドが選ばれます。オフにしたバンドは薄く表示されます。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:46
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:471
msgctxt "@action:button add a band to a Parametric EQ"
msgid "Add Band"
msgstr "バンドを追加"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:48
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:484
msgctxt "@action:button remove the selected band from a Parametric EQ"
msgid "Delete Band"
msgstr "バンドを削除"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:51
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Add Band adds a bell at 0 dB in the middle of the widest stretch of the curve"
" with no band in it, and picks it. There can be ten bands at most."
msgstr "「バンドを追加」は、カーブ上でバンドのない最も広い区間の真ん中に 0 dB のベルを追加し、それを選びます。バンドは最大 10 個までです。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:52
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid "Delete Band removes the picked band."
msgstr "「バンドを削除」は選んだバンドを削除します。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:58
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:509
msgctxt "@label:listbox the type of a Parametric EQ band"
msgid "Type"
msgstr "種類"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:60
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid "What the band does to the sound around its frequency:"
msgstr "バンドがその周波数の周辺の音に何をするかです:"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:63
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block, a type of band"
msgid ""
"Bell: lifts or cuts a range of frequencies around the band's frequency, as "
"much as its gain says. What a new band is."
msgstr "「ベル」: バンドの周波数の周辺の範囲を、ゲインの分だけ持ち上げたり下げたりします。新しいバンドはこの種類です。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:64
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block, a type of band"
msgid ""
"Low shelf: lifts or cuts everything below the frequency, for more or less "
"bass."
msgstr "「ローシェルフ」: 周波数より下をすべて持ち上げたり下げたりして、低音を増やしたり減らしたりします。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:65
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block, a type of band"
msgid ""
"High shelf: lifts or cuts everything above the frequency, for more or less "
"treble."
msgstr "「ハイシェルフ」: 周波数より上をすべて持ち上げたり下げたりして、高音を増やしたり減らしたりします。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:66
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block, a type of band"
msgid ""
"Low-pass: keeps what is below the frequency and takes away more and more of "
"what is above it."
msgstr "「ローパス」: 周波数より下を残し、それより上は高くなるほど大きく取り除きます。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:67
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block, a type of band"
msgid ""
"High-pass: keeps what is above the frequency and takes away more and more of "
"what is below it, such as rumble."
msgstr "「ハイパス」: 周波数より上を残し、それより下（低いうなりなど）は低くなるほど大きく取り除きます。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block, a type of band"
msgid ""
"Notch: takes out a narrow range around the frequency almost completely, such "
"as a whistle."
msgstr "「ノッチ」: 周波数の周辺の狭い範囲（ピーという音など）をほぼ完全に取り除きます。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:69
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block, a type of band"
msgid ""
"Band-pass: keeps only a range around the frequency, as a telephone does."
msgstr "「バンドパス」: 電話の音のように、周波数の周辺の範囲だけを残します。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:72
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Only a bell and the shelves have a gain. The others leave Gain unavailable, "
"and their handle stays on the 0 dB line."
msgstr "ゲインがあるのはベルとシェルフだけです。それ以外の種類では「ゲイン」は使えず、ハンドルは 0 dB の線上にとどまります。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:78
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:533
msgctxt "@option:check a Parametric EQ band is switched on"
msgid "Band on"
msgstr "バンド有効"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:80
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"The switch beside Type turns the picked band off and on again, keeping its "
"settings. Use it to hear the sound with and without the band."
msgstr "「種類」の横のスイッチで、選んだバンドを設定を保ったままオフ・オンできます。バンドがあるときとないときの音を聞き比べるのに使ってください。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:86
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:549
msgctxt "@label:slider a Parametric EQ band's frequency"
msgid "Frequency"
msgstr "周波数"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:88
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Where the band is, from 20 Hz to 20 kHz. The slider moves by octaves rather "
"than by hertz, as the ear hears pitch, so the low end has as much room as the"
" high."
msgstr ""
"バンドの位置で、20 Hz から 20 kHz "
"までです。耳が音の高さを感じるのと同じように、スライダーはヘルツ単位ではなくオクターブ単位で動くので、低い側にも高い側と同じだけの幅があります。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:94
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:586
msgctxt "@label:slider a Parametric EQ band's gain"
msgid "Gain"
msgstr "ゲイン"

#. i18n: dB stands for decibels.
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:97
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"How much a bell or a shelf lifts or cuts, in decibels (dB), from −18 dB to "
"+18 dB. 0 dB changes nothing, +6 dB is about twice the strength and −6 dB "
"about half."
msgstr ""
"ベルやシェルフがどれだけ持ち上げるか下げるかで、単位はデシベル（dB）、−18 dB から +18 dB までです。0 dB では何も変わらず、+6 dB"
" で強さが約 2 倍、−6 dB で約半分になります。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:103
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:621
msgctxt "@label:slider how narrow a Parametric EQ band is"
msgid "Q"
msgstr "Q"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:105
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"How narrow the band is, from 0.1 to 18. A new band has 1. Higher is narrower:"
" a high Q picks out a single note or a whistle, a low Q changes a broad part "
"of the sound gently."
msgstr ""
"バンドの狭さで、0.1 から 18 までです。新しいバンドでは 1 です。値が大きいほど狭くなります。高い Q では 1 "
"つの音程やピーという音だけを狙え、低い Q では音の広い範囲をゆるやかに変えます。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:106
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"For the shelves and the pass filters it shapes the bend where they start: "
"around 0.7 is smooth, and higher adds a small bump just before it."
msgstr ""
"シェルフやパスフィルタでは、効き始めの曲がり具合を決めます。0.7 前後でなめらかになり、それより大きいと、その直前に小さな盛り上がりができます。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:113
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"A voice sounds muddy, boomy or harsh, and you want to fix just that part."
msgstr "声がこもったり、ボワついたり、きつく聞こえたりして、その部分だけを直したいとき。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:114
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid "A steady whistle or ring needs taking out without dulling the rest."
msgstr "鳴り続けるピーという音やキーンという音を、ほかの音をこもらせずに取り除きたいとき。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:115
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid "The bass rumbles from handling the microphone, or traffic outside."
msgstr "マイクに触れたときのノイズや外の交通の音で、低音にうなりが入るとき。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:116
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Your speakers or headphones have too much or too little of something, and you"
" want to even them out."
msgstr "スピーカーやヘッドホンで一部の音が強すぎたり弱すぎたりして、それを均したいとき。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:123
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"To find a problem, raise a narrow bell by 10 dB or so and sweep it slowly "
"left and right. Where the problem gets loudest, stop, then pull the gain down"
" below 0 dB."
msgstr ""
"問題の箇所を探すには、狭いベルを 10 dB ほど持ち上げ、ゆっくり左右に動かします。問題の音が最も大きくなったところで止め、ゲインを 0 dB "
"より下に下げてください。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:124
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Cut more than you lift. Taking away what is wrong usually sounds better than "
"adding more of everything else, and keeps the sound from getting too loud."
msgstr ""
"持ち上げるより下げることを多くしてください。ほかのすべてを足すより、問題のある部分を取り除くほうがふつうはよく聞こえ、音が大きくなりすぎるのも防げます。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:125
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"A high-pass around 80 Hz clears rumble from most voices without changing how "
"they sound."
msgstr "80 Hz 前後のハイパスで、たいていの声は聞こえ方を変えずに低いうなりを取り除けます。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:126
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Switch a band off and on again with Band on to check that it still helps."
msgstr "「バンド有効」でバンドをオフにしてからまたオンにして、まだ役に立っているかを確かめてください。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:372
msgctxt "@info a Parametric EQ band's handle, 'Bell at 250 Hz'"
msgid "%1 at %2"
msgstr "%2 の%1"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:456
msgctxt "@action:button pick a Parametric EQ band, 'Bell at 250 Hz'"
msgid "%1 at %2"
msgstr "%2 の%1"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:498
msgctxt "@label:listbox the type of a Parametric EQ band"
msgid "Type:"
msgstr "種類:"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:539
msgctxt "@label:slider a Parametric EQ band's frequency"
msgid "Frequency:"
msgstr "周波数:"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:574
msgctxt "@label:slider a Parametric EQ band's gain"
msgid "Gain:"
msgstr "ゲイン:"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:610
msgctxt "@label:slider how narrow a Parametric EQ band is"
msgid "Q:"
msgstr "Q:"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsFace.qml:59
msgctxt "@info the loudest side, in decibels below full scale"
msgid "%1 dB"
msgstr "%1 dB"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsFace.qml:61 blocks/vumeter/ui/VuFace.qml:46
msgctxt "@info nothing is running"
msgid "Idle"
msgstr "待機中"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:17
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"Shows how loud the sound is at this point of a lane, for the left side and "
"the right. It only measures: the sound passes through unchanged."
msgstr "レーン上のこの地点で、音がどれだけ大きいかを左右それぞれ表示します。測るだけで、音はそのまま通ります。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"Each side has a bar that moves with the sound while the session runs. Two "
"things are measured at once."
msgstr "左右それぞれに、セッションの実行中は音に合わせて動くバーがあります。2 つのものを同時に測っています。"

#. i18n: RMS stays in Latin letters in most languages; the paragraph explains
#. it.
#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"The solid part of the bar is the RMS level: the average strength of the sound"
" over the last three tenths of a second. RMS is short for root mean square, a"
" way of averaging that follows how loud the sound feels."
msgstr ""
"バーの塗りつぶされた部分は RMS レベルで、直近 0.3 秒間の音の平均的な強さです。RMS "
"は「二乗平均平方根」を表す英語の略で、音の感じられる大きさに沿った平均の取り方です。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"The paler part above it reaches up to the peak: the loudest single moment. "
"Peaks show sudden sounds, such as a drum hit or a plosive, that the average "
"hides."
msgstr ""
"その上の薄い色の部分は、ピーク、つまり最も大きな一瞬まで伸びます。ピークは、ドラムの一打や破裂音のように、平均では隠れてしまう突然の音を示します。"

#. i18n: dB stands for decibels.
#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"The scale between the bars is in decibels (dB), from 0 at the top down to "
"−60. 0 dB is full scale, the loudest a digital signal can be. Every 6 dB "
"lower is about half the signal's strength."
msgstr ""
"バーの間の目盛りはデシベル（dB）で、上端の 0 から下の −60 までです。0 dB はフルスケール、つまりデジタル信号が出せる最大の大きさです。6 "
"dB 下がるごとに、信号の強さは約半分になります。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:28
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid "The top 6 dB of each bar are red. Sound up there is close to the limit."
msgstr "各バーの上の 6 dB は赤色です。そこに達する音は限界に近づいています。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:29
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"A thin line marks the highest recent peak. It waits there for as long as Hold"
" peaks says, then sinks back at 20 dB a second."
msgstr ""
"細い線が、最近の最も高いピークを示します。線は「ピークホールド」で決めた時間だけそこにとどまり、その後 1 秒に 20 dB の速さで下がります。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:30
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"The box above each side lights when that side reaches full scale. The sound "
"has probably been clipped there: the tops of its waves were cut off, which "
"you may hear as a crackle. The light stays on for a second and a half after "
"the last time, so you do not miss it; click it to put it out sooner."
msgstr ""
"各側の上にあるボックスは、その側がフルスケールに達すると点灯します。そこでは音がおそらくクリップしています。波の頂点が切り取られ、バリバリという音に聞こえることがあります。見逃さないように、最後に達してから"
" 1.5 秒間は点灯したままです。クリックすると、すぐに消せます。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:31
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"Point at a bar to read its held peak and its RMS as numbers, to a tenth of a "
"decibel."
msgstr "バーにマウスを重ねると、保持されたピークと RMS が 0.1 デシベル単位の数値で表示されます。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:41
#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:221
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Show peak bar"
msgstr "ピークバーを表示"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:43
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"Draws the paler part of each bar, the one that jumps up to every peak. Untick"
" it if that jumping distracts you: the bars then show the RMS level alone, "
"here, on the block's tile and in the system tray."
msgstr ""
"各バーの、ピークごとに跳ね上がる薄い色の部分を描きます。その動きが気になる場合はチェックを外してください。ここでも、ブロックのタイルでも、システムトレイでも、バーは"
" RMS レベルだけを表示するようになります。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:44
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"The peak line, the clip boxes and the numbers stay. A new block shows the "
"peak bar."
msgstr "ピークの線、クリップのボックス、数値は残ります。新しいブロックではピークバーが表示されます。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:50
#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:240
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:76
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:303
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:99
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:427 blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:60
#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:205
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Show in system tray"
msgstr "システムトレイに表示"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:52
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"Adds this meter to what you see when you click Reverblabr's icon in the "
"system tray. You can then keep an eye on the level with the main window "
"closed."
msgstr ""
"システムトレイの Reverblabr "
"アイコンをクリックしたときの表示に、このメーターを追加します。メインウィンドウを閉じたままでもレベルを確認できます。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:53
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid "It is off for a new block."
msgstr "新しいブロックではオフです。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:59
#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:262
#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:279
msgctxt "@label:listbox how long the peak line waits before falling"
msgid "Hold peaks"
msgstr "ピークホールド"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:61
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"How long the peak line waits at the loudest moment before it sinks. Click the"
" value to choose another."
msgstr "ピークの線が最も大きな瞬間の位置で、下がり始めるまでどれだけ待つかです。値をクリックすると、別の値を選べます。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:64
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block, one choice of Hold peaks"
msgid "Off: the line does not wait, and starts sinking at once."
msgstr "オフ: 線は待たずに、すぐに下がり始めます。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:65
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block, the choices of Hold peaks"
msgid ""
"1 second, 2 seconds or 5 seconds: the line waits that long. A new block waits"
" 2 seconds."
msgstr "1 秒、2 秒、5 秒: 線はその時間だけ待ちます。新しいブロックは 2 秒です。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:66
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block, one choice of Hold peaks"
msgid ""
"Until reset: the line stays at the loudest moment and never sinks. Choose "
"another setting to let it sink again."
msgstr "リセットまで: 線は最も大きな瞬間の位置にとどまり、下がりません。再び下がるようにするには、別の設定を選んでください。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:73
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid "To check that a source is reaching Reverblabr at all."
msgstr "音源がそもそも Reverblabr に届いているかを確かめるとき。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:74
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"To set a level before recording or streaming, so that it is loud enough and "
"never clips."
msgstr "録音や配信の前に、十分な大きさでクリップしないようにレベルを合わせるとき。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:75
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid "To see what a block changes: put one meter before it and one after it."
msgstr "あるブロックが何を変えるかを見るとき。そのブロックの前と後ろにメーターを 1 つずつ置きます。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:82
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid "For speech, aim for peaks that mostly stay out of the red."
msgstr "話し声では、ピークがほとんど赤に入らないようにしてください。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:83
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"Choose Until reset while you set a level, play the loudest part, and read "
"where the line stopped."
msgstr "レベルを合わせるときは「リセットまで」を選び、最も大きな部分を再生して、線が止まった位置を読み取ってください。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:84
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"If a clip box keeps lighting, turn down whatever comes before the meter until"
" it stays dark."
msgstr "クリップのボックスが何度も点灯する場合は、点灯しなくなるまで、メーターの前にあるものを下げてください。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:107
msgctxt ""
"@info:tooltip one side's held peak and its root mean square, 'Peak −12.0 dB, "
"RMS −15.0 dB'"
msgid "Peak %1, RMS %2"
msgstr "ピーク %1、RMS %2"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:114
msgctxt "@item the peak line does not wait at all, short"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "オフ"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:116
msgctxt "@item how long the peak line waits, short"
msgid "1 s"
msgstr "1 秒"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:118
msgctxt "@item how long the peak line waits, short"
msgid "2 s"
msgstr "2 秒"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:120
msgctxt "@item how long the peak line waits, short"
msgid "5 s"
msgstr "5 秒"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:122
msgctxt "@item the peak line never comes down, short"
msgid "Until reset"
msgstr "リセットまで"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:139
msgctxt "@info a level too quiet to put a number on"
msgid "—"
msgstr "—"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:141 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:74
msgctxt "@info a level in decibels below full scale"
msgid "%1 dB"
msgstr "%1 dB"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:193
#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:116
msgctxt "@info the left channel's meter"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:194
#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:117
msgctxt "@info the right channel's meter"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:224
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Draws the paler bar that jumps up to each peak above the RMS bar"
msgstr "RMS バーの上に、ピークごとに跳ね上がる薄い色のバーを描きます"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:245
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:305
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:429
#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:209
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Shows this meter when you click Reverblabr's icon in the system tray"
msgstr "システムトレイの Reverblabr アイコンをクリックしたときに、このメーターを表示します"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftFace.qml:82
msgctxt "@label what the number on a Pitch Shift tile is"
msgid "pitch"
msgstr "ピッチ"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftFace.qml:101
msgctxt "@label:slider how far the pitch is moved, in semitones"
msgid "Semitones"
msgstr "半音"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:18
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid "Makes a sound higher or lower without making it faster or slower."
msgstr "音を速くも遅くもせずに、高くしたり低くしたりします。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"Played faster, a recording gets higher; played slower, it gets lower. This "
"block changes only the pitch: words and music keep their speed."
msgstr "録音は速く再生すると高く、遅く再生すると低くなります。このブロックはピッチだけを変えるので、言葉や音楽の速さは変わりません。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"It cuts the sound into short overlapping pieces, a few hundredths of a second"
" each, and fits them back together at the new pitch. It is set up for speech."
" Small shifts sound the most natural; the further you move the pitch, the "
"more the joins can be heard."
msgstr ""
"音を、互いに重なる 100 "
"分の数秒ずつの短い断片に切り分け、新しいピッチでつなぎ直します。話し声向けに調整されています。変化が小さいほど自然に聞こえ、ピッチを大きく動かすほど、つなぎ目が聞こえやすくなります。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"To do that work, it holds the sound back by about six hundredths of a second,"
" whatever the setting."
msgstr "この処理のため、設定にかかわらず、音を約 100 分の 6 秒遅らせます。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"A new setting is heard a moment later: the block starts the new pitch beside "
"the old one and crosses over smoothly, so a change never clicks."
msgstr ""
"新しい設定は少し遅れて聞こえます。ブロックは古いピッチと並行して新しいピッチを始め、滑らかに切り替えるので、変更でクリック音が出ることはありません。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:36
#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:50
msgctxt "@label:slider how far the pitch is moved, in whole semitones"
msgid "Semitones"
msgstr "半音"

#. i18n: st stands for semitones, as the panel writes it.
#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"Moves the pitch in whole steps. A semitone is the step from one key of a "
"piano to the next, white or black; twelve of them make an octave. The number "
"is written in st, for semitones."
msgstr ""
"ピッチを半音単位で動かします。半音は、ピアノの鍵盤で白鍵か黒鍵かを問わず隣の鍵盤までの音程で、12 個で 1 "
"オクターブになります。数値の単位は「半音」です。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"The slider goes from −12, an octave down, to +12, an octave up. A new block "
"starts at 0, which leaves the pitch alone."
msgstr "スライダーは −12（1 オクターブ下）から +12（1 オクターブ上）までです。新しいブロックは 0 から始まり、ピッチは変わりません。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:46
#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:113
msgctxt "@label:slider fine tuning of the pitch, in hundredths of a semitone"
msgid "Cents"
msgstr "セント"

#. i18n: ct stands for cents, as the panel writes it.
#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"Fine tuning on top of the semitones. A cent is a hundredth of a semitone, "
"written ct. The slider goes from −100 to +100 in whole cents, and starts at "
"0."
msgstr ""
"半音に加えて行う微調整です。1 セントは半音の 100 分の 1 で、単位は「セント」です。スライダーは −100〜+100 の範囲を 1 "
"セント刻みで動き、0 から始まります。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:50
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"The line under the sliders adds the two up: with +3 semitones and +25 cents "
"it says the sound is moved by +3.25 st in all."
msgstr "スライダーの下の行には 2 つの合計が表示されます。+3 半音と +25 セントなら、合計で +3.25 半音動いたと表示されます。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:57
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"A recording was made on a machine that ran slightly fast or slow, and is out "
"of tune with everything else."
msgstr "わずかに速く、または遅く回る機械で録音されたため、ほかの音と音程が合わないとき。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"You want to sing or play along with a song in a key that suits you better."
msgstr "自分に合ったキーで、曲に合わせて歌ったり演奏したりしたいとき。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:59
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"You want a voice to sound different, deeper or brighter, for fun or to make "
"it harder to recognise."
msgstr "遊びのために、または誰の声かわかりにくくするために、声を低く、または明るく変えたいとき。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:66
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"For a voice, a few semitones either way already change it a lot. Try small "
"steps first."
msgstr "声の場合、上下に数半音動かすだけでも大きく変わります。まずは小さな段階で試してください。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:67
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"To tune one recording to another, set Semitones first, then move Cents slowly"
" until the two sound in tune together."
msgstr "ある録音を別の録音に合わせるには、まず「半音」を設定し、次に 2 つの音程が合って聞こえるまで「セント」をゆっくり動かしてください。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"Because the sound comes out a little late, do not use the block on your own "
"voice while you listen to yourself live: the delay is easy to notice."
msgstr "音が少し遅れて出るので、自分の声をリアルタイムで聞きながら、このブロックを自分の声に使わないでください。遅れがすぐにわかってしまいます。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:74
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Semitones"
msgstr "半音"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:95
msgctxt "@label the low end of the Pitch Shift's semitones"
msgid "An octave down"
msgstr "1 オクターブ下"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:102
msgctxt "@label the high end of the Pitch Shift's semitones"
msgid "An octave up"
msgstr "1 オクターブ上"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:137
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Cents"
msgstr "セント"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:156
msgctxt "@info the whole shift of a Pitch Shift, '+3.25 st'"
msgid "Moved by %1 in all"
msgstr "合計の移動量: %1"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:164
msgctxt "@info what the Pitch Shift block does"
msgid ""
"Moves the pitch up or down without the sound running faster or slower. A "
"semitone is one step on a piano; twelve are an octave. The sound comes out a "
"little late, and a change of pitch takes a moment to cross over."
msgstr ""
"音の速さを変えずに、ピッチを上げ下げします。半音はピアノの鍵盤 1 つ分で、12 個で 1 "
"オクターブです。音は少し遅れて出て、ピッチの変更が切り替わるまで少し時間がかかります。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftWords.qml:22
msgctxt "@label a shift upwards, as in +3"
msgid "+%1"
msgstr "+%1"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftWords.qml:23
msgctxt "@label a shift downwards, as in −3"
msgid "−%1"
msgstr "−%1"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginFace.qml:38
msgctxt "@label a plugin block with no plugin chosen yet"
msgid "Choose a plugin"
msgstr "プラグインを選択"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:65
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "This plugin has no window that can be shown here"
msgstr "このプラグインには、ここに表示できるウィンドウがありません"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:67
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "The plugin couldn't make its window"
msgstr "プラグインがウィンドウを作成できませんでした"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:69
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "The plugin's window closed when the plugin stopped"
msgstr "プラグインが停止したため、プラグインのウィンドウが閉じました"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:167
msgctxt "@action:button start a plugin that crashed again"
msgid "Restart"
msgstr "再起動"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:181
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox no plugin has been chosen for a plugin block"
msgid "Choose a plugin…"
msgstr "プラグインを選択…"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:183
msgctxt "@label:listbox which plugin a plugin block runs"
msgid "Plugin"
msgstr "プラグイン"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:203
msgctxt "@action:button show the plugin's own window"
msgid "Plugin Window"
msgstr "プラグインウィンドウ"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:204
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Shows the plugin's own controls in a window of their own"
msgstr "プラグイン独自のコントロールを専用のウィンドウに表示します"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:232
msgctxt "@label the presets that come with a plugin, or were saved for it"
msgid "Plugin presets:"
msgstr "プラグインのプリセット:"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:244
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox the plugin's settings match none of its presets"
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "カスタム"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:249
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Plugin preset"
msgstr "プラグインのプリセット"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:266
msgctxt "@action:button keep the plugin's settings as one of its own presets"
msgid "Save…"
msgstr "保存…"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:277
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Save Plugin Preset"
msgstr "プラグインのプリセットを保存"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:300
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Saved as the plugin's own preset, which other programs that use this plugin "
"can open too."
msgstr "プラグイン独自のプリセットとして保存します。このプラグインを使う他のプログラムでも開けます。"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:317
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Mono plugin on a stereo lane"
msgstr "ステレオレーンでのモノラルプラグイン"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:351
msgctxt ""
"@info:placeholder a plugin whose settings are not known on this machine"
msgid "This plugin's settings are not known here yet"
msgstr "このプラグインの設定は、このコンピュータではまだ不明です"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFace.qml:121
msgctxt "@info:status a recording light and its time, 'REC 00:12:04'"
msgid "REC %1"
msgstr "録音中 %1"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFace.qml:123
msgctxt "@info:status a paused recording and its time"
msgid "PAUSED %1"
msgstr "一時停止中 %1"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFace.qml:151
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:36
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:234
msgctxt "@action:button resume a paused recording"
msgid "Resume"
msgstr "再開"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFace.qml:152
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:35
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:235
msgctxt "@action:button pause a recording"
msgid "Pause"
msgstr "一時停止"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFace.qml:170
msgctxt "@action:button end this recording's file and start the next"
msgid "Split"
msgstr "分割"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFileName.qml:91
msgctxt "@label:textbox a recording's file name, tokens and all"
msgid "File name"
msgstr "ファイル名"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFileName.qml:123
msgctxt "@action:button %1 is a file-name token, 'Session'"
msgid "Add %1 to the file name"
msgstr "ファイル名に「%1」を追加"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFileName.qml:132
msgctxt "@info what the next recording's file will be called"
msgid "Next file: %1"
msgstr "次のファイル: %1"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:17
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Writes the sound that reaches it to a file while the session runs, and passes"
" the sound on unchanged."
msgstr "セッションの実行中に届いた音をファイルに書き込み、音自体はそのまま先へ送ります。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Put a Recorder anywhere in a lane. When you start the session, it starts a "
"file; when you stop the session, it finishes the file. The line at the top of"
" its settings says what it is doing, and for how long."
msgstr ""
"「レコーダー」はレーンのどこにでも置けます。セッションを実行するとファイルの書き込みを始め、セッションを停止するとファイルを仕上げます。設定の一番上の行に、いま何をしているかと、その経過時間が表示されます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"The sound also goes on through the block as it is, with no delay, so the lane"
" can carry on to your speakers after it. Several Recorders can take the same "
"sound, each writing a file of its own."
msgstr ""
"音はそのまま遅延なくブロックを通り抜けるので、その後ろでレーンをスピーカーまでつなげられます。複数の「レコーダー」で同じ音を受け取り、それぞれ別のファイルに書き込むこともできます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Most settings are read when a file starts. A change made while it records "
"takes effect with the next file."
msgstr "ほとんどの設定は、ファイルの開始時に読み込まれます。録音中に変更した内容は、次のファイルから反映されます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Your recordings are listed in the Files tab of the sidebar. Listen to them "
"there, or open one to rename it or change its tags."
msgstr "録音はサイドバーの「ファイル」タブに一覧表示されます。そこで再生したり、開いて名前を変更したりタグを編集したりできます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:30
msgctxt "@title a part of the Recorder's help page"
msgid "While it records"
msgstr "録音中の操作"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:38
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Stops writing for a while; Resume carries on in the same file. The time it "
"was paused is left out, and the two parts follow on from each other."
msgstr ""
"書き込みをしばらく止めます。「再開」を押すと、同じファイルに続けて書き込みます。一時停止していた時間は含まれず、前後の部分はそのままつながります。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:44
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:250
msgctxt "@action:button end this recording's file and start the next"
msgid "Split file"
msgstr "ファイルを分割"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:46
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Finishes the file it is writing and starts the next one at once, with nothing"
" lost in between. Use it to start a new song, a new speaker or a new chapter."
msgstr ""
"書き込み中のファイルを閉じ、すぐに次のファイルを始めます。その間に失われる音はありません。新しい曲、新しい話し手、新しい章を始めるときに使います。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:51
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:269
msgctxt "@title:tab a Recorder's settings"
msgid "General"
msgstr "一般"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:56
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:298
msgctxt "@label a recording's file name"
msgid "File name"
msgstr "ファイル名"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"What each file is called. Type your own words, and add pieces that are filled"
" in when the file starts, with the buttons under the box:"
msgstr "各ファイルの名前です。好きな言葉を入力し、ボックスの下のボタンで、ファイルの開始時に値が入る部品を追加できます:"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:61
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a piece of a file name"
msgid "Session: the session's name."
msgstr "セッション: セッションの名前です。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:62
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Recorder block, a piece of a file name; keep the date "
"as it is"
msgid "Date: the day, written year first, such as 2026-09-25."
msgstr "日付: 年から始まる日付で、たとえば 2026-09-25 のようになります。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:63
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Recorder block, a piece of a file name; keep the time "
"as it is"
msgid ""
"Time: the time of day, such as 14-03-22. Hyphens rather than colons, which "
"many memory sticks refuse in a name."
msgstr ""
"時刻: その日の時刻で、たとえば 14-03-22 のようになります。多くの USB "
"メモリは名前にコロンを使えないため、コロンではなくハイフンで区切ります。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:64
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a piece of a file name"
msgid "Counter: a number that counts up from 001, to keep names apart."
msgstr "連番: 001 から順に増える番号で、名前が重ならないようにします。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:65
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a piece of a file name"
msgid ""
"Block: the name you gave this Recorder. Without one, it is a short code "
"instead."
msgstr "ブロック: この「レコーダー」に付けた名前です。名前がない場合は、代わりに短いコードになります。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"The line under the box shows what the next file will be called. A new "
"Recorder names its files after the session, the date and the time."
msgstr "ボックスの下の行に、次のファイルの名前が表示されます。新しい「レコーダー」は、セッション、日付、時刻からファイル名を付けます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:69
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"A recording never replaces a file that is already there. When a name is "
"taken, a number in brackets is added after it, such as (2)."
msgstr "録音が既存のファイルを置き換えることはありません。名前がすでに使われている場合は、(2) のように括弧付きの番号が後ろに付きます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:75
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:320
msgctxt "@label the folder recordings go to"
msgid "Save to"
msgstr "保存先"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:77
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:354
msgctxt "@action:button choose the folder recordings go to"
msgid "Choose Folder…"
msgstr "フォルダを選択…"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:78
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:367
msgctxt "@action:button open the folder recordings go to in the file manager"
msgid "Show in File Manager"
msgstr "ファイルマネージャで表示"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:81
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"The folder the files go to. Left empty, it is a folder called Reverblabr in "
"your Music folder; the box shows which in grey."
msgstr ""
"ファイルの保存先フォルダです。空のままにすると、「音楽」フォルダ内の Reverblabr "
"というフォルダになります。実際のフォルダはボックスに灰色で表示されます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:82
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"The folder button next to it lets you pick another folder, and the button "
"after it opens the folder in your file manager."
msgstr "隣のフォルダボタンで別のフォルダを選べます。その次のボタンを押すと、ファイルマネージャでフォルダを開きます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:88
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:380
msgctxt "@label:listbox how good a recording is, and how big"
msgid "Quality"
msgstr "品質"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:90
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"The easy way to choose how the file is made. Each choice sets the format and "
"its details together, and the line under the list says what you get:"
msgstr "ファイルの作り方を手軽に選ぶ方法です。どの選択肢も形式とその詳細をまとめて設定し、リストの下の行にその内容が表示されます:"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:93
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a recording quality"
msgid "Voice: small files for speech, in one channel."
msgstr "声: 話し声向けの小さなファイルで、1 チャンネルです。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:94
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a recording quality"
msgid "Standard MP3: good for most listening."
msgstr "標準 MP3: たいていの鑑賞に向いています。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:95
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a recording quality"
msgid ""
"High-quality MP3: what a new Recorder uses. It sounds as good as MP3 gets for"
" most ears, and plays anywhere."
msgstr "高品質 MP3: 新しい「レコーダー」が使う設定です。たいていの耳には MP3 として最高の音質に聞こえ、どこでも再生できます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:96
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a recording quality"
msgid "High-quality AAC: smaller than MP3 for the same sound."
msgstr "高品質 AAC: 同じ音質なら MP3 より小さくなります。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:97
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a recording quality"
msgid "Lossless: every bit of the sound kept, in about half the space."
msgstr "ロスレス: 音を 1 ビットも失わずに、約半分のサイズに収めます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:98
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a recording quality"
msgid ""
"Uncompressed: every bit kept, in the biggest files, for editing afterwards."
msgstr "非圧縮: すべてのビットをそのまま保つので、ファイルは最も大きくなります。後で編集する場合に向いています。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:104
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:423
msgctxt "@title:group a recording's format and its settings"
msgid "Format options"
msgstr "形式のオプション"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:106
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"The details Quality sets for you, to change one by one. Click the heading to "
"open them. Once you change one, Quality says Custom."
msgstr ""
"「品質」が設定する詳細を、1 つずつ変更できます。見出しをクリックすると開きます。どれか 1 つでも変更すると、「品質」は「カスタム」になります。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:112
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:430
msgctxt "@label:listbox a recording's file format"
msgid "Format"
msgstr "形式"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:114
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid "The kind of file. They come in three families:"
msgstr "ファイルの種類です。3 つの系統があります:"

#. i18n: the format names are the same in every language.
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:118
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a family of formats"
msgid ""
"MP3, Opus, Ogg Vorbis and AAC make small files by leaving out details the ear"
" is unlikely to miss. This is called lossy compression."
msgstr "MP3、Opus、Ogg Vorbis、AAC は、耳が気付きにくい細部を省くことでファイルを小さくします。これを非可逆圧縮といいます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:119
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a family of formats"
msgid ""
"FLAC and ALAC keep every bit of the sound and still pack it smaller. This is "
"lossless compression."
msgstr "FLAC と ALAC は、音を 1 ビットも失わずに小さくまとめます。これを可逆圧縮（ロスレス圧縮）といいます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:120
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a family of formats"
msgid ""
"WAV and AIFF keep the sound as it is, uncompressed, in the biggest files."
msgstr "WAV と AIFF は、音を圧縮せずそのまま保つので、ファイルは最も大きくなります。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:123
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"AAC and ALAC are only offered when your system's audio libraries can write "
"them; a line under the options says so when they cannot. The other formats "
"always work."
msgstr ""
"AAC と ALAC "
"は、システムのオーディオライブラリが書き出せる場合にのみ選択できます。書き出せない場合は、オプションの下の行にそう表示されます。その他の形式はいつでも使えます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:124
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"An AIFF file cannot grow past 4 GB, so an AIFF recording starts a new file by"
" itself at 2 GB or after 24 hours."
msgstr ""
"AIFF ファイルは 4 GB を超えられないため、AIFF の録音は 2 GB に達するか 24 時間たつと、自動的に新しいファイルを始めます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:130
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:470
msgctxt "@label:listbox how many bits a second a recording keeps"
msgid "Bit rate"
msgstr "ビットレート"

#. i18n: kbps stands for kilobits per second.
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:137
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"For MP3, Opus, Ogg Vorbis and AAC: how much of the sound each second keeps, "
"from 32 to 320 kilobits a second (kbps). More sounds better and makes bigger "
"files. A new Recorder uses 256 kbps."
msgstr ""
"MP3、Opus、Ogg Vorbis、AAC の場合: 1 秒あたりにどれだけの情報を残すかで、32〜320 "
"キロビット毎秒（kbps）です。大きいほど音が良くなり、ファイルも大きくなります。新しい「レコーダー」は 256 kbps を使います。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:138
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"VBR, a variable bit rate, spends more on busy passages and less on quiet "
"ones; it is the usual choice. CBR, a constant bit rate, spends the same every"
" second, which some old players need. AAC always uses a constant rate."
msgstr ""
"VBR（可変ビットレート）は、込み入った部分に多く、静かな部分に少なく割り当てるもので、通常はこちらを選びます。CBR（固定ビットレート）は毎秒同じ量を使い、一部の古いプレーヤーではこちらが必要です。AAC"
" は常に固定ビットレートです。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:144
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:539
msgctxt "@label:listbox how many bits each sample of a recording keeps"
msgid "Bit depth"
msgstr "ビット深度"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:146
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"For WAV, AIFF, FLAC and ALAC: how finely each moment of the sound is "
"measured. 16-bit is CD quality. 24-bit, what a new Recorder uses, leaves room"
" for quiet recordings to be turned up later. 32-bit float can never clip in "
"the file, which helps if you edit it afterwards; FLAC and ALAC do not offer "
"it."
msgstr ""
"WAV、AIFF、FLAC、ALAC の場合: 音の各瞬間をどれだけ細かく測るかです。16 ビットは CD 品質です。新しい「レコーダー」が使う 24 "
"ビットなら、小さく録れた音を後で大きくする余裕があります。32 "
"ビット浮動小数点はファイル内で決してクリップしないので、後で編集するときに役立ちます。FLAC と ALAC では選べません。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:152
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:583
msgctxt "@label:listbox a recording's sample rate"
msgid "Sample rate"
msgstr "サンプルレート"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:154
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"How many times a second the sound is measured. Follow session, the choice for"
" a new Recorder, uses whatever rate the session runs at. 44.1 kHz is the rate"
" of a CD and 48 kHz that of video; 88.2 kHz and 96 kHz are for studio work."
msgstr ""
"1 秒間に音を何回測るかです。新しい「レコーダー」で選ばれている「セッションに従う」は、セッションが動作しているレートをそのまま使います。44.1 kHz"
" は CD、48 kHz はビデオのレートで、88.2 kHz と 96 kHz はスタジオ作業向けです。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:155
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"A rate other than the session's is converted as the file is written. Opus "
"cannot be 44.1 kHz, so an Opus file that follows a 44.1 kHz session is made "
"at 48 kHz."
msgstr ""
"セッションと異なるレートは、ファイルの書き込み時に変換されます。Opus は 44.1 kHz にできないため、44.1 kHz のセッションに従う "
"Opus ファイルは 48 kHz で作られます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:161
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:624
msgctxt "@label how many channels a recording has"
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "チャンネル"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:163
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:103
msgctxt "@item two channels in a recording"
msgid "Stereo"
msgstr "ステレオ"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:164
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:102
msgctxt "@item one channel in a recording"
msgid "Mono"
msgstr "モノラル"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:167
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Stereo keeps the left and the right side apart. Mono mixes the two into one "
"channel, which is all a voice needs and makes the file smaller."
msgstr "ステレオは左右を別々に保ちます。モノラルは左右を 1 チャンネルにまとめます。声にはこれで十分で、ファイルも小さくなります。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:172
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:270
msgctxt "@title:tab a Recorder's settings"
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "タグ"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:181
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:690
msgctxt "@label a recording's tag"
msgid "Disc"
msgstr "ディスク"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:182
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:691
msgctxt "@label a recording's tag, how many discs there are"
msgid "Of discs"
msgstr "ディスク数"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:186
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Tags are the details a music player shows about a file: its title, artist, "
"album, genre, year, track and disc numbers, and a comment. Whatever you fill "
"in here is written into each file when it is finished."
msgstr ""
"タグとは、タイトル、アーティスト、アルバム、ジャンル、年、トラック番号とディスク番号、コメントなど、音楽プレーヤーがファイルについて表示する情報です。ここに入力した内容は、各ファイルの完成時に書き込まれます。"

#. i18n: %session, %date, %year and %counter are typed as they are and must not
#. be translated.
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:188
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"The pieces of a file name work here too: type %session, %date, %year or "
"%counter. A Track of %counter numbers the files of a recording that was "
"split."
msgstr ""
"ファイル名の部品はここでも使えます: %session、%date、%year、%counter のいずれかを入力してください。「トラック」を "
"%counter にすると、分割された録音のファイルに順に番号が付きます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:193
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:271
msgctxt "@title:tab a Recorder's settings"
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "制限"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:195
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Rules for when a recording splits into files or stops by itself. Each is off "
"until you tick it."
msgstr "録音を自動的に複数のファイルに分割したり停止したりする条件です。どれもチェックを入れるまではオフです。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:201
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:753
msgctxt "@option:check followed by a number and a unit"
msgid "Start a new file every"
msgstr "新しいファイルを開始する間隔"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:202
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:801
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:866
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Unit"
msgstr "単位"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:204
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Splits a long recording into files of the same length, in minutes or hours, "
"or of the same size, in megabytes (MB). Nothing is lost between two files. "
"When you tick it, it starts at 30 minutes."
msgstr ""
"長い録音を、分または時間で決めた同じ長さのファイル、またはメガバイト（MB）で決めた同じサイズのファイルに分割します。ファイルの間で失われる音はありません。チェックを入れると、30"
" 分から始まります。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:210
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:819
msgctxt "@option:check followed by a number and a unit"
msgid "End the recording after"
msgstr "録音を終了するまでの時間"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:212
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Stops the recording by itself after so many minutes or hours of it, counted "
"across all its files and not while it is paused. When you tick it, it starts "
"at 1 hour. The session goes on running; the line at the top then says the "
"recording stopped at its time limit."
msgstr ""
"録音が指定した分数または時間数に達すると、自動的に停止します。時間はすべてのファイルを通して数え、一時停止中は数えません。チェックを入れると、1 "
"時間から始まります。セッションは実行を続け、上部の行に「制限時間により停止」と表示されます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:218
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:889
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Act on silence"
msgstr "無音時に処理する"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:220
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:910
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "What silence does"
msgstr "無音時の処理"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:221
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:940
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Seconds of silence"
msgstr "無音の秒数"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:224
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Tick the box at the start of the row to do something once the sound has been "
"silent for a while. Choose what in the list, and how many seconds of silence "
"it waits for in the box after it: 2 seconds for a new Recorder."
msgstr ""
"音がしばらく無音になったときに何かをさせるには、行の先頭のボックスにチェックを入れます。何をするかをリストで選び、何秒の無音を待つかをその後ろのボックスで指定します。新しい「レコーダー」では"
" 2 秒です。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:227
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a choice of what silence does"
msgid ""
"Remove silence: the silence after those seconds is left out of the file, "
"until sound comes back."
msgstr "無音を削除: その秒数を過ぎた無音は、音が戻るまでファイルから省かれます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:228
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a choice of what silence does"
msgid ""
"Split on silence: the file ends after those seconds, and the next one starts "
"when sound comes back. Good for recording songs from a playlist into a file "
"each."
msgstr ""
"無音で分割: その秒数がたつとファイルが終わり、音が戻ると次のファイルが始まります。プレイリストの曲を 1 曲ずつ別のファイルに録音するのに向いています。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:229
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a choice of what silence does"
msgid "Stop on silence: the recording ends after those seconds."
msgstr "無音で停止: その秒数がたつと録音が終わります。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:235
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:962
msgctxt "@label:slider the level below which a recording counts as silent"
msgid "Silence below"
msgstr "無音とみなすレベル"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:236
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:972
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Silence threshold"
msgstr "無音のスレッショルド"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:238
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"How quiet the sound must be, on every channel, to count as silence: from −96 "
"dB, near-total silence, to −20 dB, which takes in a fair amount of background"
" noise. A new Recorder uses −60 dB."
msgstr ""
"すべてのチャンネルで音がどれだけ小さければ無音とみなすかです。−96 dB（ほぼ完全な無音）から −20 "
"dB（かなりの背景ノイズまで含む）まで設定できます。新しい「レコーダー」は −60 dB を使います。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:239
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"If the hiss of a quiet room keeps your recording from ever counting as "
"silent, move the slider to the right."
msgstr "静かな部屋のサーッというノイズのせいで録音がいつまでも無音とみなされない場合は、スライダーを右に動かしてください。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:246
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid "Recording a call, a lesson or a podcast from the programs that play it."
msgstr "通話、授業、ポッドキャストを、それを再生しているプログラムから録音するとき。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:247
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Recording a microphone, with the blocks that clean it up placed before the "
"Recorder."
msgstr "マイクを録音するとき。音をきれいにするブロックは「レコーダー」の前に置きます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:248
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Keeping a long broadcast as a file every hour, or recording music into a file"
" a song."
msgstr "長い放送を 1 時間ごとのファイルにして残したり、音楽を 1 曲ずつファイルに録音したりするとき。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:255
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Put a Peak/RMS meter just before the Recorder and check the level before you "
"start."
msgstr "「レコーダー」の直前に「ピーク/RMS」メーターを置き、始める前にレベルを確認してください。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:256
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Choose Voice for speech you only need to listen to again, and Lossless or "
"Uncompressed for anything you will edit."
msgstr "聞き直すだけの話し声には「声」を、編集するものには「ロスレス」か「非圧縮」を選んでください。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:257
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"If Reverblabr or the computer stops suddenly, the file still plays up to the "
"last few seconds, and Reverblabr restores the rest the next time it starts."
msgstr ""
"Reverblabr やコンピュータが突然止まっても、ファイルは最後の数秒前まで再生でき、残りは次回の起動時に Reverblabr が復元します。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:258
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid "Before you record anyone but yourself, ask them first."
msgstr "自分以外の人を録音するときは、先に本人の了承を得てください。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:336
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Save to"
msgstr "保存先"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:482
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:490
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:110
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:134
msgctxt "@item a recording's bit rate"
msgid "%1 kbps"
msgstr "%1 kbps"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:514
msgctxt "@action:button a bit rate that varies with the sound"
msgid "VBR"
msgstr "VBR"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:524
msgctxt "@action:button the same bit rate all the way through"
msgid "CBR"
msgstr "CBR"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:557
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Bit depth"
msgstr "ビット深度"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:598
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Sample rate"
msgstr "サンプルレート"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:663
msgctxt "@info %2 are formats, 'AAC and ALAC'; %3 is the reason"
msgid "%2 isn't offered: %3."
msgid_plural "%2 aren't offered: %3."
msgstr[0] "%2 は利用できません: %3。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:665
msgctxt "@info the word between two formats"
msgid " and "
msgstr " と "

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:737
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "The file-name tokens work here too: %session, %date, %year, %counter."
msgstr "ファイル名のトークンはここでも使えます: %session、%date、%year、%counter。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:781
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Start a new file every"
msgstr "新しいファイルを開始する間隔"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:847
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "End the recording after"
msgstr "録音を終了するまでの時間"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:925
msgctxt "@label followed by a number of seconds"
msgid "after"
msgstr "待ち時間"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:951
msgctxt "@label after a number"
msgid "seconds"
msgstr "秒"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:984
msgctxt "@item a level in decibels"
msgid "%1 dB"
msgstr "%1 dB"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:992
msgctxt "@info the silence threshold at its digital end"
msgid "Only digital silence — nothing but zeros — counts."
msgstr "デジタル上の完全な無音（値がすべてゼロ）だけが無音とみなされます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:993
msgctxt "@info the silence threshold"
msgid "Anything quieter than this on every channel counts as silence."
msgstr "すべてのチャンネルでこれより小さい音は、無音とみなされます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:1000
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Choose Where Recordings Go"
msgstr "録音の保存先を選択"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:70
msgctxt "@item a recording format"
msgid "WAV"
msgstr "WAV"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:72
msgctxt "@item a recording format"
msgid "AIFF"
msgstr "AIFF"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:74
msgctxt "@item a recording format"
msgid "FLAC"
msgstr "FLAC"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:76
msgctxt "@item a recording format"
msgid "MP3"
msgstr "MP3"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:78
msgctxt "@item a recording format"
msgid "Opus"
msgstr "Opus"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:80
msgctxt "@item a recording format"
msgid "Ogg Vorbis"
msgstr "Ogg Vorbis"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:82
msgctxt "@item a recording format"
msgid "AAC"
msgstr "AAC"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:84
msgctxt "@item a recording format, Apple's lossless codec"
msgid "ALAC"
msgstr "ALAC"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:92
msgctxt "@item bits a sample in a recording"
msgid "16-bit"
msgstr "16 ビット"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:94
msgctxt "@item bits a sample in a recording"
msgid "24-bit"
msgstr "24 ビット"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:96
msgctxt "@item a recording's samples as 32-bit floating point"
msgid "32-bit float"
msgstr "32 ビット浮動小数点"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:112
msgctxt "@item a recording's bit rate, varying with the sound"
msgid "%1 kbps · VBR"
msgstr "%1 kbps · VBR"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:118
msgctxt "@item the session's own sample rate, %1 in kHz"
msgid "Follow session (%1 kHz)"
msgstr "セッションに従う（%1 kHz）"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:120
msgctxt "@item the session's own sample rate"
msgid "Follow session"
msgstr "セッションに従う"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:122
msgctxt "@item a sample rate, %1 in kHz"
msgid "%1 kHz"
msgstr "%1 kHz"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:136
msgctxt "@info how a Recorder records, '256 kbps · Stereo'"
msgid "%1 · %2"
msgstr "%1 · %2"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:149
msgctxt "@item a recording quality"
msgid "Voice"
msgstr "声"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:151
msgctxt "@item a recording quality"
msgid "Standard MP3"
msgstr "標準 MP3"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:153
msgctxt "@item a recording quality"
msgid "High-quality MP3"
msgstr "高品質 MP3"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:155
msgctxt "@item a recording quality"
msgid "High-quality AAC"
msgstr "高品質 AAC"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:157
msgctxt "@item a recording quality"
msgid "Lossless"
msgstr "ロスレス"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:159
msgctxt "@item a recording quality"
msgid "Uncompressed"
msgstr "非圧縮"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:161
msgctxt "@item a recording quality set by hand"
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "カスタム"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:168
msgctxt "@info a recording quality"
msgid "Opus, 48 kbps, mono: speech, and small files."
msgstr "Opus、48 kbps、モノラル: 話し声向けで、ファイルが小さくなります。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:170
msgctxt "@info a recording quality"
msgid "MP3, 192 kbps variable: good for most listening."
msgstr "MP3、192 kbps 可変: たいていの鑑賞に向いています。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:173
msgctxt "@info a recording quality"
msgid ""
"MP3, 256 kbps variable: as good as MP3 gets for most ears, and plays "
"anywhere."
msgstr "MP3、256 kbps 可変: たいていの耳には MP3 として最高の音質で、どこでも再生できます。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:175
msgctxt "@info a recording quality"
msgid "AAC in M4A, 256 kbps: smaller than MP3 for the same sound."
msgstr "M4A 形式の AAC、256 kbps: 同じ音質なら MP3 より小さくなります。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:177
msgctxt "@info a recording quality"
msgid "FLAC, 24-bit: every sample kept, at about half the size."
msgstr "FLAC、24 ビット: すべてのサンプルを保ったまま、約半分のサイズになります。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:179
msgctxt "@info a recording quality"
msgid "WAV, 24-bit: every sample kept, for editing afterwards."
msgstr "WAV、24 ビット: すべてのサンプルをそのまま保ちます。後で編集する場合に向いています。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:181
msgctxt "@info a recording quality set by hand"
msgid "Set by hand, below."
msgstr "下の項目で手動で設定します。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:208
msgctxt "@info:status %1 is a format, 'MP3'"
msgid "Recording %1"
msgstr "%1 で録音中"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:210
msgctxt "@info:status a recording"
msgid "Paused"
msgstr "一時停止中"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:213
msgctxt "@info:status a recording that stopped by itself"
msgid "Stopped on silence"
msgstr "無音により停止"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:214
msgctxt "@info:status a recording that stopped by itself"
msgid "Stopped at its time limit"
msgstr "制限時間により停止"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:216
msgctxt "@info:status %1 is a format, 'MP3'"
msgid "Ready to record %1"
msgstr "%1 で録音準備完了"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:226
msgctxt "@action:button a file-name token, the session's name"
msgid "Session"
msgstr "セッション"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:228
msgctxt "@action:button a file-name token, today's date"
msgid "Date"
msgstr "日付"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:230
msgctxt "@action:button a file-name token, the time of day"
msgid "Time"
msgstr "時刻"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:232
msgctxt "@action:button a file-name token, a number counting up"
msgid "Counter"
msgstr "連番"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:234
msgctxt "@action:button a file-name token, the Recorder's own name"
msgid "Block"
msgstr "ブロック"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbFace.qml:41
msgctxt ""
"@info:tooltip a Reverb's settings, 'Decay 2.00 s, size 50 %, pre-delay 20 ms,"
" damping 40 %, width 100 %, 25 % mix'"
msgid "Decay %1, size %2, pre-delay %3, damping %4, width %5, %6 mix"
msgstr "残響時間 %1、広さ %2、プリディレイ %3、ダンピング %4、幅 %5、ミックス %6"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbFace.qml:94
msgctxt ""
"@label how loud a Reverb is against the original, on its tile: '25 % mix'"
msgid "%1 mix"
msgstr "ミックス %1"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbFace.qml:111 blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:55
#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbPanel.qml:145
msgctxt "@label:slider how long a Reverb's room rings"
msgid "Decay"
msgstr "残響時間"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:18
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"Makes the sound seem to be in a room, from a small booth to a large hall, by "
"adding the echoes a room would give it."
msgstr "部屋が生み出す反射音を加えることで、小さなブースから大きなホールまで、音が部屋の中で鳴っているように聞かせます。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"In a real room, a sound bounces off the walls, the floor and the ceiling. "
"Thousands of these echoes reach you, so close together that you hear them as "
"one ring that slowly dies away. That ring is called reverb, and it is what "
"tells the ear how big a place is."
msgstr ""
"実際の部屋では、音は壁、床、天井に跳ね返ります。何千もの反射音がごく短い間隔で届くので、ゆっくり消えていく 1 "
"つの響きとして聞こえます。この響きをリバーブ（残響）と呼び、耳はこれによって場所の広さを感じ取ります。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"This block makes such a ring from the sound that reaches it and mixes it in "
"behind the original. The original passes straight through, so the lane is not"
" delayed."
msgstr "このブロックは、届いた音からこのような響きを作り、元の音の後ろに混ぜます。元の音はそのまま通過するので、レーンが遅れることはありません。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"Every setting can be moved while the sound plays: each change glides in. A "
"change of Size takes a third of a second and bends the pitch of the ring a "
"little on the way, rather than clicking."
msgstr ""
"どの設定も音の再生中に動かせます: 変更はすべて滑らかに反映されます。「広さ」の変更には 3 分の 1 "
"秒かかり、その間、クリック音の代わりに響きのピッチが少し揺れます。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"The Presets list under the settings has three rooms to start from: Small "
"room, Hall and Plate, the bright, dense ring of a metal plate."
msgstr ""
"設定の下にある「プリセット」一覧には、出発点になる 3 つの部屋があります: 「小部屋」、「ホール」、そして金属板の明るく密な響きの「プレート」です。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:36 blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbPanel.qml:124
msgctxt "@label:slider how long a Reverb waits before its room is heard"
msgid "Pre-delay"
msgstr "プリディレイ"

#. i18n: ms stands for milliseconds.
#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"How long the room waits before it joins in, from 0 to 250 milliseconds (ms), "
"a quarter of a second. A new block uses 20 ms."
msgstr ""
"部屋の響きが加わり始めるまでの待ち時間で、0〜250 ミリ秒（ms）、つまり最大 4 分の 1 秒です。新しいブロックでは 20 ms を使います。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"A short wait keeps the original clear in front of the room, which helps "
"speech stay easy to follow. In a large real room the first echo also takes "
"longer to come back."
msgstr ""
"短い待ち時間があると、元の音が響きの手前ではっきり聞こえるので、話し声が聞き取りやすくなります。実際の広い部屋でも、最初の反射音が返ってくるまでには時間がかかります。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:46 blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbPanel.qml:135
msgctxt "@label:slider how big a Reverb's room is, from small to a hall"
msgid "Size"
msgstr "広さ"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"How big the room is, from 0 %, a small booth, to 100 %, a hall. A new block "
"starts at 50 %."
msgstr "部屋の広さで、0%（小さなブース）から 100%（ホール）までです。新しいブロックは 50% から始まります。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"Small rooms ring densely and close; large ones spread out. Size sets how the "
"ring sounds, not how long it lasts: that is Decay."
msgstr ""
"小さな部屋は密で近い響きになり、広い部屋は響きが広がります。「広さ」が決めるのは響きの質で、長さではありません: 長さは「残響時間」で決まります。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:57
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"How long the room rings after the sound stops, from a tenth of a second to 20"
" seconds. A new block uses 2 seconds."
msgstr "音が止んだ後に部屋が響き続ける長さで、0.1 秒から 20 秒までです。新しいブロックでは 2 秒を使います。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"It is the time the ring takes to fall to a thousandth of its strength, which "
"is close to silence. The slider gives short times as much room as long ones."
msgstr ""
"響きの強さが 1000 分の 1 に、つまりほぼ無音になるまでの時間です。スライダーでは、短い時間にも長い時間と同じだけの幅が割り当てられています。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:59
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"A longer decay does not make the reverb louder, only longer. Mix sets how "
"loud it is."
msgstr "残響時間を長くしてもリバーブは大きくならず、長くなるだけです。大きさは「ミックス」で決まります。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:65 blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbPanel.qml:157
msgctxt "@label:slider how much sooner the top of a Reverb's room fades"
msgid "Damping"
msgstr "ダンピング"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:67
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"How much sooner the high sounds of the ring fade than the low ones, the way "
"soft furnishings and air soak up the top. From 0 %, where the top rings as "
"long as the bottom, to 100 %, where it dies away ten times as fast. A new "
"block uses 40 %."
msgstr ""
"響きの高い音が低い音よりどれだけ早く消えるかで、布張りの家具や空気が高域を吸収するのと同じです。0%（高域も低域と同じ長さで響く）から 100%（高域が "
"10 倍の速さで消える）までです。新しいブロックでは 40% を使います。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"More damping gives a warmer, darker room; less gives a brighter one, like a "
"tiled bathroom."
msgstr "ダンピングを強くすると温かく暗い響きの部屋に、弱くするとタイル張りの浴室のような明るい響きの部屋になります。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:74 blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbPanel.qml:167
msgctxt ""
"@label:slider how wide a Reverb's room sounds, from the middle to both sides"
msgid "Width"
msgstr "幅"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:76
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"How far the ring spreads across the two speakers, from 0 %, all of it in the "
"middle, to 100 %, as wide as it goes. A new block uses 100 %."
msgstr ""
"響きが 2 つのスピーカーにどれだけ広がるかで、0%（すべて中央）から 100%（最大の広がり）までです。新しいブロックでは 100% を使います。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:77
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid "Width changes only the ring. The original keeps its own place."
msgstr "「幅」が変えるのは響きだけです。元の音は元の位置のままです。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:83 blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbPanel.qml:177
msgctxt "@label:slider how loud a Reverb is against the original"
msgid "Mix"
msgstr "ミックス"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:85
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"How much of what you hear is the room, from 0 %, the original alone, to 100 "
"%, the room alone. A new block uses 25 %."
msgstr "聞こえる音のうち、部屋の響きが占める割合で、0%（元の音だけ）から 100%（響きだけ）までです。新しいブロックでは 25% を使います。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:86
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"As the room gets louder, the original gets quieter by the same share. At 100 "
"% none of the original is left."
msgstr "響きが大きくなるにつれて、元の音は同じ割合だけ小さくなります。100% では元の音はまったく残りません。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:93
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid "A voice recorded close to the microphone sounds dry and boxed in."
msgstr "マイクの近くで録音した声が、響きがなく閉じこもったように聞こえるとき。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:94
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"Several sources recorded in different places should sound as if they were in "
"the same room."
msgstr "別々の場所で録音した複数の音源を、同じ部屋にいるように聞かせたいとき。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:95
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"You want a voice or an instrument to sound as if it were in a church, a hall "
"or a cave."
msgstr "声や楽器を、教会、ホール、洞窟の中にいるように聞かせたいとき。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:102
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid "Start from one of the presets, then change one setting at a time."
msgstr "まずプリセットのどれかから始めて、設定を 1 つずつ変えてください。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:103
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"For speech, keep Mix low, around 10 to 20 %, and Decay short: too much room "
"makes words hard to follow."
msgstr "話し声の場合は「ミックス」を 10〜20% 程度に低く、「残響時間」を短くしてください: 響きが多すぎると言葉が聞き取りにくくなります。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:104
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"If the reverb sounds harsh or hissy, raise Damping. If it sounds muddy, "
"shorten Decay."
msgstr ""
"リバーブが耳障りだったり、シャーという音が目立ったりする場合は「ダンピング」を上げてください。こもって聞こえる場合は「残響時間」を短くしてください。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbHelp.qml:105
msgctxt "@info help page of the Reverb block"
msgid ""
"Put the Reverb after blocks that clean up or even out the sound, such as a "
"filter or a compressor, so they work on the original and not on the ring."
msgstr ""
"「リバーブ」は、フィルタやコンプレッサーなど音を整えたり均一にしたりするブロックの後に置いてください。そうすれば、それらのブロックは響きではなく元の音に働きます。"

#: blocks/reverb/ui/ReverbPanel.qml:185
msgctxt "@info what the Reverb's settings do"
msgid ""
"Decay sets how long the room rings, Size how big it is, Damping how much "
"sooner its top fades, and Mix how loud it is against the original."
msgstr ""
"「残響時間」は部屋が響く長さ、「広さ」は部屋の大きさ、「ダンピング」は高域がどれだけ早く消えるか、「ミックス」は元の音に対する響きの大きさを決めます。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:18
msgctxt "@info help page of the Simple Compressor block"
msgid ""
"Evens out the level, so the loud moments are not so loud and the quiet ones "
"are easier to hear. You choose one mode instead of setting six numbers."
msgstr ""
"レベルをならして、大きな瞬間をそれほど大きくせず、小さな部分を聞き取りやすくします。6 つの数値を設定する代わりに、モードを 1 つ選ぶだけです。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Simple Compressor block"
msgid ""
"A compressor listens to how loud the sound is. When it rises above a set "
"level, the threshold, the compressor turns it down, and the further it goes "
"over, the more it turns it down. Below the threshold, it leaves the sound "
"alone."
msgstr ""
"コンプレッサーは音の大きさを聞いています。音が決められたレベル（スレッショルド）を超えるとコンプレッサーは音を下げ、超える量が大きいほど大きく下げます。スレッショルドより下では、音に手を加えません。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Simple Compressor block"
msgid ""
"With the loud moments held back, the whole sound is then turned up again a "
"little. The gap between loud and quiet is smaller, and quiet details come "
"forward."
msgstr "大きな瞬間を抑えたうえで、音全体を少し持ち上げ直します。大きい音と小さい音の差が縮まり、小さな細部が前に出てきます。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Simple Compressor block"
msgid ""
"Each mode is a set of numbers chosen to work well together, from barely "
"touching the sound to holding it very firmly. No mode makes a clean sound "
"clip: even the loudest input comes out at least 6 dB below full scale."
msgstr ""
"各モードは、互いにうまく働くように選ばれた数値の組み合わせで、音にほとんど触れないものから、とてもしっかり抑えるものまであります。どのモードでも、きれいな音をクリップさせることはありません。最も大きな入力でも、出力はフルスケールより少なくとも"
" 6 dB 下になります。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Simple Compressor block"
msgid ""
"The block's tile shows the mode, how hard it compresses and from which level."
" The sound is not delayed."
msgstr "ブロックのタイルには、モード、圧縮の強さ、圧縮が始まるレベルが表示されます。音は遅延しません。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:36
#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorPanel.qml:53
msgctxt "@label:listbox how firmly the Simple Compressor works"
msgid "Compressor mode"
msgstr "コンプレッサーモード"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:38
msgctxt "@info help page of the Simple Compressor block"
msgid ""
"How firmly the block works. The line under the list says what the chosen mode"
" is for. A new block starts in Gentle."
msgstr "ブロックがどれだけしっかり働くかです。リストの下の行に、選んだモードの用途が表示されます。新しいブロックは「穏やか」から始まります。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:41
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Simple Compressor block, one choice of Compressor mode"
msgid ""
"Off: the sound passes through exactly as it arrives. Switching between Off "
"and a mode glides, so it makes no jump."
msgstr "オフ: 音は届いたままの状態で通ります。「オフ」とモードの切り替えは滑らかに行われるので、音が急に変わることはありません。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:42
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Simple Compressor block, one choice of Compressor mode"
msgid ""
"Gentle: takes the edge off the loudest moments and is hard to hear working. "
"Good for music."
msgstr "穏やか: 最も大きな瞬間の角を取り、効いていることがほとんどわかりません。音楽に向いています。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:43
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Simple Compressor block, one choice of Compressor mode"
msgid ""
"Moderate: brings loud and quiet passages clearly closer together, for films "
"and games played at low volume."
msgstr "中程度: 大きな部分と小さな部分をはっきりと近づけます。小さな音量で楽しむ映画やゲーム向けです。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:44
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Simple Compressor block, one choice of Compressor mode"
msgid ""
"Heavy: holds the level firmly, so quiet details come up close to the loud "
"ones."
msgstr "強力: レベルをしっかり抑えるので、小さな細部が大きな部分の近くまで上がってきます。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:45
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Simple Compressor block, one choice of Compressor mode"
msgid ""
"Voice: keeps a voice steady and close. It reacts quickly enough to catch each"
" loud syllable, and lets go in time for the next."
msgstr "声: 声を安定させ、近くに聞こえるようにします。大きな音節を 1 つずつ捉えられるほどすばやく反応し、次の音節までには解放します。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:46
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Simple Compressor block, one choice of Compressor mode"
msgid ""
"Broadcast: dense and even, like a radio station. It works almost like a "
"limiter above its threshold."
msgstr "放送: ラジオ局のように密度が高く均一な音にします。スレッショルドより上では、ほぼリミッターのように働きます。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:52
#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorPanel.qml:99
msgctxt "@title:group the numbers a Simple Compressor mode sets"
msgid "Mode settings"
msgstr "モードの設定値"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:54
msgctxt "@info help page of the Simple Compressor block"
msgid ""
"Click the heading to see the numbers the chosen mode sets. They are there to "
"read, not to change:"
msgstr "見出しをクリックすると、選んだモードが設定する数値が表示されます。確認するためのもので、変更はできません:"

#. i18n: dB stands for decibels.
#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:58
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Simple Compressor block, one of the mode's numbers"
msgid ""
"Threshold: the level, in decibels (dB) below full scale, where compressing "
"starts."
msgstr "スレッショルド: 圧縮が始まるレベルで、フルスケールより下のデシベル（dB）で表します。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:59
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Simple Compressor block, one of the mode's numbers"
msgid ""
"Ratio: how hard the sound above the threshold is held back. At 4:1, a sound 4"
" dB over comes out only 1 dB over."
msgstr "レシオ: スレッショルドを超えた音をどれだけ強く抑えるかです。4:1 では、4 dB 超えた音が 1 dB 超えるだけになって出ていきます。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:60
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Simple Compressor block, one of the mode's numbers"
msgid ""
"Knee: how gradually compressing starts around the threshold. A wide knee "
"eases in, which is harder to hear."
msgstr "ニー: スレッショルド付近で圧縮がどれだけ緩やかに始まるかです。ニーが広いと徐々にかかり始めるので、気付かれにくくなります。"

#. i18n: ms stands for milliseconds.
#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:62
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Simple Compressor block, one of the mode's numbers"
msgid ""
"Attack: how quickly it turns the sound down when it gets loud, in "
"milliseconds (ms)."
msgstr "アタック: 音が大きくなったときに、どれだけ速く下げるかで、ミリ秒（ms）で表します。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:63
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Simple Compressor block, one of the mode's numbers"
msgid "Release: how quickly it lets the sound come back up once it is quieter."
msgstr "リリース: 音が小さくなった後、どれだけ速く元に戻すかです。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:64
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Simple Compressor block, one of the mode's numbers"
msgid "Makeup gain: how much the whole sound is turned up again afterwards."
msgstr "メイクアップゲイン: その後で音全体をどれだけ持ち上げ直すかです。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:65
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Simple Compressor block, one of the mode's numbers"
msgid ""
"Follows: what it listens to. Average (RMS) follows how loud the sound feels, "
"and is what Gentle and Moderate use. Peaks follows every sudden loud moment, "
"and is what the firmer modes use."
msgstr ""
"追従対象: "
"何を聞いているかです。「平均（RMS）」は音の感じられる大きさに追従し、「穏やか」と「中程度」で使われます。「ピーク」は突然の大きな瞬間すべてに追従し、それより強いモードで使われます。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the Simple Compressor block"
msgid "To shape the curve yourself, use the Dynamics Processor block."
msgstr "カーブを自分で形作るには、「ダイナミクスプロセッサー」ブロックを使ってください。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:75
msgctxt "@info help page of the Simple Compressor block"
msgid "In a film, the voices are too quiet and the explosions too loud."
msgstr "映画で、声が小さすぎ、爆発音が大きすぎるとき。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:76
msgctxt "@info help page of the Simple Compressor block"
msgid "Somebody on a call or in a recording keeps getting louder and quieter."
msgstr "通話や録音で、誰かの声が大きくなったり小さくなったりするとき。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:77
msgctxt "@info help page of the Simple Compressor block"
msgid "You listen in a noisy place, and the quiet parts get lost."
msgstr "騒がしい場所で聞いていて、静かな部分が聞こえなくなるとき。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:84
msgctxt "@info help page of the Simple Compressor block"
msgid ""
"Start with Gentle and go firmer one mode at a time, until the level is as "
"even as you like."
msgstr "「穏やか」から始めて、レベルが好みの均一さになるまで、モードを 1 段階ずつ強くしてください。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:85
msgctxt "@info help page of the Simple Compressor block"
msgid ""
"If the sound starts to breathe or pump, rising and falling with the loud "
"moments, choose a gentler mode."
msgstr "大きな瞬間に合わせて音が上下し、呼吸するように波打ち始めたら、もっと穏やかなモードを選んでください。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:86
msgctxt "@info help page of the Simple Compressor block"
msgid "For speech, try Voice first."
msgstr "話し声には、まず「声」を試してください。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorHelp.qml:87
msgctxt "@info help page of the Simple Compressor block"
msgid "Switch between Off and a mode to hear what the block is doing."
msgstr "「オフ」とモードを切り替えて、ブロックが何をしているかを聞き比べてください。"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorPanel.qml:67
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Compressor mode"
msgstr "コンプレッサーモード"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorPanel.qml:106
msgctxt "@label the level compression starts at"
msgid "Threshold"
msgstr "スレッショルド"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorPanel.qml:110
msgctxt "@label how much of what is above the threshold comes out"
msgid "Ratio"
msgstr "レシオ"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorPanel.qml:114
msgctxt "@label how wide the bend around the threshold is"
msgid "Knee"
msgstr "ニー"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorPanel.qml:118
msgctxt "@label how quickly the compressor takes hold"
msgid "Attack"
msgstr "アタック"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorPanel.qml:122
msgctxt "@label how quickly the compressor lets go"
msgid "Release"
msgstr "リリース"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorPanel.qml:126
msgctxt "@label the gain added after compressing"
msgid "Makeup gain"
msgstr "メイクアップゲイン"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorPanel.qml:130
msgctxt "@label what level the compressor follows"
msgid "Follows"
msgstr "追従対象"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorPanel.qml:143
msgctxt "@info a setting and its value, 'Threshold: -18 dB'"
msgid "%1: %2"
msgstr "%1: %2"

#: blocks/simplecompressor/ui/SimpleCompressorPanel.qml:171
msgctxt "@info the Off mode sets nothing"
msgid "Off sets nothing: the sound is left as it is."
msgstr "「オフ」では何も設定せず、音はそのままです。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideFace.qml:43
msgctxt "@info what a Sound Side tile says, 'Left, 62 % · -31 dBFS'"
msgid "%1, %2"
msgstr "%1、%2"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:16
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"Shows which channel is louder, with a moving mark and a word. It can't tell "
"what made the sound, and it can't tell front from back."
msgstr "どちらのチャンネルの音が大きいかを、動くマークと言葉で表示します。何がその音を出したかはわからず、前と後ろの区別もできません。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:21
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"The block compares the left and right channels of this lane over the last 20 "
"milliseconds and passes the sound on exactly as it arrived, with no delay. "
"When one side is louder, a mark jumps there and a word says Left or Right. "
"The mark stays for a quarter of a second and fades over another. When nothing"
" is over the gate there is no mark and the word says Quiet, so silence never "
"reads as a sound straight ahead."
msgstr ""
"ブロックはこのレーンの左右のチャンネルを直近 20 "
"ミリ秒にわたって比べ、音は入ってきたままの状態で、遅延なく先へ送ります。片側が大きいとマークがそちらへ移り、「左」または「右」と表示されます。マークは 4"
" 分の 1 秒とどまり、さらに 4 分の 1 "
"秒かけて消えます。ゲートを超える音がないときはマークが表示されず「無音」と表示されるので、無音が正面からの音と誤って読まれることはありません。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"Centre means near-equal sides that match, as one sound straight ahead gives. "
"Both means near-equal sides that do not match, as a wide bed of music gives: "
"no one place, not two sounds. Reverberation does this too."
msgstr ""
"「中央」は、左右がほぼ等しく、しかも一致していることを示します。正面からの 1 "
"つの音がこうなります。「両側」は、左右がほぼ等しいものの一致していないことを示します。広がりのある音楽の背景音がこうなり、1 つの位置にあるわけでも、2 "
"つの音があるわけでもありません。残響でもこうなります。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"A loud bed hides a quiet sound, and no setting changes that. A sound on one "
"side alone leaves Centre only once it comes within about 2 dB of one channel "
"of the bed. A short click is thinned out further. A game's headphone mode may"
" narrow the sides too, since it keeps much of its difference in time, which "
"this block can't see."
msgstr ""
"大きな背景音は小さな音を覆い隠し、どの設定でもそれは変わりません。片側だけの音は、背景音の片方のチャンネルとの差が約 2 dB "
"以内になって初めて「中央」から外れます。短いクリック音はさらに捉えにくくなります。ゲームのヘッドホンモードも左右の差を狭めることがあります。差の多くを時間差として持たせており、このブロックではそれを捉えられないためです。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"Sound Side reads this lane's sound and does not touch the game. Some games "
"and tournaments still forbid tools that show direction. Check their rules "
"before you use it. That choice is yours."
msgstr ""
"「左右の偏り」はこのレーンの音を読み取るだけで、ゲームには一切触れません。それでも、方向を表示するツールを禁止しているゲームや大会があります。使う前にそのルールを確認してください。使うかどうかはご自身の判断です。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:34
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:170
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:198
msgctxt "@label which side of the mix is louder now"
msgid "Side now"
msgstr "現在の偏り"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:36
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:151
msgctxt "@label what a Sound Side says now"
msgid "Now"
msgstr "現在"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:37
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:267
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Move Before One Ear Mix"
msgstr "片耳ミックスの前に移動"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"The strip at the card's width, with how far the sound is to one side. 25 % is"
" about 2 dB between the sides, 50 % about 5 dB, 80 % about 10 dB and 90 % "
"about 13 dB. Sides alike means both channels have carried the same sound for "
"5 seconds. Sound on one side only means it has stayed at one end for 10 "
"seconds, which a One Ear Mix before this block does. With a One Ear Mix "
"before this block, the card names it and Move Before One Ear Mix puts this "
"block ahead of it, as one step of undo."
msgstr ""
"設定パネルの幅いっぱいの帯で、音が片側にどれだけ寄っているかを示します。25% は左右の差が約 2 dB、50% は約 5 dB、80% は約 10 "
"dB、90% は約 13 dB です。「左右が同じ」は、両チャンネルが 5 秒間同じ音を流していることを示します。「片側のみの音」は、音が 10 "
"秒間片端にとどまっていることを示し、このブロックの前に「片耳ミックス」があるとこうなります。このブロックの前に「片耳ミックス」がある場合は設定パネルにその名前が表示され、「片耳ミックスの前に移動」でこのブロックをその前に移せます。この操作は"
" 1 回の「元に戻す」で取り消せます。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:46
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:278
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:300
msgctxt "@label how loud this lane is"
msgid "Level on this lane"
msgstr "このレーンのレベル"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:48
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:320
msgctxt "@label under this level a Sound Side shows no side"
msgid "Level gate"
msgstr "レベルゲート"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:51
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"The level of the two channels together, with a line at the gate. Under Level "
"gate there is no side to show. It goes from -70 to -20 dBFS and starts at "
"-50."
msgstr ""
"2 つのチャンネルを合わせたレベルで、ゲートの位置に線があります。「レベルゲート」未満では、示す方向はありません。-70〜-20 dBFS で、初期値は "
"-50 です。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:57
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:329
msgctxt "@label which part of the sound a Sound Side reads"
msgid "Band"
msgstr "帯域"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:59
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:149
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox the band a Sound Side reads"
msgid "All"
msgstr "すべて"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:60
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:148
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox the band a Sound Side reads"
msgid "Range"
msgstr "範囲"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:61
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:371
msgctxt "@label the bottom of the band a Sound Side reads"
msgid "From"
msgstr "下端"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:62
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:390
msgctxt "@label the top of the band a Sound Side reads"
msgid "To"
msgstr "上端"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:65
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"All compares everything on the lane. Range compares only what lies between "
"From and To, for the comparison and not for the sound, which is untouched. It"
" can help where a bed is weak in that range, and nothing shows that it does. "
"To stays at least an octave above From: moving one past that pushes the other"
" along."
msgstr ""
"「すべて」はレーン上のすべての音を比べます。「範囲」は「下端」と「上端」の間にある音だけを比べます。これは比較のためだけで、音そのものには手を加えません。その帯域で背景音が弱い場合に役立つことがありますが、効果があるかどうかを示す表示はありません。「上端」は常に「下端」より"
" 1 オクターブ以上高く保たれます: 一方をそれ以上近づけると、もう一方も一緒に動きます。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:71
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:406
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Strip on screen"
msgstr "画面に帯を表示"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:73
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"A thin dark strip over other programs, with L at one end, R at the other and "
"the word in a box beside them. It takes no clicks and no focus, and touches "
"nothing of the game's: no hook, no layer, nothing loaded into it. It goes "
"with this window and the tray icon. There is one strip, so with several "
"blocks the first has it. The tray's popover says when it is on."
msgstr ""
"ほかのプログラムの上に表示される細い暗色の帯で、一方の端に L、もう一方の端に R "
"があり、その横の枠に言葉が表示されます。クリックもフォーカスも受け付けず、ゲームのものには一切触れません: "
"フックもレイヤーも使わず、ゲームに何も読み込ませません。このウィンドウとトレイアイコンが動作している間だけ表示されます。帯は 1 "
"つしかないので、ブロックが複数ある場合は最初のブロックが使います。帯がオンのときは、トレイのポップアップにそう表示されます。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:74
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"On a Plasma Wayland session it sits on the desktop's overlay layer. Nobody "
"has tried it above a full-screen game. Elsewhere it is a plain window that "
"may go under a game, and the card says so. With a game that takes over the "
"whole display there is no desktop to draw it. Then detach the card to a "
"second screen: Side now is the same strip at the same speed."
msgstr ""
"Plasma の Wayland "
"セッションでは、デスクトップのオーバーレイ層に表示されます。全画面のゲームの上で動作するかは、まだ誰も試していません。それ以外の環境では普通のウィンドウなので、ゲームの下に隠れることがあり、設定パネルにもそう表示されます。ディスプレイ全体を占有するゲームでは、帯を描くデスクトップがありません。その場合は設定パネルを"
" 2 台目の画面に切り離してください: 「現在の偏り」は同じ帯を同じ速さで表示します。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:80
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:449
msgctxt "@label how big the strip on screen is"
msgid "Strip size"
msgstr "帯のサイズ"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:82
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:155
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox a size of strip"
msgid "Small"
msgstr "小"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:83
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:159
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox a size of strip"
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "中"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:84
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:157
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox a size of strip"
msgid "Large"
msgstr "大"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:87
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"How big the strip is. This and the rest of the strip's place belong to this "
"desktop, not to a session."
msgstr "帯の大きさです。この設定と帯の位置は、セッションごとではなく、このデスクトップに保存されます。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:93
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:486
msgctxt "@label what the strip on screen draws"
msgid "Show"
msgstr "表示"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:95
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:164
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox what the strip draws"
msgid "Mark"
msgstr "マーク"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:96
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:163
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox what the strip draws"
msgid "Bars"
msgstr "バー"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:99
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"Mark moves to the louder side and opens out as the sound loses its one place."
" Bars grow outward from the middle, one a side, from the gate to full scale: "
"they show the level as well, and need more looking."
msgstr ""
"「マーク」は大きいほうの側へ移動し、音の位置が 1 か所に定まらなくなるにつれて広がります。「バー」は中央から外側へ左右 1 "
"本ずつ伸び、ゲートからフルスケールまでを示します: レベルも表示されますが、読み取るにはよく見る必要があります。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:105
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:530
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Place Strip…"
msgstr "帯を配置…"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:107
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:543
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Test Strip"
msgstr "帯をテスト"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:108
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:553
msgctxt "@title:group a part of the Sound Side card"
msgid "Placement"
msgstr "配置"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:109
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:558
msgctxt "@label where the strip sits across the screen"
msgid "Across"
msgstr "横位置"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:110
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:559
msgctxt "@label where the strip sits down the screen"
msgid "Down"
msgstr "縦位置"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:114
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"Place Strip gives the strip a frame and the keyboard for as long as it lasts."
" The arrows move it 10 pixels, Page Up, Page Down, Home and End move it 50, "
"and the mouse works too. Enter keeps the place and Esc puts it back. Do this "
"before playing, since it takes the keyboard from whatever has it."
msgstr ""
"「帯を配置」を押すと、配置が終わるまで帯に枠が表示され、キーボード操作を受け付けます。矢印キーで 10 ピクセル、Page Up、Page "
"Down、Home、End で 50 ピクセル移動でき、マウスも使えます。Enter で位置を確定し、Esc "
"で元に戻します。それまでキーボードを使っていたものからキーボードを奪うので、プレイを始める前に行ってください。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:115
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"Test Strip runs the mark left, centre and right over 3 seconds, on the strip "
"alone. The card can't know whether the strip is hidden, so this is how to see"
" that it is there. Across and Down are percentages of the room left on the "
"screen, so that a place survives a change of screen: 50 is the middle."
msgstr ""
"「帯をテスト」は、帯の上だけで、マークを 3 "
"秒かけて左、中央、右へ動かします。帯が隠れているかどうかは設定パネルではわからないので、帯がそこにあることを確かめるにはこれを使います。「横位置」と「縦位置」は画面の残りの領域に対する割合なので、画面が変わっても位置が保たれます:"
" 50 が中央です。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:122
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"You play with the sound in one ear, and a mix in one ear has lost its sides."
msgstr "片耳で音を聞きながらプレイしていて、片耳用のミックスでは左右の区別が失われているとき。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:123
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"A program has no display of its own for where a sound is. The program's own "
"display is better where there is one, as it knows what made each sound."
msgstr ""
"プログラムに音の方向を示す独自の表示がないとき。表示がある場合は、それぞれの音を何が出したかを知っているプログラム自身の表示のほうが優れています。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:130
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"Put it after an Application block that holds only the game, and before One "
"Ear Mix. After a fold there is nothing left to see, and the card offers to "
"move it. Voice chat and a music player stay out of the reading on a lane of "
"their own."
msgstr ""
"ゲームだけを取り込む「アプリケーション」ブロックの後、「片耳ミックス」の前に置いてください。左右をまとめた後では見るべきものが残っていないので、設定パネルにブロックの移動が提案されます。ボイスチャットや音楽プレーヤーは専用のレーンに置けば、読み取りに含まれません。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:131
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"Turn off the game's own mono option and use One Ear Mix after this block "
"instead. With the option on, both sides are the same and the strip says Same."
msgstr ""
"ゲーム自体のモノラル設定はオフにし、代わりにこのブロックの後で「片耳ミックス」を使ってください。その設定がオンだと左右が同じになり、帯には「同一」と表示されます。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:132
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid ""
"Set a key for Show or hide Sound Side's strip in System Settings. It starts "
"with none. Each time it shows the strip it runs the test once, so that you "
"see during play whether it is there."
msgstr ""
"システム設定で「『左右の偏り』の帯を表示/非表示」にキーを割り当ててください。初期状態では割り当てはありません。帯を表示するたびにテストを 1 "
"回実行するので、プレイ中でも帯があるかどうかを確かめられます。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideHelp.qml:133
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sound Side block"
msgid "Over Bluetooth the mark comes before the sound."
msgstr "Bluetooth 経由では、マークが音より先に表示されます。"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideOverlay.qml:87
msgctxt "@info while the strip is being placed"
msgid "Arrows move · Enter keeps · Esc puts it back"
msgstr "矢印キー: 移動 · Enter: 確定 · Esc: 元に戻す"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:126
msgctxt "@info:status spoken, of a Sound Side"
msgid "Strip may not stay on top"
msgstr "帯が最前面に留まらない場合があります"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:132
msgctxt "@info:status spoken, of a Sound Side"
msgid "Sides identical"
msgstr "左右が同一"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:232
msgctxt "@info a Sound Side whose two sides are one sound"
msgid ""
"Both sides carry the same sound here, so there is no side to show. Put this "
"block before One Ear Mix, and turn off the program's own mono option"
msgstr ""
"ここでは左右に同じ音が流れているため、示す方向がありません。このブロックを「片耳ミックス」の前に置き、プログラム自体のモノラル設定をオフにしてください"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:242
msgctxt "@info a Sound Side whose sound stays on one side"
msgid "Sound on one side only"
msgstr "片側のみの音"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:252
msgctxt "@info %1 is what the block is called"
msgid "%1 comes before this block, so the sides may be gone by here"
msgstr "このブロックの前に「%1」があるため、ここでは左右の差が失われている可能性があります"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:321
msgctxt "@label decibels against full scale"
msgid "dBFS"
msgstr "dBFS"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:372
#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:391
msgctxt "@label hertz"
msgid "Hz"
msgstr "Hz"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:421
msgctxt "@info under the Strip on screen switch"
msgid "May not stay on top here"
msgstr "この環境では最前面に留まらない場合があります"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:432
msgctxt "@info under the Strip on screen switch"
msgid "There is one strip, and another Sound Side has it"
msgstr "帯は 1 つしかなく、別の「左右の偏り」ブロックが使用しています"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:441
msgctxt "@info under the Strip on screen switch"
msgid "It shows while this window or the tray icon is running"
msgstr "このウィンドウかトレイアイコンが動作している間に表示されます"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:534
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Do this before playing: it takes the keyboard while it lasts"
msgstr "プレイを始める前に行ってください: 配置中はキーボードを占有します"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:556
msgctxt "@info the strip's place: 'across 50 %, down 4 %'"
msgid "%1 %, %2 %"
msgstr "%1%、%2%"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:560
msgctxt "@label percent of the screen"
msgid "%"
msgstr "%"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSidePanel.qml:571
msgctxt "@info what Sound Side can't know"
msgid ""
"Shows the louder side of the whole mix, never what made the sound. Music and "
"voices move it too, and it can be wrong. Some games and tournaments forbid "
"tools like this: check their rules"
msgstr ""
"ミックス全体のうち大きいほうの側を表示するだけで、何がその音を出したかは示しません。音楽や声でも動き、誤ることもあります。このようなツールを禁止しているゲームや大会もあります:"
" ルールを確認してください"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:27
msgctxt "@label the left end of the strip, one letter"
msgid "L"
msgstr "L"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:28
msgctxt "@label the right end of the strip, one letter"
msgid "R"
msgstr "R"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:34
msgctxt "@info a Sound Side that cannot hear its lane"
msgid "Not watching"
msgstr "監視なし"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:36
msgctxt "@info a block switched off"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "オフ"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:45
msgctxt "@info no sound over the gate on a Sound Side"
msgid "Quiet"
msgstr "無音"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:47
msgctxt "@info the louder side of a mix"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:49
msgctxt "@info the louder side of a mix"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:51
msgctxt "@info neither side of a mix is louder"
msgid "Centre"
msgstr "中央"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:53
msgctxt "@info sound fills both sides of a mix with no one place"
msgid "Both"
msgstr "両側"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:55
msgctxt "@info both sides of a mix are the same sound"
msgid "Same"
msgstr "同一"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:57
msgctxt "@info a Sound Side that cannot hear its lane"
msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "停止"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:61
msgctxt "@info no level at all on a Sound Side"
msgid "No sound"
msgstr "信号なし"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:62
msgctxt "@info a level, %1 in dBFS"
msgid "%1 dBFS"
msgstr "%1 dBFS"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:72
msgctxt "@info how far to one side, then the level: '62 % · -31 dBFS'"
msgid "%1 % · %2"
msgstr "%1% · %2"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:75
msgctxt "@info sound fills both sides, then the level: 'wide · -24 dBFS'"
msgid "wide · %1"
msgstr "広がり · %1"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:78
msgctxt "@info the two sides of a lane are one sound"
msgid "Sides identical"
msgstr "左右が同一"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:102
msgctxt "@info what a Sound Side is doing"
msgid "Quiet"
msgstr "無音"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:104
msgctxt "@info what a Sound Side is doing"
msgid "Sides alike"
msgstr "左右が同じ"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:109
msgctxt "@info what a Sound Side is doing"
msgid "Sounding"
msgstr "音あり"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:115
msgctxt "@info a side and how far to it: 'Left 62 %'"
msgid "%1 %2 %"
msgstr "%1 %2%"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:123
msgctxt "@info:status spoken, of a mix"
msgid "left %1 percent"
msgstr "左 %1 パーセント"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:125
msgctxt "@info:status spoken, of a mix"
msgid "right %1 percent"
msgstr "右 %1 パーセント"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:127
msgctxt "@info:status spoken, of a mix"
msgid "centre %1 percent"
msgstr "中央 %1 パーセント"

#: blocks/soundside/ui/SoundSideWords.qml:168
msgctxt "@info a frequency, %1 in hertz"
msgid "%1 Hz"
msgstr "%1 Hz"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:15
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"Shows how much of each frequency there is at this point on the lane, as a row"
" of bars. It changes nothing about the sound."
msgstr "レーンのこの位置で、それぞれの周波数がどれだけ含まれているかを、並んだバーで表示します。音には何も変更を加えません。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:20
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"The block passes the sound on exactly as it arrived, with no delay. Its tile "
"and its card both show the bars, and it works only while one of them is on "
"the screen."
msgstr ""
"このブロックは、届いた音をそのまま、遅延なしで次に渡します。タイルと設定パネルの両方にバーが表示され、どちらかが画面に表示されている間だけ動作します。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:21
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"A bar stands at the loudest thing in its range of frequencies, with 0 dBFS at"
" the top: a sine wave at full scale reaches the top in the bar that holds it,"
" however many bars there are. The range goes from 20 Hz to 20 kHz."
msgstr ""
"各バーは、その周波数帯で最も大きい音の高さまで伸び、一番上が 0 dBFS です: "
"フルスケールの正弦波は、バーがいくつあっても、それを含むバーで一番上に届きます。範囲は 20 Hz〜20 kHz です。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"Bars that stand still are bars you asked to hold. When the session is stopped"
" or overloaded, or the block is off, no bars are shown and a line of words "
"says why."
msgstr ""
"止まっているバーは、ホールドを指示したバーです。セッションが停止しているか過負荷のとき、またはブロックがオフのときは、バーは表示されず、その理由が 1 "
"行で表示されます。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:32
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:98
msgctxt "@action:button keeps the bars shown and takes no new ones"
msgid "Hold"
msgstr "ホールド"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:34
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"Keeps the bars on the screen and takes no new ones, so that you can look at a"
" moment. You can change how they are read while they are held. Press it again"
" to go back to the live sound."
msgstr ""
"バーを画面に留め、新しいバーを取り込まないので、ある瞬間をじっくり見られます。ホールド中でも、表示方法の設定は変更できます。もう一度押すと、リアルタイムの音に戻ります。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:41
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"The settings below are folded under this heading, under the bars and Hold. "
"Click the heading to show them, and again to fold them away."
msgstr ""
"以下の設定は、バーと「ホールド」の下にあるこの見出しの中に折りたたまれています。見出しをクリックすると表示され、もう一度クリックすると折りたたまれます。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:47
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:129
msgctxt "@label how many bars a Spectrum shows"
msgid "Bars"
msgstr "バー"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"How many bars the range is divided into, from 16 to 128. A tile shows fewer "
"when it has no room for them all."
msgstr "範囲をいくつのバーに分けるかを、16〜128 の範囲で設定します。タイルにすべてを表示する余裕がない場合は、少なく表示されます。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:55
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:140
msgctxt "@label how a Spectrum's bars move between refreshes"
msgid "Motion"
msgstr "動き"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:57
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:60
msgctxt "@item a Spectrum shows each refresh as it is"
msgid "Real-time"
msgstr "リアルタイム"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:58
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:62
msgctxt "@item a Spectrum's bars rise quickly and ease down between refreshes"
msgid "Smooth"
msgstr "滑らか"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:61
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"Real-time shows each refresh's bars as they are, and holds them until the "
"next."
msgstr "「リアルタイム」は、更新ごとのバーをそのまま表示し、次の更新まで保ちます。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:62
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"Smooth moves the bars at the rate of your screen: they rise quickly and ease "
"down when the sound falls. It makes the picture calmer and uses more of the "
"graphics card."
msgstr ""
"「滑らか」は、画面のリフレッシュレートでバーを動かします: "
"バーは素早く上がり、音が小さくなるとゆっくり下がります。表示が落ち着きますが、グラフィックカードをより多く使います。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:68
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:152
msgctxt "@label how many times a second a Spectrum is worked out"
msgid "Refresh rate, per second"
msgstr "更新頻度（回/秒）"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"How often the bars are worked out, from 10 to 120 times a second. A slow rate"
" misses nothing: the bars show the loudest moment since the last refresh, as "
"far back as the block keeps sound. It can't show more than arrives, which is "
"one cycle of the sound system at a time, and the card says so when the rate "
"you chose is faster than that."
msgstr ""
"バーを計算する頻度を、毎秒 10〜120 回の範囲で設定します。遅くしても何も見逃しません: "
"バーには、ブロックが音を保持している範囲で、前回の更新以降で最も大きい瞬間が表示されます。届く音より多くは表示できず、音は一度にオーディオシステムの 1 "
"サイクル分ずつ届きます。選んだ頻度がそれより速い場合は、設定パネルにその旨が表示されます。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:76
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:177
msgctxt "@label how a Spectrum spreads the frequencies across its width"
msgid "Frequency scale"
msgstr "周波数スケール"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:78
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:85
msgctxt "@item a Spectrum gives each octave the same width"
msgid "Logarithmic"
msgstr "対数"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:79
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:87
msgctxt "@item a Spectrum gives each hertz the same width"
msgid "Linear"
msgstr "リニア"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:82
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"Logarithmic gives each octave the same width, which is how we hear pitch. "
"Linear gives each hertz the same width, which leaves most of the width to the"
" highest sounds and is good for looking at harmonics."
msgstr ""
"「対数」は、各オクターブを同じ幅で表示します。これは、人が音の高さを感じる仕組みと同じです。「リニア」は、1 Hz "
"ごとに同じ幅で表示するので、幅の大部分が最も高い音に割り当てられます。倍音を見るのに向いています。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:88
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:188
msgctxt "@label how many samples of sound each look of a Spectrum takes in"
msgid "FFT size"
msgstr "FFT サイズ"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:90
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"How much sound each look takes in, from 1024 to 8192 samples. A large size "
"tells low notes apart but blurs quick sounds together, and a small size does "
"the opposite. The card says what your choice comes to."
msgstr ""
"1 回の解析に取り込む音の量を、1024〜8192 "
"サンプルの範囲で設定します。大きくすると低い音を聞き分けられますが、速い音はぼやけて混ざります。小さくするとその逆です。選んだ値が実際にどうなるかは、設定パネルに表示されます。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:91
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"At the bottom of a logarithmic scale several bars may share what one size can"
" tell apart. They all show it, so a low sine draws a hump as wide as the size"
" makes it, and you get no empty bars."
msgstr ""
"対数スケールの低い端では、1 "
"つのサイズで区別できる範囲を、複数のバーが分け合うことがあります。それらのバーはすべて同じ値を表示するので、低い正弦波はサイズに応じた幅の山として描かれ、空のバーはできません。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:97
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:212
msgctxt "@label the level at the bottom of a Spectrum's view"
msgid "Level range"
msgstr "レベル範囲"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:99
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"The level at the bottom of the view, from -60 to -120 dBFS. The top is always"
" 0 dBFS. A low floor shows quiet sound and noise, and a high one leaves more "
"height for what is loud."
msgstr ""
"表示の一番下のレベルを、-60〜-120 dBFS の範囲で設定します。一番上は常に 0 dBFS "
"です。下限を低くすると小さな音やノイズが見え、高くすると大きな音に多くの高さを使えます。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:105
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:223
msgctxt "@label how much a Spectrum lifts high frequencies against low ones"
msgid "Tilt"
msgstr "傾き"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:107
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"Lifts high frequencies and lowers low ones by this much per octave, turning "
"about 1 kHz, in the drawing and not in the sound. Music is usually strongest "
"at the bottom, and 3 dB or 4.5 dB per octave makes its bars easier to "
"compare. With tilt on, a bar's height is no longer the true level."
msgstr ""
"1 kHz 付近を軸に、高い周波数を持ち上げ、低い周波数を下げます。量は 1 "
"オクターブあたりの値で、変わるのは表示だけで、音は変わりません。音楽はたいてい低い部分が最も強いので、1 オクターブあたり 3 dB か 4.5 dB "
"にすると、バーを比べやすくなります。傾きをオンにすると、バーの高さは本当のレベルを示さなくなります。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:113
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:234
msgctxt "@label which channels a Spectrum reads"
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "チャンネル"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:115
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:118
msgctxt "@item a Spectrum reads left and right mixed together"
msgid "Mix"
msgstr "ミックス"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:116
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:120
msgctxt "@item a Spectrum reads the left channel"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:117
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:122
msgctxt "@item a Spectrum reads the right channel"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:120
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"Mix is left and right added together and halved, as a mono mix would be. The "
"same sound in both reads as it is, a sound in one channel reads 6 dB lower, "
"and sound in opposite phase cancels out."
msgstr ""
"「ミックス」は、モノラルミックスと同じように、左右を足して半分にしたものです。左右に同じ音があればそのまま表示され、片方のチャンネルだけの音は 6 dB "
"低く表示され、逆位相の音は打ち消し合います。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:126
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:245
msgctxt "@label how a Spectrum's bars are drawn"
msgid "Style"
msgstr "スタイル"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:128
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:130
msgctxt "@item how a Spectrum's bars are drawn"
msgid "Solid"
msgstr "塗りつぶし"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:129
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:132
msgctxt ""
"@item how a Spectrum's bars are drawn, in lit steps like a row of lamps"
msgid "Segmented"
msgstr "セグメント"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:132
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"Solid draws plain bars. Segmented draws them in lit steps, like a row of "
"lamps. Switching shows at once."
msgstr "「塗りつぶし」は、普通のバーを描きます。「セグメント」は、ランプを並べたように、光る段に分けて描きます。切り替えるとすぐに反映されます。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:138
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:254
msgctxt ""
"@option:check a mark over each of a Spectrum's bars at its recent peak"
msgid "Peak marks"
msgstr "ピークマーク"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:140
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"A mark over each bar at its highest. It stays for a second and then falls "
"slowly."
msgstr "各バーの最も高かった位置に印を表示します。印は 1 秒間とどまり、その後ゆっくり下がります。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:146
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:267
msgctxt "@option:check lines and numbers behind a Spectrum's bars"
msgid "Grid and labels"
msgstr "グリッドとラベル"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:148
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"Lines behind the bars at round frequencies and every 20 dB. The card names "
"them as well, and a tile has no room for the numbers."
msgstr ""
"区切りのよい周波数と 20 dB ごとに、バーの背後に線を引きます。設定パネルでは数値も表示されますが、タイルには数値を表示する余裕がありません。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:155
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"Put one before and one after an equalizer or a filter to see what it does, or"
" use one to find the frequency of a hum or a whistle."
msgstr "イコライザーやフィルタの前後に 1 つずつ置いて効果を確かめたり、ハムやピーという音の周波数を探したりするのに使えます。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:162
msgctxt "@info help page of the Spectrum block"
msgid ""
"A session can show up to 16 Waveform and Spectrum blocks at once. Each one "
"still passes the sound on with no delay, and one that is off the screen does "
"no work beyond passing it on. Held bars are kept only while the tile or the "
"card is on the screen."
msgstr ""
"1 つのセッションでは、「波形」ブロックと「スペクトラム」ブロックを合わせて最大 16 "
"個まで同時に表示できます。どれも遅延なしで音を次に渡し、画面外にあるものは音を渡す以外の処理をしません。ホールドしたバーは、タイルか設定パネルが画面に表示されている間だけ保持されます。"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:78
msgctxt "@label the bars drawn on a Spectrum card"
msgid "Spectrum"
msgstr "スペクトラム"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:101
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Keeps the bars on the screen so that you can look at them"
msgstr "バーを画面に留めて、じっくり見られるようにします"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:156
msgctxt "@action:button how many times a second a Spectrum is worked out"
msgid "%1 times a second"
msgstr "毎秒 %1 回"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:164
msgctxt "@info under a Spectrum's refresh rate, %1 a whole number"
msgid ""
"Sound arrives about %1 times a second at this cycle length, so a faster "
"refresh repeats itself"
msgstr "このサイクル長では音が毎秒約 %1 回届くため、これより速く更新しても同じ内容を繰り返すだけです"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:199
msgctxt ""
"@info under a Spectrum's FFT size, %1 a duration, %2 a frequency difference; "
"both whole numbers"
msgid "Looks at %1 ms at a time, and tells apart sounds %2 Hz from one another"
msgstr "一度に %1 ms 分を解析し、%2 Hz 離れた音を区別します"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:282
msgctxt "@info what a Spectrum does to the sound"
msgid ""
"Passes the sound on exactly as it arrived. The block works only while it is "
"on the screen"
msgstr "届いた音をそのまま次に渡します。このブロックは画面に表示されている間だけ動作します"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:70
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Shows each refresh's bars as they are"
msgstr "更新ごとのバーをそのまま表示します"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:72
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Moves the bars at the rate of your screen: a quick rise and an eased fall"
msgstr "画面のリフレッシュレートでバーを動かします: 素早く上がり、ゆっくり下がります"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:100
msgctxt "@item the bottom of a Spectrum's view, in decibels below full scale"
msgid "%1 dBFS"
msgstr "%1 dBFS"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:106
msgctxt "@item a Spectrum shows the levels as they are"
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:109
msgctxt ""
"@item a Spectrum lifts high frequencies by this many decibels an octave"
msgid "%1 dB/oct"
msgstr "%1 dB/oct"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:139
msgctxt "@info a frequency on a Spectrum's grid, in kilohertz"
msgid "%1 kHz"
msgstr "%1 kHz"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:140
msgctxt "@info a frequency on a Spectrum's grid, in hertz"
msgid "%1 Hz"
msgstr "%1 Hz"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:157
msgctxt "@info a Spectrum keeps the bars it has"
msgid "Held"
msgstr "ホールド中"

#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumWords.qml:159
msgctxt "@info a Spectrum is showing the sound as it passes"
msgid "Live"
msgstr "ライブ"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:18
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"Clears background noise from a voice, such as keyboard clatter, traffic, a "
"fan or a busy room, with nothing to set up first."
msgstr "キーボードの打鍵音、車の音、ファン、にぎやかな部屋の音などの背景ノイズを、事前の準備なしで声から取り除きます。"

#. i18n: RNNoise is the name of the model, the same in every language.
#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"The block uses RNNoise, a small model that has been trained on many "
"recordings of people speaking. It recognises what a voice sounds like and "
"turns down everything else, moment by moment, so it also copes with noise "
"that keeps changing."
msgstr ""
"このブロックは、人が話す多くの録音で学習した小さなモデル RNNoise "
"を使います。声がどのように聞こえるかを認識し、それ以外のすべてを瞬間ごとに下げるので、変化し続けるノイズにも対応できます。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"It also tells when somebody is speaking. Between words and sentences, the "
"whole sound goes down as far as Noise reduction allows. When the voice starts"
" again, it opens at once, and stays open a fifth of a second after the voice "
"stops, so the ends of words are not cut off."
msgstr ""
"誰かが話しているかどうかも判断します。言葉や文の間では、音全体が「ノイズ低減量」で許される分まで下がります。声が再び始まるとすぐに開き、声が止まってからも"
" 0.2 秒間は開いたままなので、言葉の終わりが切れることはありません。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"The line at the top says Speech detected while it hears a voice, and No "
"speech detected while it does not."
msgstr "上部の行には、声が聞こえている間は「発話を検出」、聞こえていない間は「発話なし」と表示されます。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"The model works only when the session runs at 48 kHz, the sample rate it was "
"trained at. At any other rate the line says Only works at 48 kHz, and the "
"sound passes through unchanged."
msgstr ""
"このモデルは、学習時のサンプルレートである 48 kHz でセッションが動作しているときだけ働きます。それ以外のレートでは、行に「48 kHz "
"でのみ動作」と表示され、音はそのまま通ります。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:28
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"The block holds the sound back by three hundredths of a second. Reverblabr "
"keeps the other lanes in step with that delay."
msgstr "このブロックは音を 100 分の 3 秒遅らせます。Reverblabr は、ほかのレーンもこの遅延に合わせてそろえます。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:29
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"The block is only there when Reverblabr was built with RNNoise, as it is on "
"systems that package it."
msgstr ""
"このブロックは、Reverblabr が RNNoise 付きでビルドされている場合にだけ使えます。RNNoise "
"をパッケージとして提供しているシステムでは、そのようにビルドされています。"

#. i18n: dB stands for decibels.
#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:42
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"The most the block turns anything down, in decibels (dB), from 0 to 60 dB. A "
"new block starts at 40 dB."
msgstr "ブロックが音を下げる最大量で、デシベル（dB）で 0〜60 dB です。新しいブロックは 40 dB から始まります。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:43
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"While somebody speaks, no part of the sound is turned down further than this,"
" and between words the whole sound goes down by this much. At 0 dB the block "
"changes nothing. Lower values leave a little of the room in, which can sound "
"more natural."
msgstr ""
"誰かが話している間は、音のどの部分もこれ以上は下げられず、言葉の間では音全体がこの分だけ下がります。0 dB "
"ではブロックは何も変えません。値を低くすると部屋の音が少し残り、より自然に聞こえることがあります。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:49
#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoisePanel.qml:125
msgctxt ""
"@option:check a Speech Denoise block folds stereo to one before the model"
msgid "Mono signal processing"
msgstr "モノラル信号処理"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:51
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"Mixes the left and the right side into one before the model, and sends the "
"one result to both sides. The block then does half the work. A single voice "
"is usually mono anyway. It is off for a new block."
msgstr ""
"モデルの前で左右を 1 つにまとめ、その 1 つの結果を左右両方に送ります。これでブロックの処理量は半分になります。1 "
"人の声は、たいていもともとモノラルです。新しいブロックではオフです。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:52
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"Switching it on or off while sound plays changes over smoothly, with no gap."
msgstr "音の再生中にオンまたはオフに切り替えても、途切れることなく滑らかに切り替わります。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:59
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"You talk in a call or a stream, and your keyboard, your fan or the street can"
" be heard behind you."
msgstr "通話や配信で話すときに、キーボード、ファン、外の通りの音が後ろで聞こえてしまうとき。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:60
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid "A recorded interview has a noisy background that changes all the time."
msgstr "録音したインタビューに、絶えず変化する騒がしい背景音があるとき。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:61
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid "The noise is not steady enough for the Denoise block to learn it."
msgstr "ノイズが一定でなく、「ノイズ除去」ブロックでは学習できないとき。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"Use it on speech only. Music and singing are not what the model knows, and it"
" can turn them down too."
msgstr "話し声にだけ使ってください。音楽や歌はモデルが知らない音なので、それらも下げてしまうことがあります。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:69
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"If the voice sounds thin or robotic, lower Noise reduction to 20 or 30 dB."
msgstr "声が薄く聞こえたり、ロボットのように聞こえたりする場合は、「ノイズ低減量」を 20 dB か 30 dB に下げてください。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"Turn on Mono signal processing for a single microphone, to spare the "
"computer's work."
msgstr "マイクが 1 本なら、「モノラル信号処理」をオンにして、コンピュータの負荷を減らしてください。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseHelp.qml:71
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"If the line says Only works at 48 kHz, the computer's sound system is running"
" at another rate, which the session follows. The Info tab of the sidebar "
"shows the rate in use."
msgstr ""
"行に「48 kHz "
"でのみ動作」と表示される場合は、コンピュータのサウンドシステムが別のレートで動作していて、セッションがそれに従っています。使用中のレートは、サイドバーの「情報」タブで確認できます。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoisePanel.qml:79
msgctxt "@label:slider the most a Speech Denoise block turns anything down"
msgid "Noise reduction"
msgstr "ノイズ低減量"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoisePanel.qml:87
msgctxt "@info a level in decibels, '40.0 dB'"
msgid "%1 dB"
msgstr "%1 dB"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoisePanel.qml:137
msgctxt "@info what mono does on a Speech Denoise block"
msgid ""
"Mono processing uses half the CPU by folding stereo input to one before the "
"model."
msgstr "モノラル処理では、モデルの前でステレオ入力を 1 つにまとめるので、CPU の使用量が半分になります。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoisePanel.qml:142
msgctxt "@info the model a Speech Denoise block runs, and what it costs"
msgid ""
"RNNoise, a model trained on voices, needs nothing learned first. It works at "
"48 kHz and makes the sound 30 ms late."
msgstr "RNNoise は声で学習済みのモデルなので、事前に何かを学習させる必要はありません。48 kHz で動作し、音が 30 ms 遅れます。"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseState.qml:39
msgctxt "@info the speech model a Speech Denoise block runs, and its rate"
msgid "RNNoise · 48 kHz"
msgstr "RNNoise · 48 kHz"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseState.qml:42
msgctxt "@info a Speech Denoise block in a session at another rate than 48 kHz"
msgid "Only works at 48 kHz"
msgstr "48 kHz でのみ動作"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseState.qml:43
msgctxt "@info a Speech Denoise block hears a voice"
msgid "Speech detected"
msgstr "発話を検出"

#: blocks/speechdenoise/ui/SpeechDenoiseState.qml:44
msgctxt "@info a Speech Denoise block hears no voice"
msgid "No speech detected"
msgstr "発話なし"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowFace.qml:40
msgctxt "@info what a Speech Now tile says just after a voice stops"
msgid "Voice stopped"
msgstr "声が止んだ"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowFace.qml:56
msgctxt "@info what a Speech Now tile says, 'Speaking, Voice model'"
msgid "%1, %2"
msgstr "%1、%2"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:15
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"Shows Speaking while a voice is on this lane, and Quiet when not. For a "
"moment after a voice stops it shows Quiet again. It can't tell who is "
"speaking or what was said."
msgstr ""
"このレーンに声があるときは「発話中」、ないときは「無音」と表示します。声が止んだ直後は、しばらく「再び無音」と表示します。誰が話しているかや、何が話されたかはわかりません。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:20
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"The block listens to the lane and passes the sound on exactly as it arrived, "
"with no delay. Put it right after a program or a microphone, before anything "
"that changes the level."
msgstr ""
"ブロックはレーンの音を聞き取り、音は入ってきたままの状態で、遅延なく先へ送ります。プログラムやマイクの直後、レベルを変えるものより前に置いてください。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:21
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"Quiet again says what the sound did. A pause for thought and the end of a "
"turn look the same, so it does not mean the talker has finished. Someone may "
"be drawing breath."
msgstr ""
"「再び無音」は音に起きたことを示すだけです。考えるための間と話の終わりは同じように見えるので、話し手が話し終えたという意味ではありません。息継ぎをしているだけかもしれません。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"It shows Not watching whenever it can't hear the lane: when the session has "
"stopped, when the session is overloaded, or when the engine has stopped "
"answering. Music, singing and film can read as Speaking too."
msgstr ""
"レーンの音を聞き取れないときは「監視なし」と表示します: "
"セッションが停止したとき、セッションが過負荷のとき、エンジンが応答しなくなったときです。音楽、歌、映画も「発話中」と判定されることがあります。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:32
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:113
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:123
msgctxt "@label what a Speech Now is called"
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名前"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:34
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:93
msgctxt "@label what a Speech Now says now"
msgid "Now"
msgstr "現在"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:37
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"What the tile, the tray and the floating label call this block, up to 24 "
"characters. Two blocks named Call and You read as two talkers, each on its "
"own lane."
msgstr ""
"タイル、トレイ、フローティングラベルでこのブロックを示す名前で、最大 24 文字です。「通話」と「自分」という名前の 2 "
"つのブロックは、それぞれのレーンにいる 2 人の話し手として読み取れます。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:43
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:143
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:159
msgctxt "@label how likely a voice is on the lane"
msgid "Voice on this lane"
msgstr "このレーンの声"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:45
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"How likely a voice is right now, from 0 to 100 %. From the line at 50 % a "
"moment of sound counts as voiced, and three in a row show Speaking."
msgstr ""
"現在声がある可能性を 0〜100% で示します。50% の線以上になった瞬間の音は声と見なされ、それが 3 回続くと「発話中」と表示されます。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:51
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:200
msgctxt "@label how Speech Now listens"
msgid "Detector"
msgstr "検出方式"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:57
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"Voice model is a small model that runs on this computer, and is the better "
"judge. It needs a sound system running at 48 kHz, and a build that has it. "
"The card says so when one is missing."
msgstr ""
"「音声モデル」はこのコンピュータ上で動く小さなモデルで、判定がより正確です。48 kHz "
"で動作するオーディオシステムと、モデルを含むビルドが必要です。どちらかが欠けている場合は設定パネルにそう表示されます。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"Level and rhythm uses far less of the processor. It looks for sound in the "
"band speech uses, with a level that moves as syllables do. It can be wrong "
"more often: music with a beat can pass, and a voice in a noisy room can be "
"missed."
msgstr ""
"「レベルとリズム」はプロセッサーの負荷がずっと小さい方式です。話し声が使う帯域の音のうち、レベルが音節のように変化するものを探します。誤ることは多くなります:"
" ビートのある音楽が声と判定されたり、騒がしい部屋の声が見逃されたりすることがあります。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:64
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:264
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Floating label"
msgstr "フローティングラベル"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:66
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:257
msgctxt "@label where a Speech Now shows"
msgid "Show it on"
msgstr "表示先"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:69
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"A small window that stays over other programs, with a row for each Speech Now"
" that has this on, up to four. It stays when you close the main window, while"
" there is a system tray. It starts off, so nothing appears unasked."
msgstr ""
"ほかのプログラムの上に表示され続ける小さなウィンドウで、これをオンにした「発話検出」ブロックごとに 1 行ずつ、最大 4 "
"行表示します。システムトレイがあれば、メインウィンドウを閉じても残ります。初期状態ではオフなので、勝手に表示されることはありません。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"Drag it to move it. Turn it off here or in the tray's popover. On a desktop "
"that may not keep it on top, the card says so. A full-screen share may show "
"it, name included."
msgstr ""
"ドラッグすると移動できます。ここかトレイのポップアップでオフにできます。最前面に保てない可能性のあるデスクトップでは、設定パネルにそう表示されます。全画面を共有すると、名前も含めて映ることがあります。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:78
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"Adds this block to what you see when you click Reverblabr's icon in the "
"system tray: a dot and a word."
msgstr "システムトレイの Reverblabr アイコンをクリックしたときの表示に、このブロックを点と言葉で追加します。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:84
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:321
msgctxt "@title:group a part of the Speech Now card"
msgid "Place the label"
msgstr "ラベルの配置"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:94
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"The size of the label, the screen it is on, and how far it sits from that "
"screen's top left corner. There is one label for all your blocks, and it "
"stays where you left it on this desktop, whichever session you open."
msgstr ""
"ラベルの大きさ、表示する画面、その画面の左上隅からの距離です。ラベルはすべてのブロックで 1 "
"つだけで、どのセッションを開いても、このデスクトップで最後に置いた位置にとどまります。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:100
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:334
msgctxt "@label how long a voice may pause and still count as speaking"
msgid "Hold"
msgstr "ホールド"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:102
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:327
msgctxt "@title:group a part of the Speech Now card"
msgid "Timing"
msgstr "タイミング"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:105
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"How long a voice may pause and still count as Speaking, from 100 to 2000 ms. "
"It starts at 200 ms. A longer hold shows fewer false stops inside a sentence,"
" and shows the true stop later."
msgstr ""
"声が途切れても「発話中」と見なし続ける長さで、100〜2000 ms です。初期値は 200 ms "
"です。長くすると文の途中での誤った停止の表示は減りますが、本当の停止の表示は遅くなります。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:111
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:350
msgctxt "@label how long Quiet again stays up"
msgid "Quiet again for"
msgstr "「再び無音」の表示時間"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:113
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"How long Quiet again stays up, from 0 to 10 seconds. It starts at 2 seconds. "
"At 0 the block goes straight to Quiet."
msgstr "「再び無音」を表示し続ける長さで、0〜10 秒です。初期値は 2 秒です。0 にすると、すぐに「無音」に切り替わります。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:119
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:367
msgctxt "@label a voice shorter than this earns no Quiet again"
msgid "Shortest talk"
msgstr "最短の発話"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:121
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"A voice shorter than this earns no Quiet again, so a cough or an \"mm\" goes "
"back to Quiet. From 0 to 2000 ms, and it starts at 300 ms."
msgstr ""
"これより短い声では「再び無音」を表示しないので、咳や「うーん」はそのまま「無音」に戻ります。0〜2000 ms で、初期値は 300 ms です。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:128
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"You follow a call by captions, and they come too late to tell you when "
"someone has stopped."
msgstr "通話を字幕で追っていて、相手が話し終えたことを知るには字幕が遅すぎるとき。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:129
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid "A voice call has no picture to look at."
msgstr "音声通話で、見るための映像がないとき。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:130
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid "You can't tell whether a video has speech in it."
msgstr "動画に話し声が含まれているかどうかがわからないとき。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:137
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"Put one after the call's Application block and name it Call, and one after "
"your microphone's Input Device and name it You."
msgstr ""
"通話の「アプリケーション」ブロックの後に 1 つ置いて「通話」と名付け、マイクの「入力デバイス」の後にもう 1 つ置いて「自分」と名付けてください。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:138
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"If Quiet again keeps showing in the middle of sentences, raise Hold, or try "
"the Steady preset."
msgstr "文の途中で「再び無音」が何度も表示される場合は、「ホールド」を上げるか、「安定」プリセットを試してください。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:139
msgctxt "@info help page of the Speech Now block"
msgid ""
"With a screen reader, set a key for Say Who Is Speaking in System Settings. "
"One press says one sentence, such as Call speaking, You quiet. It tells you "
"who has a voice now, not when to come in."
msgstr ""
"スクリーンリーダーを使う場合は、システム設定で「誰が話しているかを読み上げ」にキーを割り当ててください。1 回押すと「通話、発話中、自分、無音」のような "
"1 文を読み上げます。わかるのは今誰の声があるかで、いつ話し始めればよいかではありません。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:122
msgctxt "@info:placeholder"
msgid "For example Call or You"
msgstr "例: 通話、自分"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:156
msgctxt "@info nothing to read a voice from"
msgid "Not live"
msgstr "停止中"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:228
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:352
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Voice model is a small model on this computer"
msgstr "「音声モデル」はこのコンピュータ上の小さなモデルです"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:229
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:353
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Level and rhythm uses less of the processor, and can be wrong more often"
msgstr "「レベルとリズム」はプロセッサーの負荷が小さいものの、誤ることが多くなります"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:279
msgctxt "@info under the Floating label check box"
msgid "This desktop may not keep it on top"
msgstr "このデスクトップでは最前面に保てない場合があります"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:291
msgctxt "@info under the Floating label check box"
msgid "The label has room for four. %1 more is left out."
msgid_plural "The label has room for four. %1 more are left out."
msgstr[0] "ラベルに表示できるのは 4 つまでです。残りの %1 個は表示されません。"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:335
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:368
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:270
msgctxt "@label milliseconds"
msgid "ms"
msgstr "ms"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:351
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:459
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:472
msgctxt "@label seconds"
msgid "s"
msgstr "秒"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:359
msgctxt "@info Quiet again for is at nought"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "オフ"

#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:382
msgctxt "@info what Speech Now can't know"
msgid ""
"Shows that a voice is on this lane, not who it is. A pause can look like an "
"end, and music can look like a voice. It can be wrong"
msgstr "このレーンに声があることを示すだけで、誰の声かは示しません。間が終わりに見えたり、音楽が声に見えたりすることがあります。誤ることもあります"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:17
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sudden Sounds block"
msgid ""
"Softens sudden sharp sounds without turning everything down. It watches five "
"ranges and acts for moments at a time. A sound that stays loud is left alone "
"after about a quarter of a second."
msgstr ""
"全体の音量を下げずに、突然の鋭い音を和らげます。5 つの帯域を監視し、そのつど一瞬だけ働きます。大きいまま続く音は、約 4 分の 1 "
"秒後からそのままにされます。"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sudden Sounds block"
msgid ""
"A new block is set to Off and changes nothing until you choose a Strength. "
"Off passes the sound as it came, only slightly later, so choosing a Strength "
"never moves anything in time."
msgstr ""
"新しいブロックは「オフ」に設定されていて、「強さ」を選ぶまで何も変えません。「オフ」でも音はわずかに遅れて、そのまま通過します。そのため「強さ」を選んでも、タイミングがずれることはありません。"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sudden Sounds block"
msgid ""
"The block compares each range of the sound with what that range held just "
"before. It does not listen for how loud a sound is. A knock far below full "
"scale can count, and a loud film scene that stays loud does not."
msgstr ""
"ブロックは音の各帯域を、その帯域の直前の音と比べます。音の大きさそのものは見ていません。フルスケールよりずっと小さいノック音が対象になることもあれば、大きいまま続く映画の場面は対象になりません。"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sudden Sounds block"
msgid ""
"In the first tenth of a second of sound it does nothing. A sound must stand "
"far above the sound before it to count, so plenty of sudden sounds pass. A "
"door's low thump goes through nearly as it came. It does not make speech "
"clearer, and it does not take noise away."
msgstr ""
"音が始まってから最初の 0.1 "
"秒間は何もしません。直前の音よりずっと大きくなければ対象にならないので、多くの突然の音はそのまま通過します。ドアの低いドンという音は、ほぼそのまま通ります。話し声をはっきりさせることも、ノイズを取り除くこともしません。"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sudden Sounds block"
msgid ""
"It works on one ear and passes the other through, lined up. Add a second "
"block for the other ear."
msgstr "片耳に働き、もう片方の耳の音はタイミングを揃えてそのまま通します。もう片方の耳には 2 つ目のブロックを追加してください。"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:37
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sudden Sounds block"
msgid "Which ear the block works on."
msgstr "ブロックが働く耳です。"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:43
#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsPanel.qml:67
msgctxt "@label how much Sudden Sounds softens"
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "強さ"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:45
#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:105
msgctxt "@option:radio Sudden Sounds' Strength"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "オフ"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:46
#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:107
msgctxt "@option:radio Sudden Sounds' Strength"
msgid "Gentle"
msgstr "穏やか"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:47
#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:109
msgctxt "@option:radio Sudden Sounds' Strength"
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "中"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:48
#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:111
msgctxt "@option:radio Sudden Sounds' Strength"
msgid "Strong"
msgstr "強め"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:51
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sudden Sounds block"
msgid ""
"Off changes nothing. Gentle takes the top off a sudden sound. Medium takes "
"off more. Strong takes off most, up to 15 dB. The louder the sudden sound "
"stands above what came before it, the more it is softened."
msgstr ""
"「オフ」は何も変えません。「穏やか」は突然の音の頂点を削ります。「中」はさらに多く削ります。「強め」は最も多く、最大 15 dB "
"削ります。突然の音が直前の音より大きいほど、強く和らげられます。"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:56
#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsPanel.qml:147
#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsPanel.qml:166
msgctxt "@label how much Sudden Sounds is taking off"
msgid "Softened now"
msgstr "現在の軽減量"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sudden Sounds block"
msgid ""
"The most taken off any one range of the sound, kept on screen for a second. "
"The whole sound falls by less."
msgstr "いずれかの帯域で削られた量の最大値で、1 秒間画面に表示されます。音全体が下がる量はこれより少なくなります。"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:63
msgctxt "@label the count on a Sudden Sounds card"
msgid "Softened in the last minute"
msgstr "直近 1 分間の軽減回数"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:65
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sudden Sounds block"
msgid ""
"How many times it softened something in the last minute. If you see it acting"
" while nothing sudden happens, it is touching speech. Gentle takes less off "
"each time, and Off stops it."
msgstr ""
"直近 1 分間に音を和らげた回数です。突然の音がないのに働いている場合は、話し声に影響しています。「穏やか」なら 1 "
"回ごとに削る量が少なくなり、「オフ」なら止まります。"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:72
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sudden Sounds block"
msgid "A cup or a pen knocks on a call, and the sharp edge of it bothers you."
msgstr "通話中にカップやペンがぶつかる音がして、その鋭さが気になるとき。"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:73
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sudden Sounds block"
msgid "Keys or clicks on somebody else's line stand out."
msgstr "相手側のキー入力やクリックの音が耳につくとき。"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:80
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sudden Sounds block"
msgid ""
"Put it before any block that moves or lifts sound, such as Frequency Lowering"
" and Hearing Compensation, so the sound is softened before it is lifted."
msgstr ""
"「周波数引き下げ」や「聴覚補正」など、音を移動したり持ち上げたりするブロックより前に置いてください。そうすれば、音が持ち上げられる前に和らげられます。"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:81
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sudden Sounds block"
msgid "Leave it off for music: it softens drums and plucked notes too."
msgstr "音楽ではオフにしておいてください: ドラムや弦をはじく音も和らげてしまいます。"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsHelp.qml:82
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sudden Sounds block"
msgid ""
"Its thresholds are provisional: they have not yet been set on recordings of "
"real sounds."
msgstr "スレッショルドは暫定値です: 実際の音の録音を使った調整はまだ行われていません。"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsPanel.qml:70
msgctxt "@label how much Sudden Sounds softens"
msgid "Strength:"
msgstr "強さ:"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsPanel.qml:220
msgctxt "@info where Sudden Sounds does harm"
msgid "Leave this off for music: it softens drums and plucked notes too"
msgstr "音楽ではオフにしておいてください: ドラムや弦をはじく音も和らげてしまいます"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsPanel.qml:227
msgctxt "@info where Sudden Sounds goes in a chain"
msgid ""
"Put this before any block that moves or lifts sound. It delays the sound by "
"less than a thousandth of a second"
msgstr "音を移動したり持ち上げたりするブロックより前に置いてください。音の遅れは 1000 分の 1 秒未満です"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:65
#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:96
#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:129
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:35
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:38
msgctxt "@info nothing to measure, the session is not running"
msgid "Not live"
msgstr "停止中"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:67
#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:98
msgctxt "@info Sudden Sounds changes nothing"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "オフ"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:71
msgctxt "@label the right ear, one letter on a tile"
msgid "R"
msgstr "R"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:72
msgctxt "@label the left ear, one letter on a tile"
msgid "L"
msgstr "L"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:82
msgctxt "@label a Sudden Sounds tile, 'L · Medium'"
msgid "%1 · %2"
msgstr "%1 · %2"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:92
msgctxt "@info:status Sudden Sounds"
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "準備完了"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:94
msgctxt "@info:status Sudden Sounds"
msgid "Softening now"
msgstr "軽減中"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:132
msgctxt "@info how much was taken off, '11 dB'"
msgid "%1 dB"
msgstr "%1 dB"

#: blocks/suddensounds/ui/SuddenSoundsWords.qml:137
msgctxt "@info how often Sudden Sounds acted"
msgid "Softened in the last minute: %1 time"
msgid_plural "Softened in the last minute: %1 times"
msgstr[0] "直近 1 分間の軽減回数: %1 回"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncFace.qml:92
msgctxt "@label what the number on a Sync tile is"
msgid "delay"
msgstr "遅延"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncFace.qml:110 blocks/sync/ui/SyncHelp.qml:35
#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncPanel.qml:137
msgctxt "@label:slider how long a Sync block holds the sound back"
msgid "Delay"
msgstr "遅延"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncHelp.qml:18
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sync block"
msgid ""
"Holds the sound back by exactly the time you set, up to two seconds, to line "
"it up with a picture or with another sound."
msgstr "設定した時間（最大 2 秒）だけ正確に音を遅らせ、映像やほかの音とタイミングを合わせます。"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sync block"
msgid ""
"Sound and picture often reach you a little apart: a video call's voice before"
" the lips move, a camera's sound after the picture, one microphone's sound a "
"moment behind another's. The block delays the lane it is in, so the early one"
" can wait for the late one."
msgstr ""
"音と映像は少しずれて届くことがよくあります。ビデオ通話で唇が動く前に声が聞こえたり、カメラの音が映像より遅れたり、あるマイクの音が別のマイクより少し遅れたりします。このブロックは自分のあるレーンを遅らせるので、早いほうを遅いほうに合わせて待たせることができます。"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sync block"
msgid ""
"The sound comes out exactly as it went in, only later. Changing the delay "
"while sound plays fades from the old delay to the new one in a fiftieth of a "
"second, so there is no click and no wobble in pitch."
msgstr ""
"音は入ったときのまま、遅れて出てくるだけです。音の再生中に遅延を変えると、50 分の 1 "
"秒で古い遅延から新しい遅延へフェードで切り替わるので、クリックノイズもピッチの揺れも生じません。"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sync block"
msgid ""
"This delay is the point of the block, so Reverblabr does not hold the other "
"lanes back to match it, as it does for blocks that are late only because of "
"how they work. Switch the block off and the delay is gone."
msgstr ""
"この遅延はブロックの目的そのものなので、Reverblabr "
"は、処理の仕組み上遅れるだけのブロックに対して行うように、ほかのレーンを遅らせてこれに合わせることはしません。ブロックをオフにすると遅延はなくなります。"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncHelp.qml:37 blocks/sync/ui/SyncPanel.qml:101
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Delay in milliseconds"
msgstr "遅延（ミリ秒）"

#. i18n: ms stands for milliseconds, thousandths of a second.
#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncHelp.qml:41
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sync block"
msgid ""
"How long the sound is held back, in milliseconds (ms), thousandths of a "
"second: from 0 to 2000 ms. A new block starts at 0, so it changes nothing "
"until you set it."
msgstr ""
"音を遅らせる時間で、単位はミリ秒（ms、1000 分の 1 秒）、0 から 2000 ms までです。新しいブロックでは 0 "
"なので、設定するまで何も変わりません。"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncHelp.qml:42
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sync block"
msgid ""
"Type the exact number in the box, to a hundredth of a millisecond; its arrows"
" go up or down a whole millisecond at a time. The slider under it gets you "
"near quickly. It gives the short delays more room: a quarter of the way along"
" is 120 ms, half way 500 ms."
msgstr ""
"欄に正確な数値を 0.01 ミリ秒単位で入力してください。矢印ボタンでは 1 "
"ミリ秒ずつ上下します。その下のスライダーを使うと、目的の値の近くまですばやく動かせます。スライダーは短い遅延に広い幅を割り当てていて、4 分の 1 "
"の位置が 120 ms、半分の位置が 500 ms です。"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncHelp.qml:43
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sync block"
msgid ""
"While the session runs, the line under the slider says the delay in samples, "
"the single steps digital sound is made of, at the session's rate. That is the"
" number to compare with a video editor's."
msgstr ""
"セッションの実行中は、スライダーの下の行に、セッションのサンプルレートでの遅延がサンプル数（デジタルの音を構成する 1 つ 1 "
"つの単位）で表示されます。動画編集ソフトの値と比べるのはこの数値です。"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncHelp.qml:50
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sync block"
msgid ""
"In a stream or a recording, your voice is heard before your lips move on the "
"camera."
msgstr "配信や録音で、カメラに映る唇が動く前に声が聞こえるとき。"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncHelp.qml:51
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sync block"
msgid ""
"Two microphones pick up the same sound at slightly different times, and "
"together they sound hollow."
msgstr "2 本のマイクが同じ音をわずかに異なるタイミングで拾い、合わせると空洞のような音になるとき。"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncHelp.qml:52
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sync block"
msgid ""
"Wireless headphones or a TV are late, and another sound has to wait for them."
msgstr "ワイヤレスヘッドホンやテレビの音が遅れ、ほかの音をそれに合わせて待たせる必要があるとき。"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncHelp.qml:59
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sync block"
msgid ""
"Put the block in the lane that is early. It can only make a sound later, "
"never earlier."
msgstr "早いほうのレーンにブロックを置いてください。音を遅らせることはできても、早めることはできません。"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncHelp.qml:60
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sync block"
msgid ""
"To line up a picture, watch something with a clear sound, such as a clap or a"
" word that starts with p or b, and change the delay a few milliseconds at a "
"time until sight and sound meet."
msgstr ""
"映像に合わせるには、手をたたく音や「パ」「バ」で始まる言葉のように、はっきりした音のある場面を見ながら、映像と音が一致するまで遅延を数ミリ秒ずつ変えてください。"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncHelp.qml:61
msgctxt "@info help page of the Sync block"
msgid ""
"Sound travels about a third of a metre in a millisecond. Two microphones a "
"metre apart are about 3 ms apart."
msgstr "音は 1 ミリ秒で約 3 分の 1 メートル進みます。1 メートル離れた 2 本のマイクでは、約 3 ms の差があります。"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncPanel.qml:63
msgctxt ""
"@info a Sync block's delay in samples, at the rate the session runs at"
msgid "%1 sample at %2 kHz"
msgid_plural "%1 samples at %2 kHz"
msgstr[0] "%2 kHz で %1 サンプル"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncPanel.qml:85
msgctxt "@label:spinbox how long a Sync block holds the sound back"
msgid "Delay"
msgstr "遅延"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncPanel.qml:125
msgctxt "@label the unit after a delay box"
msgid "ms"
msgstr "ms"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncPanel.qml:163
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"This delay is added on purpose, so the other lanes are not held back to match"
" it."
msgstr "この遅延は意図的に加えるものなので、ほかのレーンをこれに合わせて遅らせることはしません。"

#: blocks/sync/ui/SyncScale.qml:49
msgctxt "@info a delay in milliseconds"
msgid "%1 ms"
msgstr "%1 ms"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioFace.qml:59
msgctxt "@info the System Audio block is leaving nothing out"
msgid "All system audio"
msgstr "すべてのシステム音声"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioFace.qml:61
msgctxt "@info the System Audio block is leaving some applications out"
msgid "All except %1 app"
msgid_plural "All except %1 apps"
msgstr[0] "%1 個のアプリを除くすべて"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioFace.qml:67
msgctxt ""
"@info:tooltip what System Audio takes, then how many streams that is now"
msgid "%2 — %1 stream"
msgid_plural "%2 — %1 streams"
msgstr[0] "%2（%1 本のストリーム）"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:18
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"Brings in everything the computer plays, from every program at once. You can "
"leave some programs out."
msgstr "コンピュータが再生するすべての音を、すべてのプログラムからまとめて取り込みます。一部のプログラムを除外することもできます。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"Each program that plays a sound sends it to your speakers or headphones. This"
" block takes a copy of all of it, mixed together, and starts a lane with it. "
"The programs go on playing to their own device as before."
msgstr ""
"音を再生するプログラムは、それぞれスピーカーやヘッドホンに音を送っています。このブロックはそのすべてを混ぜ合わせたコピーを取り込み、それでレーンを始めます。プログラムはこれまでどおり自分のデバイスへの再生を続けます。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"A program that starts playing while the session runs is taken in as soon as "
"it does. You do not need to start the programs first."
msgstr "セッションの実行中に再生を始めたプログラムも、すぐに取り込まれます。先にプログラムを起動しておく必要はありません。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"Some sounds are always left out. Reverblabr's own sound is one, so that a "
"recording is never made of itself. Sound that another program only passes on,"
" such as the output of an echo canceller, is another, so that nothing is "
"counted twice."
msgstr ""
"常に除外される音もあります。1 つは Reverblabr 自身の音で、録音が自分自身を録音しないようにするためです。もう 1 "
"つは、エコーキャンセラーの出力のように、別のプログラムが中継しているだけの音で、同じ音が二重に数えられないようにするためです。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"Sound in more than two channels, such as a film in surround, is folded into "
"the left and the right side."
msgstr "サラウンドの映画など、3 チャンネル以上の音は左右の 2 チャンネルにまとめられます。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"The tile on the canvas says All system audio, or how many programs are left "
"out, such as All except 2 apps. While the session runs, point at the tile to "
"see how many sounds it is taking."
msgstr ""
"キャンバス上のタイルには「すべてのシステム音声」、または「2 "
"個のアプリを除くすべて」のように除外しているプログラムの数が表示されます。セッションの実行中にタイルにポインターを合わせると、取り込んでいる音の数が表示されます。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:37
#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioPanel.qml:92
msgctxt "@option:check take the machine's notification sounds too"
msgid "Include alert sounds"
msgstr "警告音も含める"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"Alert sounds are the short sounds the desktop and programs make to get your "
"attention: a new message, a reminder, an error."
msgstr "警告音とは、デスクトップやプログラムが注意を引くために鳴らす短い音のことです: 新着メッセージ、リマインダー、エラーなどです。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"They are left out of a new block, because a notification that arrives in the "
"middle of a recording is rarely meant to be in it. Tick the box to take them "
"as well."
msgstr ""
"録音の途中に届いた通知が録音に入ってほしいことはまれなので、新しいブロックでは除外されています。これらも取り込むにはチェックボックスをオンにしてください。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"Click the heading to open the list of programs the block leaves out. It is "
"empty for a new block, so everything is taken."
msgstr "見出しをクリックすると、ブロックが除外するプログラムの一覧が開きます。新しいブロックでは空なので、すべての音が取り込まれます。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:53
#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioPanel.qml:204
msgctxt "@action:button open the application picker"
msgid "Exclude source"
msgstr "音源を除外"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:55
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"Opens a list of the programs that are playing now, and of those seen "
"recently. Choose one to leave its sound out. You can search the list, or type"
" the name of a program that is not running: it is left out from the moment it"
" starts."
msgstr ""
"現在再生中のプログラムと、最近見つかったプログラムの一覧を開きます。1 "
"つ選ぶとその音が除外されます。一覧を検索したり、起動していないプログラムの名前を入力したりすることもできます: "
"そのプログラムは起動した瞬間から除外されます。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:56
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"The programs left out are listed above the button. The button at the end of a"
" row takes that program back in."
msgstr "除外したプログラムはボタンの上に一覧表示されます。行の末尾のボタンを押すと、そのプログラムが再び取り込まれます。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:57
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"The block remembers a program by what it is called, not by the sound it is "
"playing now. A program you leave out stays out when it is closed and started "
"again, and in the session the next time you open it."
msgstr ""
"ブロックはプログラムを、今再生している音ではなく名前で記憶します。除外したプログラムは、終了して再び起動しても、次にセッションを開いたときも、除外されたままです。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:64
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"You want to record or stream whatever the computer plays, whichever program "
"plays it."
msgstr "どのプログラムが再生しているかにかかわらず、コンピュータが再生するすべての音を録音や配信したいとき。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:65
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"You want everything except one program, such as the call you are in or a chat"
" program that keeps chiming."
msgstr "参加中の通話や、通知音が鳴り続けるチャットプログラムなど、1 つのプログラム以外のすべての音が欲しいとき。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:66
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"You want to treat all the computer's sound at once, for example to even it "
"out with an Auto Level block."
msgstr "たとえば「オートレベル」ブロックで均一にするなど、コンピュータのすべての音をまとめて処理したいとき。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:73
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"The programs still play to your speakers. If the lane ends in an Output "
"Device on the same speakers, you hear everything twice. Send the lane "
"somewhere else, or use it only to record."
msgstr ""
"プログラムはそのままスピーカーにも再生しています。レーンの最後に同じスピーカーを使う「出力デバイス」があると、すべての音が二重に聞こえます。レーンを別の場所に送るか、録音だけに使ってください。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:74
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"To take the sound of a single program, use an Application block instead. It "
"is easier than leaving out everything else."
msgstr "1 つのプログラムの音だけを取り込むには、代わりに「アプリケーション」ブロックを使ってください。ほかのすべてを除外するより簡単です。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:75
msgctxt "@info help page of the System Audio block"
msgid ""
"Put a Peak/RMS meter after the block and play something, to check that the "
"sound arrives."
msgstr "ブロックの後に「ピーク/RMS」メーターを置いて何かを再生し、音が届いているか確認してください。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioPanel.qml:80
msgctxt "@info what the System Audio block does"
msgid "System Audio captures everything the system plays through PipeWire."
msgstr "「システム音声」は、システムが PipeWire で再生するすべての音を取り込みます。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioPanel.qml:117
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis why alert sounds are left out by default"
msgid ""
"Notification sounds are normally excluded. Turn this on to capture them as "
"well."
msgstr "通知音は通常は除外されます。これをオンにすると通知音も取り込みます。"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioPanel.qml:134
msgctxt "@label the applications System Audio leaves out"
msgid "Excluded sources:"
msgstr "除外する音源:"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioPanel.qml:142
msgctxt "@info nothing is being left out"
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioPanel.qml:187
msgctxt "@action:button stop leaving an application out"
msgid "Take %1 back in"
msgstr "%1 を再び取り込む"

#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioPanel.qml:222
msgctxt "@info what leaving an application out does"
msgid ""
"By default all system audio is captured. Add applications here to leave them "
"out."
msgstr "デフォルトではすべてのシステム音声が取り込まれます。除外するアプリケーションをここに追加してください。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftFace.qml:75
#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:49
#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftPanel.qml:192
msgctxt "@action:button play a paused Time Shift"
msgid "Play"
msgstr "再生"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftFace.qml:76
#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:48
#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftPanel.qml:193
msgctxt "@action:button pause a Time Shift"
msgid "Pause"
msgstr "一時停止"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftFace.qml:89
msgctxt "@action:button jump ten seconds back, as short as the tile needs"
msgid "‹‹ 10 s"
msgstr "‹‹ 10 秒"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftFace.qml:94
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Jump back 10 seconds"
msgstr "10 秒戻る"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftFace.qml:106
msgctxt "@action:button jump ten seconds forward, as short as the tile needs"
msgid "10 s ››"
msgstr "10 秒 ››"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftFace.qml:111
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Jump forward 10 seconds"
msgstr "10 秒進む"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:18
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid ""
"Lets you pause and rewind sound that is still arriving, such as a radio "
"stream or a call, and catch up with it again."
msgstr "ラジオのストリームや通話など、今まさに届いている音を一時停止したり巻き戻したりして、その後また追いつくことができます。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid ""
"The block keeps everything that reaches it while the session runs, up to the "
"number of minutes you choose. What you hear after it is played from what it "
"has kept, so you can pause, go back and listen again, while the sound goes on"
" arriving and being kept."
msgstr ""
"セッションの実行中、このブロックは届いた音をすべて、選んだ分数まで保持します。ブロックの後で聞こえる音は保持した音から再生されるので、音が届いて保持され続けている間も、一時停止したり、戻って聞き直したりできます。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid ""
"At live, the sound goes straight through, with no delay at all. Once you "
"pause or go back, you hear it later than it arrives, and everything after the"
" block hears it that late too."
msgstr ""
"ライブの状態では、音は遅延なしでそのまま通ります。一時停止したり戻ったりすると、届いたときより遅れて聞こえ、ブロックの後にあるものもすべて、同じだけ遅れて受け取ります。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid ""
"Every pause, jump and return to live fades over a hundredth of a second, so "
"nothing clicks."
msgstr "一時停止、ジャンプ、ライブへの復帰はどれも 100 分の 1 秒かけてフェードするので、クリックノイズは出ません。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid ""
"Up to ten minutes are kept in memory. A longer history is kept in a file in "
"your cache folder instead, with only its last minute in memory as well. The "
"file is gone when the session stops, and nothing kept is saved with the "
"session."
msgstr ""
"10 分までは、メモリに保持します。それより長い履歴は、代わりにキャッシュフォルダ内のファイルに保持し、最後の 1 "
"分だけはメモリにも置きます。ファイルはセッションの停止時に削除され、保持した音がセッションと一緒に保存されることはありません。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid ""
"The controls need the session running, since there is nothing kept until it "
"starts."
msgstr "セッションが始まるまでは何も保持されていないので、操作するにはセッションの実行が必要です。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:37
#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftPanel.qml:115
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Position"
msgstr "再生位置"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid ""
"Where you are in what has been kept: the oldest sound at the left, live at "
"the right. The number beside it says how far behind live you are, or Live."
msgstr ""
"保持された音の中での現在位置です: "
"左端が最も古い音、右端がライブです。横の数値は、ライブからどれだけ遅れているかを示し、遅れていないときは「ライブ」と表示されます。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid ""
"Drag it and let go to jump there. While paused, it moves left by itself, as "
"live moves away from you."
msgstr "ドラッグして離すと、その位置にジャンプします。一時停止中は、ライブが先へ進んでいくため、位置が自然に左へ動きます。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:46
#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftPanel.qml:167
msgctxt "@title:group the Time Shift's play, pause, jump and live buttons"
msgid "Playback"
msgstr "再生"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:50
#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftPanel.qml:225
msgctxt "@action:button back to what is arriving now, and playing"
msgid "Live"
msgstr "ライブ"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:53
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid "The row of buttons under the slider:"
msgstr "スライダーの下に並ぶボタン:"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:56
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block, a button of the Time Shift"
msgid ""
"30 s, 10 s and 3 s on the left jump back that many seconds, as far as the "
"oldest sound kept."
msgstr "左側の「30 秒」「10 秒」「3 秒」は、保持されている最も古い音を限度に、その秒数だけ戻ります。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:57
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block, a button of the Time Shift"
msgid ""
"The button in the middle pauses: the sound fades out and waits while the "
"arrival goes on being kept. Press it again to play on from where you paused."
msgstr ""
"中央のボタンは一時停止です: 音はフェードアウトして待機し、届く音はその間も保持され続けます。もう一度押すと、一時停止した位置から再生を続けます。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block, a button of the Time Shift"
msgid ""
"3 s, 10 s and 30 s on the right jump forward that many seconds. A jump past "
"live lands at live. They are unavailable while you are at live."
msgstr "右側の「3 秒」「10 秒」「30 秒」は、その秒数だけ進みます。ライブを越える場合は、ライブで止まります。ライブの状態では使えません。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:59
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block, a button of the Time Shift"
msgid "Live goes straight back to what is arriving now, and plays it."
msgstr "「ライブ」は、今届いている音にすぐ戻って再生します。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:65
#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftPanel.qml:261
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Minutes to keep"
msgstr "保持時間（分）"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:67
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid ""
"How far back you can go, from 1 to 60 minutes. A new block keeps 5. Up to 10 "
"minutes stay in memory; more uses a file on disk, which needs room: a stereo "
"hour at 48 kHz is about 1.4 GB."
msgstr ""
"どこまで戻れるかを、1〜60 分の範囲で設定します。新しいブロックは 5 分です。10 "
"分まではメモリに置かれ、それ以上はディスク上のファイルを使うので空き容量が必要です: 48 kHz のステレオで 1 時間分は約 1.4 GB です。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:74
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid ""
"The doorbell rings during a radio programme, and you want to hear the rest "
"when you come back."
msgstr "ラジオ番組の途中で玄関のチャイムが鳴り、戻ってから続きを聞きたいとき。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:75
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid ""
"You missed what somebody said in a call or a live stream, and want to hear it"
" again."
msgstr "通話やライブ配信で相手の言ったことを聞き逃し、もう一度聞きたいとき。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:76
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid ""
"You are writing down what you hear, and need to stop and go back now and "
"then."
msgstr "聞いた内容を書き取っていて、ときどき止めたり戻ったりする必要があるとき。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:83
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid ""
"Put the block just before your speakers, so that a Recorder before it keeps "
"everything as it arrived, whatever you pause."
msgstr ""
"このブロックはスピーカーの直前に置いてください。そうすれば、その前にある「レコーダー」は、一時停止に関係なく、届いたとおりにすべてを録音できます。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:84
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid ""
"Give it global shortcuts to pause and jump without looking at the window: "
"Time Shift: pause or play, back 10 seconds, forward 10 seconds and back to "
"live, in System Settings, under Keyboard, Shortcuts, Reverblabr."
msgstr ""
"グローバルショートカットを割り当てると、ウィンドウを見ずに一時停止やジャンプができます: システム設定の「キーボード › ショートカット › "
"Reverblabr」にある「タイムシフト: 一時停止/再生」「10 秒戻る」「10 秒進む」「ライブに戻る」です。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftHelp.qml:85
msgctxt "@info help page of the Time Shift block"
msgid ""
"Keep only as many minutes as you need: a short history stays in memory and "
"never touches the disk."
msgstr "保持する時間は必要な分だけにしてください: 短い履歴ならメモリ内に収まり、ディスクを使いません。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftPanel.qml:58
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Jump back %1 second"
msgid_plural "Jump back %1 seconds"
msgstr[0] "%1 秒戻る"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftPanel.qml:59
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Jump forward %1 second"
msgid_plural "Jump forward %1 seconds"
msgstr[0] "%1 秒進む"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftPanel.qml:61
msgctxt "@action:button a Time Shift jump, '10 s'"
msgid "%1 s"
msgstr "%1 秒"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftPanel.qml:89
msgctxt "@label:slider where a Time Shift block's play head is"
msgid "Position"
msgstr "再生位置"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftPanel.qml:147
msgctxt "@label the Time Shift buttons that go back"
msgid "← Jump back"
msgstr "← 戻る"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftPanel.qml:154
msgctxt "@label the Time Shift buttons that go forward"
msgid "Jump forward →"
msgstr "進む →"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftPanel.qml:230
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Back to what is arriving now, and play it"
msgstr "今届いている音に戻って再生します"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftPanel.qml:245
msgctxt "@label:spinbox how many minutes a Time Shift block keeps"
msgid "Minutes to keep"
msgstr "保持時間（分）"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftPanel.qml:274
msgctxt "@info how the Time Shift block works"
msgid ""
"Everything that arrives is kept, so it can be paused, gone back through and "
"caught up with. Up to ten minutes are kept in memory; more is kept on disk, "
"in the cache folder, and gone when the session stops."
msgstr ""
"届いた音はすべて保持されるので、一時停止したり、さかのぼったり、また追いついたりできます。10 "
"分まではメモリに、それ以上はディスク上のキャッシュフォルダに保持され、セッションの停止時に削除されます。"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftState.qml:49
msgctxt "@info a Time Shift block holding its play head"
msgid "Paused"
msgstr "一時停止中"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftState.qml:50
msgctxt "@info a Time Shift block playing what arrives as it arrives"
msgid "Live"
msgstr "ライブ"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftState.qml:57
msgctxt "@info a Time Shift play head at live"
msgid "Live"
msgstr "ライブ"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftState.qml:60
msgctxt "@info how far behind live, in seconds, '−3.5 s'"
msgid "−%1 s"
msgstr "−%1 秒"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftState.qml:64
msgctxt "@info how far behind live, in seconds, '−42 s'"
msgid "−%1 s"
msgstr "−%1 秒"

#: blocks/timeshift/ui/TimeShiftState.qml:69
msgctxt "@info how far behind live, in minutes and seconds, '−12:05'"
msgid "−%1:%2"
msgstr "−%1:%2"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorGraph.qml:61
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis the Voice Compressor's graph"
msgid ""
"Level going out against level coming in. The settings are in the rows under "
"it."
msgstr "入力レベルに対する出力レベルのグラフです。設定はその下の行にあります。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorGraph.qml:74
msgctxt "@label the axis across the Voice Compressor's graph"
msgid "In, dBFS"
msgstr "入力（dBFS）"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorGraph.qml:75
msgctxt "@label the axis up the Voice Compressor's graph"
msgid "Out, dBFS"
msgstr "出力（dBFS）"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:17
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block"
msgid ""
"Holds a voice steady with three controls: how much to compress, how far to "
"lower the quiet between words, and the highest level that may leave the "
"block."
msgstr "どれだけ圧縮するか、言葉の間の静かな部分をどこまで下げるか、ブロックから出せる最大レベル、という 3 つの操作で声を安定させます。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block"
msgid ""
"The sound goes through a gate, then a compressor, then a limiter. The gate "
"gently lowers what is under its level. The compressor takes off some of what "
"is loud and brings the whole sound back up. The limiter stops any peak at the"
" ceiling."
msgstr ""
"音はゲート、コンプレッサー、リミッターの順に通ります。ゲートは、設定したレベルより小さい音を穏やかに下げます。コンプレッサーは大きな音を少し削り、音全体を持ち上げ直します。リミッターは、どんなピークも上限で止めます。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block"
msgid ""
"Compression makes up the level by itself, so lowering it makes the voice "
"louder as well as steadier. There is no attack or release to set: a syllable "
"is let go quickly, and a long loud line slowly."
msgstr ""
"「コンプレッション」はレベルを自動的に補うので、下げると声が安定するだけでなく大きくもなります。アタックやリリースの設定はありません。音節はすばやく、長く続く大きなフレーズはゆっくり解放されます。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block"
msgid ""
"A new block is set to Compression -12 dB, Gate off and Ceiling -6 dBFS. It "
"works from the start: a sound at -18 dBFS comes out about 3.5 dB higher. The "
"sound is delayed by about 2 milliseconds."
msgstr ""
"新しいブロックは、「コンプレッション」-12 dB、「ゲート」オフ、「上限」-6 dBFS に設定されています。最初から効果があり、-18 dBFS "
"の音は約 3.5 dB 大きくなって出ていきます。音は約 2 ミリ秒遅れます。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block"
msgid ""
"The tile shows what the compressor and the gate take off together, what the "
"block is doing, and its settings. Both sides of a stereo sound get one gain, "
"so the picture does not move."
msgstr ""
"タイルには、コンプレッサーとゲートが合わせてどれだけ下げているか、ブロックがいま何をしているか、その設定が表示されます。ステレオの左右には同じゲインがかかるので、音像は動きません。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:35
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:131
msgctxt "@label the Voice Compressor's choice of voice types"
msgid "Voice"
msgstr "声"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:37
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:202
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox a voice type for the Voice Compressor"
msgid "Soft voice"
msgstr "やわらかな声"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:38
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:204
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox a voice type for the Voice Compressor"
msgid "Speech"
msgstr "話し声"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:39
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:206
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox a voice type for the Voice Compressor"
msgid "Strong voice"
msgstr "力強い声"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:40
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:208
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox a voice type for the Voice Compressor"
msgid "Singing"
msgstr "歌声"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:43
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block"
msgid ""
"A place to start from. Each choice sets all three controls, and moving one "
"takes the choice away."
msgstr "出発点として使います。どの選択肢も 3 つの操作をすべて設定し、どれか 1 つを動かすと選択は解除されます。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:46
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block, one voice type"
msgid "Soft voice: more compression, for someone who speaks quietly."
msgstr "やわらかな声: 圧縮を強めにします。小さな声で話す人向けです。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block, one voice type"
msgid "Speech: for an ordinary voice at a microphone."
msgstr "話し声: マイクに向かって話す普通の声向けです。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block, one voice type"
msgid ""
"Strong voice: less compression, for someone who speaks loudly and close."
msgstr "力強い声: 圧縮を弱めにします。マイクの近くで大きな声で話す人向けです。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block, one voice type"
msgid "Singing: no gate, so held notes and their ends are left alone."
msgstr "歌声: ゲートを使わないので、伸ばした音やその終わりはそのまま残ります。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:55
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:164
msgctxt "@title:group the Voice Compressor's graph"
msgid "Level in and out"
msgstr "入出力レベル"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:57
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block"
msgid ""
"What comes out for a steady level going in, with a dashed line where nothing "
"changes and a line at the ceiling. While sound plays, a dot shows where it is"
" now. The dot leaves the curve for a moment after the level changes, which is"
" the block on its way to a new gain."
msgstr ""
"一定のレベルを入れたときに何が出てくるかを表し、何も変わらない位置に破線、上限の位置に線があります。音の再生中は、点がいまの位置を示します。レベルが変わった直後に点が一瞬カーブから離れるのは、ブロックが新しいゲインへ移る途中だからです。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:63
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:186
msgctxt "@label:slider the Voice Compressor's one compression control"
msgid "Compression"
msgstr "コンプレッション"

#. i18n: dB stands for decibels.
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:66
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block"
msgid ""
"How much to compress, from 0 to -36 decibels (dB). Lower is more: it starts "
"sooner, holds back harder, from a ratio of 2:1 to 6:1, and brings the rest up"
" further. The line under it says the ratio and the level made up."
msgstr ""
"どれだけ圧縮するかで、0〜-36 デシベル（dB）です。低いほど強くなり、より早くかかり始め、2:1 から 6:1 "
"までのレシオでより強く抑え、残りをより大きく持ち上げます。その下の行に、レシオと補ったレベルが表示されます。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:72
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:214
msgctxt ""
"@label:slider the level under which the Voice Compressor lowers the sound"
msgid "Gate"
msgstr "ゲート"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:74
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block"
msgid ""
"The level under which the sound is lowered, from Off to 0 dB. Higher lowers "
"more. It eases in, each decibel under the gate comes out two under, and it "
"never takes off more than 24 dB, so a room falls away without ever cutting to"
" silence. The bar under it shows the level coming in, with a mark where the "
"Gate stands."
msgstr ""
"これより小さい音を下げるレベルで、「オフ」から 0 dB までです。高いほど多く下げます。効き方は緩やかで、ゲートより 1 dB 小さい音は 2 dB "
"小さくなって出ていき、24 dB "
"を超えて下げることはないので、部屋の音は小さくなっても完全な無音にはなりません。その下のバーには入力レベルが表示され、「ゲート」の位置に印があります。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:80
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:268
msgctxt "@label:slider the highest level the Voice Compressor lets out"
msgid "Ceiling"
msgstr "上限"

#. i18n: dBFS stands for decibels below full scale.
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:83
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block"
msgid ""
"The highest level that may leave the block, from -36 to 0 decibels below full"
" scale (dBFS). The whole sound moves with it, so it does the work of a level "
"control too."
msgstr ""
"ブロックから出してよい最大のレベルで、フルスケール基準のデシベル（dBFS）で -36〜0 "
"です。音全体がこれに合わせて動くので、音量調整の役割も果たします。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:84
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block"
msgid ""
"In the top 12 dB it also drives the limiter, more the higher it goes, which "
"makes the sound denser and the level steadier. Below that the limiter takes "
"only the peaks that get past the compressor."
msgstr ""
"上の 12 dB "
"の範囲では、高くするほどリミッターも強くかかり、音の密度が増してレベルが安定します。それより下では、リミッターはコンプレッサーをすり抜けたピークだけを抑えます。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:90
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:281
msgctxt ""
"@option:check keeps the gap between two of the Voice Compressor's controls"
msgid "Link Compression and Ceiling"
msgstr "コンプレッションと上限を連動"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:92
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block"
msgid ""
"Moves both by the same amount, to hear what the compressor does with little "
"change of level. Find a gap that sounds level to you, then move them. It is a"
" way of listening: it is not saved with the block."
msgstr ""
"両方を同じ量だけ動かすので、レベルをあまり変えずにコンプレッサーの働きを聞けます。音量がそろって聞こえる差を見つけてから、両方を動かしてください。これは聞き比べのための機能で、ブロックと一緒には保存されません。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:98
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:286
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:295
msgctxt "@label the Voice Compressor's total meter"
msgid "Taken off by compression and gate"
msgstr "コンプレッションとゲートによる低減量"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:100
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:340
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Reset the most taken off"
msgstr "最大低減量をリセット"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:103
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block"
msgid ""
"The two added together, as the tile shows it. The line under the bars holds "
"the most taken off, and Reset forgets it. The limiter has a bar of its own."
msgstr ""
"2 つを合計したもので、タイルと同じ値です。バーの下の行には最大低減量が保持され、「リセット」で消去されます。リミッターには専用のバーがあります。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:110
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block, when to use it"
msgid ""
"A voice at a microphone, for a call, a stream or a recording, when you want "
"it even with little setting up."
msgstr "通話、配信、録音で、マイクの声を手間をかけずに均一にしたいとき。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:111
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block, when to use it"
msgid ""
"For one number and no more, use Simple Compressor. To set every number, use "
"Dynamics Processor."
msgstr "設定を 1 つで済ませたいなら「簡易コンプレッサー」を、すべての数値を設定したいなら「ダイナミクスプロセッサー」を使ってください。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:118
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block, a tip"
msgid ""
"Set Compression first, then Ceiling, then Gate: the other two change the "
"level the Ceiling works on."
msgstr "「コンプレッション」、「上限」、「ゲート」の順に設定してください。「上限」が働くレベルは、他の 2 つによって変わるためです。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:119
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block, a tip"
msgid ""
"If the voice sounds rough, the limiter is working too hard. Lower the "
"Ceiling, or the sound coming in."
msgstr "声が粗く聞こえる場合は、リミッターが働きすぎています。「上限」か、入ってくる音を下げてください。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:120
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block, a tip"
msgid "If word endings are cut, lower the Gate."
msgstr "言葉の終わりが切れる場合は、「ゲート」を下げてください。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorHelp.qml:121
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Compressor block, a tip"
msgid ""
"For a hard limit downstream of everything, use a Limiter or the output limit:"
" this ceiling can be raised with a drag."
msgstr ""
"すべての後段で確実に上限を設けるには、「リミッター」か出力の制限を使ってください。このブロックの上限は、ドラッグ 1 つで上げられてしまいます。"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:52
msgctxt "@info the most Voice Compressor took off, 'Most taken off 7.2 dB'"
msgid "Most taken off %1 dB"
msgstr "最大低減量 %1 dB"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:187
msgctxt "@label the unit of Compression"
msgid "dB"
msgstr "dB"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:188
msgctxt "@info a level, '-12 dB'"
msgid "%1 dB"
msgstr "%1 dB"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:201
msgctxt "@info under Compression, 'Ratio 3.3:1, level made up 9.4 dB'"
msgid "Lower is more. Ratio %1:1, level made up %2 dB"
msgstr "低いほど強くなります。レシオ %1:1、補ったレベル %2 dB"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:215
msgctxt "@label the unit of Gate"
msgid "dB"
msgstr "dB"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:220
msgctxt "@info the Voice Compressor's gate at its lowest"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "オフ"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:221
msgctxt "@info under Gate at its lowest"
msgid "Nothing is lowered"
msgstr "何も下げません"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:228
msgctxt "@info under Gate, where the level in stands against it"
msgid ""
"Set it just above the room between words, with the level coming in as a guide"
msgstr "入力レベルを目安に、言葉の間の部屋の音より少し上に設定してください"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:235
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:244
msgctxt "@label the Voice Compressor's input meter"
msgid "Level coming in"
msgstr "入力レベル"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:269
msgctxt "@label the unit of Ceiling"
msgid "dBFS"
msgstr "dBFS"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:270
msgctxt "@info a level, '-6 dBFS'"
msgid "%1 dBFS"
msgstr "%1 dBFS"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:304
#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:313
msgctxt "@label the Voice Compressor's limiter meter"
msgid "Taken off by the limiter"
msgstr "リミッターによる低減量"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:339
msgctxt "@action:button forgets the most Voice Compressor took off"
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "リセット"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorPanel.qml:349
msgctxt "@info what the Voice Compressor does"
msgid ""
"Holds a voice steady. The attack and release are set for you: a syllable lets"
" go quickly, a long loud line lets go slowly. Too much at a high Ceiling can "
"sound rough, so lower the Ceiling or the sound coming in"
msgstr ""
"声を安定させます。アタックとリリースは自動で設定され、音節はすばやく、長く続く大きなフレーズはゆっくり解放されます。「上限」が高いときにかけすぎると粗く聞こえることがあるので、「上限」か入ってくる音を下げてください"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:130
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Compressor tile says it is doing"
msgid "no sound"
msgstr "音なし"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:132
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Compressor tile says it is doing"
msgid "below compression"
msgstr "圧縮範囲外"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:134
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Compressor tile says it is doing"
msgid "compressing"
msgstr "圧縮中"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:136
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Compressor tile says it is doing"
msgid "gate lowering"
msgstr "ゲート作動中"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:138
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Compressor tile says it is doing"
msgid "at the ceiling"
msgstr "上限に到達"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:140
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Compressor tile says while its session is stopped"
msgid "Not playing"
msgstr "停止中"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:142
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Compressor tile says when switched off"
msgid "Switched off"
msgstr "オフ"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:152
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Compressor"
msgid "No sound coming in"
msgstr "入力音なし"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:154
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Compressor"
msgid "Below compression, nothing taken off"
msgstr "圧縮範囲外、低減なし"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:156
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Compressor, 'Taking off 6.2 dB'"
msgid "Taking off %1 dB"
msgstr "%1 dB 低減中"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:159
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Compressor, 'Gate lowering, 12.0 dB off'"
msgid "Gate lowering, %1 dB off"
msgstr "ゲート作動中、%1 dB 低減"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:162
msgctxt ""
"@info:status Voice Compressor, 'At the ceiling, compression and gate took off"
" 6.2 dB'"
msgid "At the ceiling, compression and gate took off %1 dB"
msgstr "上限に到達、コンプレッションとゲートで %1 dB 低減"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:164
msgctxt "@info:status a Voice Compressor that is switched off"
msgid "Switched off"
msgstr "オフ"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:166
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Compressor while its session is stopped"
msgid "Not playing"
msgstr "停止中"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:177
msgctxt "@info a reduction in decibels, '-6.2 dB'"
msgid "-%1 dB"
msgstr "-%1 dB"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:183
msgctxt ""
"@info Voice Compressor's settings on its tile: compression, then ceiling, "
"'-12 dB, ceiling -6'"
msgid "%1 dB, ceiling %2"
msgstr "%1 dB、上限 %2"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:189
msgctxt ""
"@info Voice Compressor's settings, 'Compression -12 dB, ceiling -6 dBFS'"
msgid "Compression %1 dB, ceiling %2 dBFS"
msgstr "コンプレッション %1 dB、上限 %2 dBFS"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:195
msgctxt "@info Voice Compressor's gate"
msgid "Gate off"
msgstr "ゲートオフ"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:196
msgctxt "@info Voice Compressor's gate, 'Gate -50 dB'"
msgid "Gate %1 dB"
msgstr "ゲート %1 dB"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardFace.qml:42
msgctxt "@info Voice Forward is switched off"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "オフ"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardFace.qml:45
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Turns down what differs between left and right. A sound that is alike on both"
" sides stays where it is"
msgstr "左右で異なる音を下げます。左右で同じ音はそのまま残ります"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardFace.qml:100
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:45
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:108
msgctxt "@label:slider how far Voice Forward turns the rest of the sound down"
msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景音"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:17
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"Finds what is alike on both sides of a stereo sound and turns the rest down. "
"At 0 dB, or switched off, the sound passes unchanged."
msgstr "ステレオの音の左右で共通する部分を見つけ、それ以外を下げます。0 dB のとき、またはオフのときは、音はそのまま通ります。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"A new block is set to 0 dB and changes nothing. Pull Background down on the "
"tile while people talk, until the voices sit where you want them. Switched "
"off, the sound is the input as it came, and it stays lined up with the "
"picture."
msgstr ""
"新しいブロックは 0 dB "
"に設定されていて、何も変えません。人が話している間にタイルの「背景音」を下げていき、声がちょうどよく聞こえるところで止めてください。オフのときは入力の音がそのまま出力され、映像とのタイミングもずれません。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"The block looks for what is alike on both sides, band by band. It does not "
"know what a voice is. A voice in the middle stays, and so do a kick drum, a "
"bass and a lead singer. A voice off to one side goes down with the rest. A "
"sound panned part-way can move towards the middle, and its quieter side can "
"get louder."
msgstr ""
"このブロックは、左右で共通する部分を帯域ごとに探します。声が何かを知っているわけではありません。中央の声は残り、キックドラムやベース、リードボーカルも同じように残ります。片側に寄った声は、ほかの音と一緒に下がります。途中まで振られた音は中央寄りに動くことがあり、その音の小さい側が大きくなることもあります。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"While a good part of the voice band is in the centre the rest goes down by "
"Background. Otherwise it goes down by Between voices, so the room and the "
"music stay. A line's first syllable can come under the louder background, "
"since the block does not look ahead."
msgstr ""
"声の帯域のかなりの部分が中央にある間は、それ以外の音が「背景音」の分だけ下がります。そうでないときは「声の合間」の分だけ下がるので、部屋の響きや音楽は残ります。ブロックは先読みをしないため、セリフの最初の音節が、まだ下がりきっていない背景音に重なることがあります。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"A dB on the slider does not buy a dB. Taken out now shows what it really "
"does, often much less, and -24 dB is not far beyond -12 dB. It may sound "
"watery."
msgstr ""
"スライダーの 1 dB が、そのまま 1 dB の効果になるわけではありません。実際の効果は「現在の低減量」に表示され、多くの場合ずっと小さく、-24 "
"dB も -12 dB とそれほど変わりません。水っぽい音に聞こえることがあります。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"On a mono sound both sides are alike, so between 100 Hz and 12 kHz there is "
"nothing to move, and the card says so. Under and over that the sound still "
"goes down, so a low rumble or a bass falls. With one side silent, or one side"
" in reversed polarity, everything counts as the rest."
msgstr ""
"モノラルの音では左右が同じなので、100 Hz から 12 kHz "
"の間では動かすものがなく、設定パネルにその旨が表示されます。その範囲より下と上では音が下がるので、低いうなりやベースは小さくなります。片側が無音のときや、片側の極性が反転しているときは、すべてが「それ以外」の音として扱われます。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"It holds the sound back by about 23 ms at 48 kHz, even at 0 dB. A wireless "
"link or another delay adds to that, and the sound can fall behind the "
"picture."
msgstr "0 dB でも、48 kHz で約 23 ms 音を遅らせます。ワイヤレス接続やほかの遅延が加わると、音が映像より遅れることがあります。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:28
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"A limit at -1 dBFS stops peaks whenever the block changes anything. It is a "
"digital limit, not a level at your ears. At 0 dB, after the lift has gone, "
"the limit steps aside too, so nothing is changed at all."
msgstr ""
"ブロックが何かを変えているときは、-1 dBFS の制限がピークを止めます。これはデジタルの制限で、耳元のレベルではありません。0 dB "
"では、持ち上げがなくなった後に制限も外れるので、何も変わりません。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:35
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"For a film or a show in stereo, when music and effects cover the voices. Put "
"it after any other cleaning and levelling, and before One Ear Mix: after a "
"fold there is no left and right left to compare. Not for a game, where sounds"
" at the sides tell you where things are. No measurement here shows that it "
"helps anyone follow speech, and many people prefer the original."
msgstr ""
"音楽や効果音が声をかき消してしまう、ステレオの映画や番組に。ほかのノイズ除去やレベル調整の後、「片耳ミックス」の前に置いてください。片耳にまとめた後では、比べる左右がもう残っていません。ゲームには向きません。ゲームでは左右の音が物の位置を教えてくれるからです。このブロックが話を聞き取りやすくするという測定結果はなく、元の音のほうを好む人も多くいます。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"How far the rest of the sound goes down while there is sound in the centre, "
"from 0 to -24 dB. The presets Music stays and Voices first set -6 dB and -15 "
"dB."
msgstr ""
"中央に音がある間、それ以外の音をどれだけ下げるかで、0 から -24 dB までです。プリセットの「音楽を残す」と「声を優先」は、それぞれ -6 dB と"
" -15 dB に設定します。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:53
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:256
msgctxt "@title:group Voice Forward"
msgid "Between voices"
msgstr "声の合間"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:55
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"How far the rest goes down when the centre is quiet. The cut used stops at "
"Background. Set it to the same value as Background for one cut all the time."
msgstr ""
"中央が静かなときに、それ以外の音をどれだけ下げるかです。実際に使われる低減量は「背景音」を超えません。常に同じだけ下げたいときは、「背景音」と同じ値に設定してください。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:61
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:200
msgctxt "@option:check Voice Forward"
msgid "Hold level"
msgstr "レベルを保持"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:63
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"What is taken out makes the whole sound quieter. This raises it again, slowly"
" and by up to 6 dB, from the difference between the sound before and after. "
"It starts after 3 s, and it follows the quiet parts too, so the voices stand "
"out a little less. Leave it on when you compare, since the louder version "
"tends to win."
msgstr ""
"取り除いた分だけ、音全体が小さくなります。この設定は、処理前と処理後の音の差をもとに、最大 6 dB までゆっくりと音を上げ直します。3 "
"秒後に働き始め、静かな部分にも追従するので、声の目立ち方は少し弱まります。比較するときはオンのままにしてください。音が大きいほうがよく聞こえてしまいがちだからです。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:68
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:129
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:154
msgctxt "@label how much lower Voice Forward has made the sound"
msgid "Taken out now"
msgstr "現在の低減量"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"How much lower this sound is now, before any lift. The white line is "
"Background."
msgstr "持ち上げる前の時点で、今この音がどれだけ低くなっているかです。白い線は「背景音」の値です。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:75
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:182
msgctxt "@label what Voice Forward's mask found"
msgid "Found now"
msgstr "現在の検出結果"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:77
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:122
msgctxt "@info what Voice Forward found"
msgid "Centre sound"
msgstr "中央の音"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:78
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:120
msgctxt "@info what Voice Forward found"
msgid "Wide sound"
msgstr "広がった音"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:79
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:124
msgctxt "@info what Voice Forward found"
msgid "Both sides alike"
msgstr "左右が同じ"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:80
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:126
msgctxt "@info what Voice Forward found"
msgid "Quiet"
msgstr "静か"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:83
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"One word from what the block found. Centre sound is what takes Background, "
"and Wide sound what takes Between voices. Both sides alike comes after five "
"seconds of nothing else. Quiet keeps the last cut."
msgstr ""
"ブロックが検出したものをひとことで示します。「中央の音」のときは「背景音」が、「広がった音」のときは「声の合間」が使われます。「左右が同じ」は、ほかのものが"
" 5 秒間見つからなかったときに表示されます。「静か」のときは直前の低減量が保たれます。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:90
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"Press and hold it, or hold B with the focus in the card, on a talk scene with"
" music under it. Enter on the button keeps it on until the next Enter. It is "
"the block's real off state, so the picture does not move, and a level gap is "
"stated and not hidden: with Hold level off, a line says by how much."
msgstr ""
"音楽が流れる会話の場面で、押し続けるか、設定パネルにフォーカスがある状態で B キーを押し続けてください。ボタン上で Enter を押すと、次に "
"Enter "
"を押すまでオンのままになります。これはブロックの本当のオフ状態なので映像とのずれは生じず、音量の差も隠さずに示されます。「レベルを保持」がオフのときは、差がどれだけかが"
" 1 行で表示されます。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:97
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"For a whole evening, fork the lane after the source and send one side through"
" Voice Forward and one straight to an Input Switch. The two stay lined up, "
"and the switch has a global shortcut that works over a full-screen film."
msgstr ""
"一晩中使うなら、音源の後でレーンを分岐し、一方を「声を前に」に通し、もう一方を直接「入力切替」に送ってください。2 "
"つはタイミングがずれず、「入力切替」にはフルスクリーンの映画の上でも使えるグローバルショートカットがあります。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:98
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"A global shortcut can switch the block on and off. System Settings lists it "
"as Voice Forward on or off."
msgstr "グローバルショートカットでブロックのオン・オフを切り替えられます。システム設定では「声を前に」のオン/オフとして表示されます。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:99
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"Headphones show the change more than laptop speakers. Try it on what you "
"really watch on."
msgstr "ノートパソコンのスピーカーよりヘッドホンのほうが変化がよくわかります。実際に視聴に使う機器で試してください。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:109
msgctxt "@label the unit of Background"
msgid "dB"
msgstr "dB"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:115
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"How far the rest of the sound goes down while there is sound in the centre"
msgstr "中央に音がある間、それ以外の音をどれだけ下げるか"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:132
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "How much lower this sound is now, before any lift"
msgstr "持ち上げる前の時点で、今この音がどれだけ低くなっているか"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:204
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Slowly raises the whole sound by up to 6 dB, after what was taken out"
msgstr "取り除いた分に応じて、音全体を最大 6 dB までゆっくり上げます"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:236
msgctxt "@info while Hold for before is on"
msgid "Hearing the sound before this block"
msgstr "このブロックを通す前の音を再生中"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:264
msgctxt ""
"@label:slider how far Voice Forward turns the sound down when the centre is "
"quiet"
msgid "Between voices"
msgstr "声の合間"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:265
msgctxt "@label the unit of Between voices"
msgid "dB"
msgstr "dB"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:271
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "How far the rest goes down when the centre is quiet"
msgstr "中央が静かなときに、それ以外の音をどれだけ下げるか"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:282
msgctxt "@info what Voice Forward can't do"
msgid ""
"Finds what is alike on both sides. It can't tell a voice from centred music "
"or a drum, and a voice off to one side goes down with the rest"
msgstr "左右で共通する部分を見つけます。声と、中央にある音楽やドラムを区別することはできず、片側に寄った声はほかの音と一緒に下がります"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:91
msgctxt "@label a Voice Forward tile, the setting has nothing to work on"
msgid "both sides alike"
msgstr "左右が同じ"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:93
msgctxt "@label a Voice Forward tile, 'background · -3 now'"
msgid "background · %1 now"
msgstr "背景音 · 現在 %1"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:98
msgctxt "@label what the number on a Voice Forward tile is"
msgid "background"
msgstr "背景音"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:105
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Forward"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "オフ"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:107
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Forward"
msgid "Not running"
msgstr "停止中"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:109
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Forward"
msgid "Not set. Sound passes unchanged"
msgstr "未設定。音はそのまま通ります"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:111
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Forward"
msgid "Nothing to move: both sides alike"
msgstr "動かすものなし: 左右が同じ"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:113
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Forward"
msgid "Working"
msgstr "動作中"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:134
msgctxt "@info under Voice Forward's Hold level, 'Lifting +3 dB'"
msgid "Lifting %1"
msgstr "%1 持ち上げ中"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:138
msgctxt "@info under Voice Forward's Hold level, 'Lifting +3 dB. Limit acting'"
msgid "%1. Limit acting"
msgstr "%1。制限が作動中"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:149
msgctxt ""
"@info under Voice Forward's Hold for before, 'Before is 4 dB louder than "
"this'"
msgid "Before is %1 dB louder than this"
msgstr "処理前の音のほうが %1 dB 大きい"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:155
msgctxt "@info 'Adds 22.83 ms to this lane'"
msgid "Adds %1 ms to this lane"
msgstr "このレーンに %1 ms の遅延を追加"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeFace.qml:46
msgctxt "@info what a Voice Gauge tile says, '-24 LUFS, Between marks'"
msgid "%1, %2"
msgstr "%1、%2"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:16
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"Shows the level of a voice at this point on the lane, in LUFS, against two "
"marks you place. It says where the reading stands against your marks, and "
"nothing about how you sound. It can be wrong."
msgstr ""
"レーン上のこの地点での声のレベルを、自分で置いた 2 つの目印と比べて LUFS "
"で表示します。測定値が目印に対してどこにあるかを示すだけで、声の良し悪しについては何も言いません。間違うこともあります。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:21
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"The block reads the lane and passes the sound on exactly as it arrived, with "
"no delay. The number is the level over the last few seconds of voice. In a "
"pause the number stays and the word says Held, so it does not fall between "
"sentences."
msgstr ""
"このブロックはレーンの音を測り、届いたままの音を遅延なく先へ送ります。数値は、直近数秒間の声のレベルです。合間では数値がそのまま残って「ホールド中」と表示されるので、文と文の間で下がることはありません。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"The number moves with your voice, your distance from the microphone and the "
"microphone's gain, and the block can't tell them apart. It is a level at this"
" point on the lane, before the call program. The program's own gain and the "
"other side's volume come later."
msgstr ""
"数値は、声そのもの、マイクとの距離、マイクのゲインによって変わり、ブロックにはそれらを区別できません。これは通話プログラムの手前、レーン上のこの地点でのレベルです。プログラム自体のゲインや相手側の音量は、この後で加わります。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"No sound here means nothing has reached this point for 2 seconds. It can't "
"say why, and it can't see a mute inside a call program, which sits after this"
" block. To check, say a word and watch the dot: if it stays grey, the voice "
"is not reaching this point. If it lights, the sound got this far, and nothing"
" further is known."
msgstr ""
"「ここは無音」は、この地点に 2 "
"秒間何も届いていないことを示します。理由はわからず、このブロックの後にある通話プログラム内のミュートも見えません。確かめるには、何か言って点を見てください。灰色のままなら、声はこの地点に届いていません。点灯すれば音はここまで届いていますが、その先のことはわかりません。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"A voice too soft for the detector is not counted, so the number stays Held at"
" its last value and the dot stays grey. Any voice counts, including one from "
"a loudspeaker or a television."
msgstr ""
"検出できないほど小さな声は数えられないので、数値は最後の値のまま「ホールド中」になり、点も灰色のままです。スピーカーやテレビからの声も含め、どんな声でも数えられます。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:34
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:166
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:176
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Gauge is called"
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名前"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:36
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:146
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Gauge says now"
msgid "Now"
msgstr "現在"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"What the tile, the tray and the floating bar call this block, up to 24 "
"characters."
msgstr "タイル、トレイ、フローティングバーに表示される、このブロックの名前です。24 文字までです。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:45
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:196
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:223
msgctxt "@label the level of a voice over a few seconds"
msgid "Voice level"
msgstr "声のレベル"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"The reading on a fixed scale from -60 to 0 LUFS, with a line at each mark. "
"The bar is one colour wherever it stands, and half as strong while the number"
" is held. A first number comes after 1 second of voice."
msgstr ""
"-60〜0 LUFS "
"の固定目盛りでの測定値で、各目印の位置に線があります。バーはどこにあっても同じ色で、数値のホールド中は半分の濃さになります。最初の数値は、声を 1 "
"秒聞いた後に表示されます。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:53
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:252
msgctxt "@label a mark placed on a voice level"
msgid "Upper mark"
msgstr "上の目印"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:55
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:268
msgctxt "@label a mark placed on a voice level"
msgid "Lower mark"
msgstr "下の目印"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"Two levels of your own, from -60 to -6 LUFS, or Not set. A word then says "
"where the reading stands against them, and it changes only half a unit past a"
" mark. The lower mark stays at least 1 LU under the upper one: moving one "
"past the other pushes it along. A block has no marks of its own, as a built-"
"in level would say what a voice should be."
msgstr ""
"自分で決める 2 つのレベルで、-60〜-6 LUFS、または「未設定」です。測定値がそれらに対してどこにあるかが言葉で示され、その言葉は目印を 0.5 "
"LU 越えたときにだけ変わります。下の目印は常に上の目印より 1 LU "
"以上低く保たれ、一方をもう一方より先へ動かすと、もう一方も押されて動きます。ブロックに最初から目印がないのは、組み込みのレベルがあると、声のあるべき大きさを決めつけることになるからです。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:64
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:259
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Use This Level"
msgstr "このレベルを使用"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:66
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:304
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Clear Marks"
msgstr "目印を消去"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:69
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"After 20 seconds of voice, this places an upper mark and a lower mark around "
"the level of that voice, Room each side apart from it. Only voice counts "
"towards the 20 seconds. Clear Marks takes both away."
msgstr ""
"声を 20 秒聞くと、その声のレベルを中心に、「上下の幅」だけ離して上の目印と下の目印を置きます。20 "
"秒に数えられるのは声だけです。「目印を消去」で両方を取り除きます。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"If someone is on a call with you, ask them to say when the level suits them, "
"and press Use This Level then. Marks hold for this microphone at this gain. "
"The card names the microphone they were placed on. Alone, the marks record "
"what you did for 20 seconds, and the block can't know more than that."
msgstr ""
"通話相手がいる場合は、ちょうどよいレベルになったら教えてもらい、そのときに「このレベルを使用」を押してください。目印は、このマイクとこのゲインでのみ有効です。設定パネルには、目印を置いたときのマイクの名前が表示されます。一人で使う場合、目印は"
" 20 秒間の自分の声を記録しただけのもので、ブロックにはそれ以上のことはわかりません。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:76
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:324
msgctxt "@label how Voice Gauge listens"
msgid "Detector"
msgstr "検出方式"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:82
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"Voice model is a small model that runs on this computer. It needs a sound "
"system running at 48 kHz, and a build that has it. The card says so when one "
"is missing. Level and rhythm uses far less of the processor and can be wrong "
"more often."
msgstr ""
"「音声モデル」は、このコンピュータ上で動く小さなモデルです。48 kHz "
"で動作しているサウンドシステムと、これを含むビルドが必要です。どちらかが欠けている場合は、設定パネルにそう表示されます。「レベルとリズム」はプロセッサーの負荷がずっと少ない代わりに、間違えることが多くなります。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:88
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:388
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Floating bar"
msgstr "フローティングバー"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:90
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:381
msgctxt "@label where a Voice Gauge shows"
msgid "Show it on"
msgstr "表示先"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:93
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"A row with the number and the word in the small window that stays over other "
"programs, shared with Speech Now. There is room for four rows. It starts off,"
" and you can turn it on here or in the tray's popover. Drag the window to "
"move it. A full-screen share may show it, name included."
msgstr ""
"ほかのプログラムの上に表示され続ける小さなウィンドウ（「発話検出」と共用）に、数値と言葉の行を表示します。表示できるのは 4 "
"行までです。最初はオフで、ここかトレイのポップアップでオンにできます。ウィンドウはドラッグして移動できます。全画面を共有すると、名前も含めて映ることがあります。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:101
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"Adds this block to what you see when you click Reverblabr's icon in the "
"system tray: a dot, the number and where it stands."
msgstr ""
"システムトレイの Reverblabr アイコンをクリックしたときの表示に、このブロックを追加します。点、数値、目印に対する位置が表示されます。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:107
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:445
msgctxt "@title:group a part of the Voice Gauge card"
msgid "Place the bar"
msgstr "バーの位置"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:117
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid "The same place as Speech Now's label, since they share one window."
msgstr "1 つのウィンドウを共用しているので、「発話検出」のラベルと同じ位置です。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:123
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:458
msgctxt "@label how many seconds of voice a reading is the mean of"
msgid "Reading over"
msgstr "平均する時間"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:125
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:451
msgctxt "@title:group a part of the Voice Gauge card"
msgid "Reading"
msgstr "測定"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:128
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"How many seconds of voice the number is the mean of, from 1 to 10. It starts "
"at 3. A shorter time follows you faster and wanders more. A rise shows sooner"
" than a fall, as a mean of energy favours the loud part."
msgstr ""
"数値を何秒分の声の平均にするかで、1〜10 秒です。最初は 3 "
"秒です。短くするとすばやく追従しますが、ふらつきも大きくなります。エネルギーの平均は大きな部分に引っ張られるので、上昇は下降より早く表れます。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:134
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:471
msgctxt "@label how long without a voice before a Voice Gauge starts again"
msgid "Forget after"
msgstr "リセットまでの時間"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:136
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"How long without a voice before the block starts clean, from 10 to 600 "
"seconds, so that an old turn does not mix with a new one. It starts at 60 "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"声が途切れてから、ブロックが測定をやり直すまでの時間で、10〜600 秒です。前の発言が新しい発言と混ざらないようにします。最初は 60 秒です。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:142
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:487
msgctxt "@label how far either side of a level Use This Level puts the marks"
msgid "Room each side"
msgstr "上下の幅"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:144
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"How far Use This Level puts each mark from the level, from 1 to 9 LU. It "
"starts at 3. It does nothing to marks already placed."
msgstr "「このレベルを使用」で、各目印をレベルからどれだけ離して置くかで、1〜9 LU です。最初は 3 です。すでに置いた目印には影響しません。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:151
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"You can't judge your own level on a call, and only find out when someone says"
" so."
msgstr "通話中に自分の声の大きさを判断できず、誰かに言われて初めて気付くとき。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:152
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"You want one answer from someone kept for later, as two marks for this "
"microphone."
msgstr "誰かに一度教えてもらった答えを、このマイク用の 2 つの目印として残しておきたいとき。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:159
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"Put it right after the microphone's Input Device, and name it You. With "
"nothing after it the call program keeps the real microphone, and a stopped "
"session costs the call nothing."
msgstr ""
"マイクの「入力デバイス」のすぐ後ろに置き、「自分」と名前を付けてください。後ろに何もつながなければ、通話プログラムは実際のマイクをそのまま使い、セッションを停止しても通話には何の影響もありません。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:160
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"Put it before Voice Evener. After Voice Evener the reading sits near that "
"block's target, and hides what the voice did. After Speech Denoise, a pause "
"can read as No sound here."
msgstr ""
"「声量均一化」の前に置いてください。「声量均一化」の後ろでは、測定値がそのブロックの目標付近に落ち着いてしまい、声の実際の変化が隠れます。「音声ノイズ除去」の後ろでは、合間が「ここは無音」と表示されることがあります。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:161
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"A Bluetooth headset drops to hands-free sound while anything records from it,"
" and a session left running holds it there outside calls too."
msgstr ""
"Bluetooth "
"ヘッドセットは、何かがそこから録音している間、音質の低いハンズフリーモードになります。セッションを実行したままにすると、通話以外のときもその状態のままになります。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:162
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"With a screen reader, set a key for Say Voice Level in System Settings. One "
"press says one sentence, such as Minus 24 LUFS, between marks. Nothing is "
"said unasked."
msgstr ""
"スクリーンリーダーを使う場合は、システム設定で「声のレベルを読み上げ」にキーを割り当ててください。1 回押すと、「マイナス 24 "
"LUFS、目印の間」のような 1 文を読み上げます。求められない限り、何も読み上げません。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:175
msgctxt "@info:placeholder"
msgid "For example You"
msgstr "例: 自分"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:240
msgctxt "@info first use of a Voice Gauge"
msgid ""
"Talk as you do on a call. After 20 s of voice, Use This Level places two "
"marks around that level"
msgstr "通話のときと同じように話してください。声を 20 秒聞くと、「このレベルを使用」でそのレベルの上下に 2 つの目印を置きます"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:253
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:269
msgctxt "@label loudness units"
msgid "LUFS"
msgstr "LUFS"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:258
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:274
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:281
msgctxt "@info a mark with no value"
msgid "Not set"
msgstr "未設定"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:316
msgctxt "@info the microphone the marks were placed on, %1 its name"
msgid "Marks placed on: %1"
msgstr "目印を置いたマイク: %1"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:403
msgctxt "@info under the Floating bar check box"
msgid "This desktop may not keep it on top"
msgstr "このデスクトップでは最前面に保てない場合があります"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:415
msgctxt "@info under the Floating bar check box"
msgid "The window has room for four. %1 more is left out."
msgid_plural "The window has room for four. %1 more are left out."
msgstr[0] "ウィンドウには 4 行まで表示できます。残りの %1 個は表示されません。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:488
msgctxt "@label loudness units"
msgid "LU"
msgstr "LU"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:500
msgctxt "@info what Voice Gauge can't know"
msgid ""
"A level at this point, before the call program. It can't see a mute inside "
"that program, or what the other side hears. A voice from a loudspeaker counts"
" too"
msgstr ""
"通話プログラムの手前、この地点でのレベルです。そのプログラム内のミュートや、相手に聞こえている音はわかりません。スピーカーからの声も数えられます"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:135
msgctxt "@info a level, '-24 LUFS'"
msgid "%1 LUFS"
msgstr "%1 LUFS"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:145
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:230
