#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:201
msgctxt "@info under No sound here"
msgid "At this point"
msgstr "この地点"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:216
msgctxt "@info a Voice Gauge whose session is not running"
msgid "Session stopped"
msgstr "セッション停止中"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:223
msgctxt "@info what arrives at a Voice Gauge"
msgid "Voice at this point"
msgstr "この地点に声あり"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:225
msgctxt "@info a Voice Gauge keeps its number through a pause"
msgid "Held"
msgstr "ホールド中"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:227
msgctxt "@info what arrives at a Voice Gauge"
msgid "No sound at this point"
msgstr "この地点は無音"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:231
msgctxt "@info what arrives at a Voice Gauge"
msgid "Sound at this point, no voice"
msgstr "この地点に音あり、声なし"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:241
msgctxt "@info a level and where it stands, '-24 LUFS, between marks'"
msgid "%1, %2"
msgstr "%1、%2"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:251
msgctxt "@info:status spoken, a level below zero"
msgid "Minus %1 LUFS"
msgstr "マイナス %1 LUFS"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:253
msgctxt "@info:status spoken, a level and where it stands"
msgid "%1, %2"
msgstr "%1、%2"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:260
msgctxt "@action:button %1 counts up to 20 seconds of voice"
msgid "Use This Level (%1 of 20 s)"
msgstr "このレベルを使用（%1/20 秒）"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:264
msgctxt "@info how long a reading runs"
msgid "%1 s of voice"
msgstr "声 %1 秒分"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:272
msgctxt "@info a room either side of a level"
msgid "±%1 LU"
msgstr "±%1 LU"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeFace.qml:109
msgctxt "@label what the number on a Volume tile is"
msgid "gain"
msgstr "ゲイン"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeFace.qml:134 blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:37
#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumePanel.qml:92 blocks/volume/ui/VolumePanel.qml:163
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Volume"
msgstr "音量"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:16
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"Makes the sound that passes through it quieter, or louder. Use it to match "
"one source to another, without touching the program the sound comes from."
msgstr "通過する音を小さくしたり大きくしたりします。音の出どころのプログラムに触れずに、ある音源の音量を別の音源に合わせるのに使います。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:21
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"Everything that reaches this block leaves it at the volume you set. At 100 % "
"the sound goes on exactly as it arrived. Lower numbers make it quieter, and 0"
" % is silence."
msgstr ""
"このブロックに届いた音はすべて、設定した音量で出ていきます。100% では音は入ってきたままの状態で先へ送られます。数値を下げるほど小さくなり、0% "
"で無音です。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"At 50 % the signal has half its strength. It sounds clearly quieter, though "
"to the ear it is not half as loud."
msgstr "50% では信号の強さが半分になります。はっきりと小さく聞こえますが、耳には半分の大きさには聞こえません。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"A change glides in over a fiftieth of a second, so moving the slider never "
"makes a click."
msgstr "変化は 50 分の 1 秒かけて滑らかに反映されるので、スライダーを動かしてもクリック音は出ません。"

#. i18n: "full scale" is the highest level digital sound can have; the sentence
#. after explains it.
#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"At the end of the block a safety limiter is always at work. It keeps the "
"sound from going higher than 1 dB below full scale."
msgstr "ブロックの最後では、安全のためのリミッターが常に働いています。音がフルスケールより 1 dB 低いレベルを超えないようにします。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"Full scale is the loudest a digital signal can be. Sound pushed past it is "
"clipped: the tops of its waves are cut off, and it crackles. The limiter "
"turns the loudest moments down just enough instead."
msgstr ""
"フルスケールとは、デジタル信号が取りうる最大の大きさです。それを超えた音はクリップします: "
"波の頂点が切り取られ、バリバリという音になります。リミッターは代わりに、最も大きい瞬間だけを必要な分だけ下げます。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"While the sound stays below that level, the limiter changes nothing. It only "
"holds the sound back by one and a half thousandths of a second, far too "
"little to hear."
msgstr "音がそのレベルより下にある間、リミッターは何も変えません。音を 1000 分の 1.5 秒遅らせるだけで、聞き取れないほどわずかです。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"How loud the sound leaves the block, as a percentage of how loud it arrived. "
"Drag the slider here or on the block's tile; the number shows where it is."
msgstr ""
"ブロックから出る音の大きさを、入ってきた音に対するパーセントで示します。ここかブロックのタイルでスライダーをドラッグしてください。数値で現在の位置がわかります。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"A new block starts at 100 %. Without Overdrive the slider stops at 100 %, so "
"it can only turn the sound down."
msgstr "新しいブロックは 100% から始まります。「オーバードライブ」がオフだとスライダーは 100% までなので、音を下げることしかできません。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:46 blocks/volume/ui/VolumePanel.qml:134
msgctxt "@action:button silence this block"
msgid "Mute"
msgstr "ミュート"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"Silences the block without moving the slider. Press it again and the sound "
"comes back at the volume the slider shows."
msgstr "スライダーを動かさずにブロックを無音にします。もう一度押すと、スライダーが示す音量で音が戻ります。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"The sound fades out and in over a hundredth of a second, so muting in the "
"middle of a word makes no click."
msgstr "音は 100 分の 1 秒かけてフェードアウト、フェードインするので、言葉の途中でミュートしてもクリック音は出ません。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:50
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"The slider still moves while the block is muted. Use it to set the level the "
"sound will come back at."
msgstr "ミュート中もスライダーは動かせます。音が戻るときのレベルを設定するのに使ってください。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:56 blocks/volume/ui/VolumePanel.qml:198
msgctxt "@label how far above 100 % the volume slider goes"
msgid "Overdrive"
msgstr "オーバードライブ"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"Lets the slider go past 100 %, so the block can make the sound louder than it"
" arrived. 2× takes the top of the slider to 200 %, 3× to 300 % and 4× to 400 "
"%. Off keeps it at 100 %."
msgstr ""
"スライダーが 100% を超えられるようにして、ブロックが入ってきた音より大きくできるようにします。「2 倍」でスライダーの上限が 200%、「3 倍」で"
" 300%、「4 倍」で 400% になります。「オフ」では 100% のままです。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:59
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"Choosing an overdrive does not change what you hear. It only gives the slider"
" more room."
msgstr "オーバードライブを選んでも、聞こえる音は変わりません。スライダーの範囲が広がるだけです。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:60
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"If you choose a smaller overdrive while the volume is above its top, the "
"volume comes down to the new top."
msgstr "音量が新しい上限を超えているときに小さいオーバードライブを選ぶと、音量は新しい上限まで下がります。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:61
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"Sound made louder can reach the safety limiter. The loudest moments are then "
"held down rather than clipped, which can make loud music sound flatter."
msgstr ""
"大きくした音は、安全のためのリミッターに達することがあります。その場合、最も大きい瞬間はクリップする代わりに抑えられるので、大音量の音楽は平板に聞こえることがあります。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid "One program is much louder than another in the same session."
msgstr "同じセッションで、あるプログラムの音がほかよりずっと大きいとき。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:69
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"A quiet microphone needs to be louder before it reaches a recording or a "
"call. Turn on Overdrive for that."
msgstr "音の小さいマイクを、録音や通話に届く前に大きくする必要があるとき。それには「オーバードライブ」をオンにしてください。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"You want to silence one lane for a moment, with Mute, while the rest of the "
"session carries on."
msgstr "セッションのほかの部分はそのままに、「ミュート」で 1 つのレーンを一時的に無音にしたいとき。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:77
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid "Put a Peak/RMS meter after the block to see what your change did."
msgstr "変更の効果を確かめるには、ブロックの後に「ピーク/RMS」メーターを置いてください。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:78
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"When you turn a quiet source up, go a step at a time. If the meter after it "
"keeps reaching the red part at the top, back off a little."
msgstr "小さい音源を大きくするときは、少しずつ上げてください。後ろのメーターが上端の赤い部分に何度も届くようなら、少し戻してください。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:79
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid "Ctrl+Z takes back a change of the volume, like any other change."
msgstr "音量の変更も、ほかの変更と同じように Ctrl+Z で元に戻せます。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumePanel.qml:54
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Overdrive raises the top of the slider, not the volume. Turning it down "
"brings the volume with it."
msgstr "オーバードライブで上がるのはスライダーの上限で、音量ではありません。下げると、音量もそれに合わせて下がります。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumePanel.qml:203
msgctxt "@label how far above 100 % the volume slider goes"
msgid "Overdrive:"
msgstr "オーバードライブ:"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumePanel.qml:235
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "The volume slider goes up to %1 %"
msgstr "音量スライダーの上限は %1% です"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuFace.qml:44
msgctxt "@info the two needles' readings, 'L −3.0 VU, R −2.5 VU'"
msgid "L %1, R %2"
msgstr "L %1、R %2"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuFace.qml:54 blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:67
msgctxt "@info a VU needle resting on its pin, 'Below −20 VU'"
msgid "Below %1 VU"
msgstr "%1 VU 未満"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuFace.qml:57 blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:70
msgctxt "@info a VU reading"
msgid "%1 VU"
msgstr "%1 VU"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:19
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"Shows how loud the sound is at this point of a lane with two needles, one for"
" the left side and one for the right. It only measures: the sound passes "
"through unchanged."
msgstr "レーンのこの位置での音の大きさを、左用と右用の 2 本の針で示します。測定するだけで、音はそのまま通ります。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"Each needle swings with the average loudness of its side, the way the needle "
"meters on old tape machines and mixing desks did. It does not jump to every "
"short peak. It moves smoothly, more like the way the ear judges loudness."
msgstr ""
"それぞれの針は、昔のテープレコーダーやミキシングコンソールの針式メーターのように、その側の平均的な大きさに合わせて振れます。短いピークのたびに跳ねることはなく、耳が大きさを感じ取るのに近い形でなめらかに動きます。"

#. i18n: VU stands for volume unit; it stays in Latin letters in most
#. languages.
#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"The scale is in VU, short for volume units. 0 VU is the level you choose with"
" 0 VU is. The scale runs from −20 VU, where the needle rests on its pin, to "
"+3 VU at its end; the part above 0 VU is red."
msgstr ""
"目盛りの単位は VU（ボリュームユニットの略）です。0 VU は「0 VU の基準」で選んだレベルです。目盛りは、針が止めピンに当たって止まる −20 "
"VU から、端の +3 VU までで、0 VU より上は赤です。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"Like a real VU meter's, the scale follows the strength of the sound rather "
"than decibels. So 0 VU sits about seven tenths of the way along, and the "
"quiet end from −20 to −10 VU is crowded together."
msgstr ""
"本物の VU メーターと同じように、目盛りはデシベルではなく音の強さに比例しています。そのため 0 VU は全体の約 10 分の 7 "
"のところにあり、−20〜−10 VU の小さい側は詰まっています。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:28
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"A needle takes three tenths of a second to reach a new level, and swings a "
"hair past it before it settles, as the standard for these meters asks."
msgstr "VU メーターの規格どおり、針は新しいレベルに達するまで 10 分の 3 秒かかり、落ち着く前にほんのわずか行き過ぎます。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:29
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"The small lamp by each dial lights red when that side reaches full scale, the"
" loudest a digital signal can be. The sound has probably been clipped there: "
"the tops of its waves were cut off, which you may hear as a crackle. The "
"light stays on for a second and a half after the last time; click the dial to"
" put it out sooner."
msgstr ""
"各メーターの横の小さなランプは、その側がフルスケール（デジタル信号の最大の大きさ）に達すると赤く点灯します。そこでは音がクリップした可能性があります。つまり波の頂点が切り取られ、バリッという音に聞こえることがあります。ランプは最後に点灯してから"
" 1.5 秒間点いたままです。早く消すにはメーターをクリックしてください。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:30
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid "Point at a dial to read its level as a number, to a tenth of a VU."
msgstr "メーターにマウスを合わせると、レベルが 0.1 VU 単位の数値で表示されます。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:31
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid "The block adds no delay and changes nothing in the sound."
msgstr "このブロックは遅延を加えず、音を何も変えません。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:41 blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:174
msgctxt "@label:listbox the level that reads 0 VU"
msgid "Reference level"
msgstr "基準レベル"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:43 blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:160
msgctxt "@label:listbox the level that reads 0 VU"
msgid "0 VU is"
msgstr "0 VU の基準"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:46
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"Which level the needle shows as 0 VU. Click the value beside 0 VU is to "
"choose another. The number is how far below full scale the peaks of a steady "
"tone are when the needle points at 0 VU:"
msgstr ""
"針がどのレベルを 0 VU として示すかです。別のレベルを選ぶには、「0 VU の基準」の横の値をクリックしてください。数値は、針が 0 VU "
"を指しているときに、一定の音のピークがフルスケールからどれだけ下にあるかを示します:"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block, one choice of the reference level"
msgid ""
"−20 dBFS: the same sound reads 2 VU higher than at −18, which leaves more "
"room below full scale."
msgstr "−20 dBFS: 同じ音でも −18 のときより 2 VU 高く表示され、フルスケールまでの余裕が大きくなります。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:50
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block, one choice of the reference level"
msgid ""
"−18 dBFS: what a new block uses, and the level digital studios most often "
"line 0 VU up with."
msgstr "−18 dBFS: 新しいブロックで使われる値で、デジタルのスタジオで 0 VU を合わせるのに最もよく使われるレベルです。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:51
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block, one choice of the reference level"
msgid ""
"−14 dBFS: the same sound reads 4 VU lower than at −18, for sound that is "
"meant to be loud."
msgstr "−14 dBFS: 同じ音でも −18 のときより 4 VU 低く表示されます。大きく聞かせることを意図した音向けです。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:54
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"dBFS means decibels below full scale. Changing the reference moves the "
"needles only; the sound stays exactly as it is."
msgstr "dBFS は、フルスケールを基準としたデシベルのことです。基準を変えても針の位置が変わるだけで、音はまったく変わりません。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:62
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"Adds this meter to what you see when you click Reverblabr's icon in the "
"system tray. You can then keep an eye on the level with the main window "
"closed."
msgstr ""
"システムトレイの Reverblabr アイコンをクリックしたときの表示に、このメーターを加えます。メインウィンドウを閉じたままレベルを確認できます。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:63
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid "It is off for a new block."
msgstr "新しいブロックではオフです。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"You want to judge how loud a voice or a piece of music feels, rather than how"
" high its peaks go."
msgstr "声や音楽のピークの高さではなく、どれくらい大きく感じられるかを判断したいとき。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:71
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"You want two sources to sound about equally loud: set each so its needle "
"swings round the same place."
msgstr "2 つの音源をほぼ同じ大きさに聞こえるようにしたいとき。それぞれの針が同じあたりで振れるように設定します。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:72
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid "You find a calm needle easier to read than a jumping bar."
msgstr "跳ねるバーより、落ち着いた針のほうが読みやすいとき。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:79
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"For speech, aim for the needle to swing round 0 VU, touching the red now and "
"then."
msgstr "話し声では、針が 0 VU あたりで振れ、ときどき赤に触れるくらいを目安にしてください。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:80
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"A VU needle is too slow to show short peaks. To be sure nothing clips, put a "
"Peak/RMS meter beside it, or watch the lamps."
msgstr ""
"VU の針は、短いピークを示すには遅すぎます。クリップしていないことを確かめるには、隣に「ピーク/RMS」メーターを置くか、ランプを見てください。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:81
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"If a lamp keeps lighting, turn down whatever comes before the meter until it "
"stays dark."
msgstr "ランプが何度も点灯するときは、点灯しなくなるまで、メーターより前にあるものの音量を下げてください。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:83
msgctxt "@info:tooltip a VU reading, and that the side has clipped"
msgid "%1, clipped — click to reset"
msgstr "%1、クリップしました: クリックでリセット"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveFace.qml:44
msgctxt "@info a Wave block making noise rather than a tone"
msgid "Noise"
msgstr "ノイズ"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveFace.qml:51
msgctxt "@info a waveform and the one side it is on, 'sine · left'"
msgid "%1 · %2"
msgstr "%1 · %2"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveFace.qml:56
msgctxt ""
"@info:tooltip what a Wave block is making, 'Sine, 1 kHz, −18.0 dB, both'"
msgid "%1, %2, %3, %4"
msgstr "%1、%2、%3、%4"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveFace.qml:59
msgctxt ""
"@info:tooltip what a Wave block is making, 'White noise, −18.0 dB, both'"
msgid "%1, %2, %3"
msgstr "%1、%2、%3"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveFace.qml:117 blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:70
#: blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:182
msgctxt "@label:slider how loud a Wave block's signal is"
msgid "Level"
msgstr "レベル"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:17
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"Makes a test sound: a steady tone or a hiss of noise, at the pitch and the "
"level you set, on the left, the right or both sides."
msgstr "テスト用の音を作ります: 一定の音程の音、またはサーというノイズを、設定した高さとレベルで、左、右、または両側に出します。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"The block makes its own sound and takes nothing in. It is listed with the "
"outputs, but it starts a lane: wire it to an Output Device to hear it, or "
"through other blocks first to see what they do."
msgstr ""
"このブロックは自分で音を作り、何も受け取りません。ブロックライブラリでは「出力」カテゴリに入っていますが、レーンの始まりになります: "
"「出力デバイス」ブロックに配線すると音を聞くことができ、先に他のブロックを通せば、それらの働きを確かめられます。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"A known, steady sound is what you need to check a speaker, a cable or a "
"setting. You always know what should come out."
msgstr "スピーカー、ケーブル、設定を確かめるには、内容がわかっている一定の音が必要です。何が出てくるはずかが、常にわかるからです。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"Every change glides in over a fiftieth of a second, so changing the pitch, "
"the level or the side never makes a click."
msgstr "変更はすべて 50 分の 1 秒かけて滑らかに反映されるので、高さ、レベル、出す側を変えてもクリックノイズは出ません。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:34 blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:91
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Waveform"
msgstr "波形"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:36 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:28
msgctxt "@item a waveform"
msgid "Sine"
msgstr "正弦波"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:37 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:30
msgctxt "@item a waveform"
msgid "Square"
msgstr "矩形波"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:38 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:32
msgctxt "@item a waveform"
msgid "Triangle"
msgstr "三角波"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:39 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:34
msgctxt "@item a waveform"
msgid "Sawtooth"
msgstr "ノコギリ波"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:40 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:36
msgctxt "@item a kind of noise"
msgid "White noise"
msgstr "ホワイトノイズ"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:41 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:38
msgctxt "@item a kind of noise"
msgid "Pink noise"
msgstr "ピンクノイズ"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:44
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"What the sound is. The first four are tones, each with a pitch; the last two "
"are noise, with none."
msgstr "音の種類です。最初の 4 つは音程のある音で、最後の 2 つは音程のないノイズです。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block, a choice of Waveform"
msgid ""
"Sine: the purest tone, a single pitch and nothing else. What a new block "
"makes, and the usual test tone."
msgstr "正弦波: 最も純粋な音で、1 つの高さの音だけを含みます。新しいブロックはこの音を作ります。一般的なテスト音です。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block, a choice of Waveform"
msgid ""
"Square, Triangle and Sawtooth: the same pitch with other tones above it, so "
"they sound brighter and buzzier. Triangle is the softest of the three, and "
"Square and Sawtooth the harshest. They are made so that a high pitch never "
"brings a false, lower tone with it."
msgstr ""
"矩形波、三角波、ノコギリ波: 同じ高さの音に、それより上の音が重なっているので、より明るく、ジージーとした音になります。3 "
"つのうち三角波が最も柔らかく、矩形波とノコギリ波が最も硬い音です。高い音にしても、偽の低い音が混じらないように作られています。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block, a choice of Waveform"
msgid ""
"White noise: a hiss with every pitch in it at once, at the same strength. It "
"sounds bright and sharp."
msgstr "ホワイトノイズ: あらゆる高さの音を同じ強さで同時に含んだ、サーという音です。明るく鋭く聞こえます。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:50
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block, a choice of Waveform"
msgid ""
"Pink noise: noise with the high pitches turned down, which sounds more even "
"to the ear, like rushing water. It is the usual noise for checking speakers."
msgstr "ピンクノイズ: 高い音を弱めたノイズで、流れる水の音のように、耳にはより均一に聞こえます。スピーカーの確認によく使われるノイズです。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:56 blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:125
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Frequency"
msgstr "周波数"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:57 blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:149
msgctxt "@label:textbox a frequency to type"
msgid "Frequency in hertz"
msgstr "周波数（Hz）"

#. i18n: Hz stands for hertz, kHz for kilohertz.
#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:60
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"The pitch of a tone, in hertz (Hz): how many times a second the wave repeats."
" The slider goes from 20 Hz, a deep rumble, to 20 kilohertz (kHz), 20,000 Hz,"
" higher than most adults can hear. A new block starts at 1 kHz."
msgstr ""
"音の高さを、ヘルツ（Hz）、つまり波が 1 秒間に繰り返す回数で設定します。スライダーの範囲は、低くうなる 20 Hz から、ほとんどの大人には聞こえない"
" 20 キロヘルツ（kHz、20,000 Hz）までです。新しいブロックは 1 kHz から始まります。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:61
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"The slider spreads the range the way the ear hears it: each step up in pitch,"
" from one note to the same note an octave higher, takes the same distance "
"anywhere on it."
msgstr ""
"スライダーは、耳の聞こえ方に合わせて範囲を配置しています: ある音から 1 オクターブ上の同じ音までの間隔は、スライダーのどこでも同じ長さです。"

#. i18n: keep 440, 1k and 1.5 kHz as they are; they are what is typed.
#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:63
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"For an exact pitch, type it in the box beside the slider and press Enter: 440"
" for 440 Hz, or 1k or 1.5 kHz for kilohertz."
msgstr ""
"正確な高さにするには、スライダーの横の欄に入力して Enter を押します: 440 Hz なら 440、キロヘルツなら 1k や 1.5 kHz "
"のように入力します。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:64
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"Noise has no pitch, so the frequency is greyed out while the block makes "
"noise. It is kept for when you go back to a tone."
msgstr "ノイズには音程がないので、ブロックがノイズを出している間は周波数がグレー表示になります。値は、音程のある音に戻したときのために保持されます。"

#. i18n: dB stands for decibels.
#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:73
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"How loud the sound is, in decibels (dB) below full scale, the loudest a "
"digital signal can be. 0 dB is full scale, and every 6 dB lower is about half"
" the strength. The slider goes from −80 dB, barely there, to 0 dB."
msgstr ""
"音の大きさを、フルスケール（デジタル信号が出せる最大の大きさ）を基準としたデシベル（dB）で設定します。0 dB がフルスケールで、6 dB "
"下がるごとに強さは約半分になります。スライダーの範囲は、ほとんど聞こえない −80 dB から 0 dB までです。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:74
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"The level is the height of the wave's peaks. A new block starts at −18 dB, "
"well below full scale, so that a test is never loud unless you ask for loud."
msgstr ""
"レベルは、波の山の高さです。新しいブロックはフルスケールより十分低い −18 dB "
"から始まるので、大きな音を指定しない限り、テストの音が大きくなることはありません。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:75
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"Above −6 dB the number turns to the warning colour. A loud steady tone can "
"hurt your ears or a small speaker, so go up a little at a time."
msgstr "−6 dB を超えると、数値が警告色に変わります。大きな一定の音は耳や小さなスピーカーを傷めることがあるので、少しずつ上げてください。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:81
msgctxt "@label which channels a Wave block's signal is on"
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "チャンネル"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:83 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:46
msgctxt "@item the signal goes to the left channel only"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:84 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:50
msgctxt "@item the signal goes to both channels"
msgid "Both"
msgstr "両方"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:85 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:48
msgctxt "@item the signal goes to the right channel only"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:88
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"Which side the sound is on. Left or Right puts it on that side only, and the "
"other side is silent. Both, what a new block uses, puts the same sound on "
"each side."
msgstr "音を出す側です。「左」または「右」はその側だけに出し、反対側は無音になります。新しいブロックで使われる「両方」は、同じ音を左右に出します。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:95
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"You want to check that a speaker works, or that left and right are the right "
"way round."
msgstr "スピーカーが動作するか、左右が正しいかを確かめたいとき。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:96
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid "You want to know whether a cable or an adapter crackles or hums."
msgstr "ケーブルやアダプターにパチパチという雑音やハムがないかを知りたいとき。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:97
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"You want to see what a block does to a sound you know, with a meter after it."
msgstr "後ろにメーターを置いて、内容がわかっている音にブロックがどう働くかを見たいとき。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:104
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"Turn your speakers or headphones down before you start, then bring the level "
"up slowly."
msgstr "始める前にスピーカーやヘッドホンの音量を下げ、それからゆっくりレベルを上げてください。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:105
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"To check left and right, choose Left: the sound should come only from the "
"left speaker. Then choose Right."
msgstr "左右を確かめるには、「左」を選びます: 音は左のスピーカーからだけ聞こえるはずです。次に「右」を選びます。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:106
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"Pink noise at a modest level is a good sound to compare two speakers with, or"
" to set the volumes of several to match."
msgstr "控えめなレベルのピンクノイズは、2 つのスピーカーを比べたり、複数のスピーカーの音量をそろえたりするのに適しています。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:107
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"A sweep from low to high, with the slider, shows where a small speaker stops "
"playing the bass."
msgstr "スライダーで低い音から高い音へ動かしていくと、小さなスピーカーがどこから低音を鳴らせなくなるかがわかります。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:83
msgctxt "@label:listbox the shape of a Wave block's signal"
msgid "Waveform:"
msgstr "波形:"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:114
msgctxt "@label a Wave block's tone frequency"
msgid "Frequency:"
msgstr "周波数:"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:172
msgctxt "@label how loud a Wave block's signal is"
msgid "Level:"
msgstr "レベル:"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:213
msgctxt "@label which channels a Wave block's signal is on"
msgid "Channels:"
msgstr "チャンネル:"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:15
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Draws the sound at this point on the lane as it goes by. It changes nothing "
"about the sound."
msgstr "レーンのこの位置を通る音を、通っていくそばから描きます。音そのものは何も変えません。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:20
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"The block passes the sound on exactly as it arrived, with no delay. Its tile "
"and its card both draw what passes, at their own width, and it works only "
"while one of them is on the screen."
msgstr ""
"このブロックは、届いた音を遅延なしでそのまま次へ渡します。タイルと設定パネルの両方に、それぞれの幅で通る音が描かれ、どちらかが画面に表示されている間だけ動作します。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:21
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"A trace that stands still is one you asked to hold. When the session is "
"stopped or overloaded, or the block is off, no trace is shown and a line of "
"words says why."
msgstr ""
"止まっている波形は、ホールドしたものです。セッションが停止中か過負荷のとき、またはブロックがオフのときは波形は表示されず、その理由が 1 "
"行の文で示されます。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:31
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:110
msgctxt "@action:button keeps the trace shown and takes no new one"
msgid "Hold"
msgstr "ホールド"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:33
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Keeps the trace on the screen and takes no new ones, so that you can look at "
"a moment. You can change how it is drawn while it is held. Press it again to "
"go back to the live sound."
msgstr ""
"波形を画面に残したまま新しい波形を取り込まないので、ある瞬間をじっくり見られます。ホールド中も描き方は変えられます。もう一度押すと、リアルタイムの音に戻ります。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"The settings below are folded under this heading, under the trace and Hold. "
"Click the heading to show them, and again to fold them away."
msgstr ""
"以下の設定は、波形と「ホールド」の下にあるこの見出しの中に折りたたまれています。見出しをクリックすると表示され、もう一度クリックすると折りたたまれます。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:46
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:137
msgctxt "@label how a Waveform is drawn"
msgid "Style"
msgstr "スタイル"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:54
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Line draws the wave itself, or the band it fills when more than one sample "
"falls on a pixel. Filled draws how far the sound reaches either side of the "
"middle, as a solid shape. Bars does the same in separate bars, and Dots marks"
" the highest and lowest points. Switching shows at once."
msgstr ""
"「線」は波そのものを描き、1 "
"ピクセルに複数のサンプルが入るときは、その波が埋める帯を描きます。「塗りつぶし」は、中心から上下にどこまで音が届くかを塗りつぶした形で描きます。「バー」は同じことを個別のバーで描き、「点」は最高点と最低点に印を付けます。切り替えるとすぐに反映されます。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:60
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:174
msgctxt "@label how a Waveform moves between refreshes"
msgid "Motion"
msgstr "動き"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:66
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Real-time shows the newest sound as it is, once each refresh, and holds it "
"until the next."
msgstr "「リアルタイム」は、更新のたびに最新の音をそのまま表示し、次の更新まで保ちます。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:67
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Smooth draws at the rate of your screen. From 200 ms up the trace flows "
"steadily across, a little behind the newest sound. Below 200 ms, or with the "
"trigger on, each new trace eases in from the last, lined up on a rising zero "
"crossing so that a steady tone stands still. Smooth makes the picture calmer "
"and uses more of the graphics card."
msgstr ""
"「滑らか」は画面のリフレッシュレートで描きます。200 ms 以上では、波形は最新の音より少し遅れて一定の速さで流れていきます。200 ms "
"未満のとき、またはトリガーがオンのときは、新しい波形が前の波形からなめらかに移り変わり、上向きのゼロクロスにそろえられるので、一定の音は止まって見えます。「滑らか」は表示を落ち着かせますが、グラフィックカードをより多く使います。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:73
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:214
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:221
msgctxt "@label how many times a second a Waveform is drawn"
msgid "Refresh rate, per second"
msgstr "更新頻度（回/秒）"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:75
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"How often a new look is taken at the sound, from 10 to 120 times a second. It"
" can't show more than arrives, which is one cycle of the sound system at a "
"time, and the card says so when the rate you chose is faster than that. It "
"can't show more than your screen does either."
msgstr ""
"音を新しく取り込む頻度で、1 秒あたり 10 回から 120 回までです。届く音（1 "
"回のオーディオサイクル分ずつ）より多くは表示できず、選んだ頻度がそれより速いときは設定パネルにその旨が表示されます。また、画面が表示できる以上には表示できません。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:81
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:269
msgctxt "@label how much time a Waveform shows across its width"
msgid "Time shown"
msgstr "表示時間"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:83
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"How much time goes across the width, from 10 ms to 10 s. A short time shows "
"the shape of a wave, and a long time shows how the level moves. A click stays"
" visible even at 10 s."
msgstr ""
"横幅に表示する時間の長さで、10 ms から 10 秒までです。短くすると波の形が、長くするとレベルの動きがわかります。10 "
"秒でもクリックノイズは見えます。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:89
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:284
msgctxt "@label how much a Waveform's trace is enlarged"
msgid "Gain"
msgstr "ゲイン"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:91
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:296
msgctxt "@option:check a Waveform enlarges its trace to fill the height"
msgid "Auto fit"
msgstr "自動調整"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:94
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Enlarges the drawing and not the sound, from -24 to +48 dB. With Auto fit on,"
" the trace is enlarged to fill the height: at once when it would go off the "
"edge, and over about a second when it gets quieter."
msgstr ""
"音ではなく描画を -24 から +48 dB "
"の範囲で拡大します。「自動調整」がオンのときは、波形が高さいっぱいになるよう拡大されます。はみ出しそうなときはすぐに、小さくなったときは約 1 "
"秒かけて調整されます。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:100
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:307
msgctxt "@label which channels a Waveform draws"
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "チャンネル"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:110
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Both draws left and right over each other, and Stacked draws left above "
"right. Mid is what the two have in common, half of their sum, and Side is "
"where they differ, half of their difference. A mono sound has no Side."
msgstr ""
"「両方」は左右を重ねて描き、「上下に並べる」は左を上、右を下に描きます。「ミッド」は左右に共通する部分（和の半分）、「サイド」は左右で異なる部分（差の半分）です。モノラルの音には「サイド」はありません。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:116
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:346
msgctxt ""
"@option:check a Waveform starts each trace at the same point of the wave"
msgid "Start on a rising zero crossing"
msgstr "上向きのゼロクロスで開始"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:118
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Starts each trace where the wave goes up through the middle, so that a steady"
" tone stands still rather than running across. It helps with a tone or a held"
" note. On speech or music there are many crossings and the trace still moves."
" It looks at the first channel shown."
msgstr ""
"波が中心を下から上へ横切るところから各波形を描き始めるので、一定の音は流れずに止まって見えます。テスト音や伸ばした音に役立ちます。話し声や音楽では横切る点が多いため、波形は動いたままです。表示されている最初のチャンネルを基準にします。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:124
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:370
msgctxt "@option:check lines behind a Waveform's trace"
msgid "Grid"
msgstr "グリッド"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:126
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Lines behind the trace: eight divisions across, and the middle with half "
"height up and down."
msgstr "波形の後ろの線です。横方向に 8 分割し、中心と、上下それぞれ半分の高さに線を引きます。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:132
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:381
msgctxt "@label what the height of a Waveform means"
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "目盛り"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:138
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Linear makes the height the amplitude, which is how a wave looks. Decibels "
"spreads the last 60 dB over the height, so that quiet sound can be seen, with"
" a line every 12 dB."
msgstr ""
"「リニア」は高さを振幅そのままにするので、波本来の見た目になります。「デシベル」は上から 60 dB "
"分を高さいっぱいに広げて小さな音も見えるようにし、12 dB ごとに線を引きます。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:145
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Put one before and one after a block to see what it does to the shape of the "
"sound. Use a short time with the trigger on to look at a tone, and a long "
"time to see how the level moves."
msgstr ""
"あるブロックの前と後に 1 "
"つずつ置くと、そのブロックが音の形をどう変えるかがわかります。一定の音を見るにはトリガーをオンにして短い時間を、レベルの動きを見るには長い時間を使ってください。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:152
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"A session can show up to 16 at once. Each one still passes the sound on with "
"no delay, and one that is off the screen does no work beyond passing it on. A"
" held trace is kept only while the tile or the card is on the screen."
msgstr ""
"1 つのセッションで同時に 16 "
"個まで表示できます。どれも遅延なしで音を次へ渡し、画面外にあるものは音を渡す以外の処理をしません。ホールドした波形は、タイルまたは設定パネルが画面に表示されている間だけ保たれます。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:90
msgctxt "@label the sound drawn on a Waveform card"
msgid "Waveform"
msgstr "波形"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:113
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Keeps the trace on the screen so that you can look at it"
msgstr "波形を画面に残してじっくり見られるようにします"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:238
msgctxt "@action:button how many times a second a Waveform is drawn"
msgid "%1 times a second"
msgstr "毎秒 %1 回"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:256
msgctxt "@info under a Waveform's refresh rate, %1 a whole number"
msgid ""
"Sound arrives about %1 times a second at this cycle length, so a faster "
"refresh repeats itself"
msgstr "このサイクルの長さでは音は 1 秒に約 %1 回届くため、それより速く更新しても同じ表示が繰り返されます"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:285
msgctxt "@label decibels"
msgid "dB"
msgstr "dB"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:360
msgctxt "@info under a Waveform's trigger"
msgid "No crossing found: the newest sound is shown as it comes"
msgstr "ゼロクロスが見つかりません: 最新の音をそのまま表示しています"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:422
msgctxt "@info what a Waveform does to the sound"
msgid ""
"Passes the sound on exactly as it arrived. The block works only while it is "
"on the screen"
msgstr "届いた音をそのまま次へ渡します。このブロックは画面に表示されている間だけ動作します"

#. i18n: typed in KRunner after "rb" to see what is being recorded; three
#. letters of it or more, or all of it
#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:160
msgctxt "@info:keyword KRunner"
msgid "recording"
msgstr "録音"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:168
msgctxt "@info:status session state in KRunner"
msgid "Running and recording"
msgstr "実行中・録音中"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:169
msgctxt "@info:status session state in KRunner"
msgid "Running"
msgstr "実行中"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:172
msgctxt "@info:status session state in KRunner"
msgid "Starting"
msgstr "起動中"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:175
msgctxt "@info:status session state in KRunner"
msgid "Stopping"
msgstr "停止処理中"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:178
msgctxt "@info:status session state in KRunner"
msgid "Could not run"
msgstr "実行できませんでした"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:181
msgctxt "@info:status session state in KRunner"
msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "停止"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:313
msgctxt "@action:button in KRunner"
msgid "Open in Reverblabr"
msgstr "Reverblabr で開く"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:336
msgctxt "@info KRunner, %1 is a session's name"
msgid "Recording in “%1”"
msgstr "「%1」で録音中"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:337
msgctxt "@info KRunner, %1 is a session's name"
msgid "Recording paused in “%1”"
msgstr "「%1」で録音を一時停止中"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:348
msgctxt "@info KRunner"
msgid "Nothing is being recorded"
msgstr "録音中のものはありません"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:381
msgctxt "@action KRunner, %1 is a session's name"
msgid "Stop “%1”"
msgstr "「%1」を停止"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:382
msgctxt "@action KRunner, %1 is a session's name"
msgid "Run “%1”"
msgstr "「%1」を実行"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:71
msgctxt "@item a device or application whose name is not known"
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "不明"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:84
msgctxt "@action:button in a notification that a recording finished"
msgid "Open"
msgstr "開く"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:89
msgctxt "@action:button in a notification that a recording finished"
msgid "Show in Folder"
msgstr "フォルダで表示"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:132
msgctxt "@title a notification"
msgid "Plugin stopped"
msgstr "プラグインが停止しました"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:135
msgctxt "@info %1 is a plugin's name"
msgid ""
"%1 crashed. Its block is bypassed, and it can be restarted from its panel."
msgstr "%1 がクラッシュしました。ブロックはバイパスされています。パネルから再起動できます。"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:138
msgctxt "@info %1 is a plugin's name"
msgid ""
"%1 stopped responding. Its block is bypassed, and it can be restarted from "
"its panel."
msgstr "%1 が応答しなくなりました。ブロックはバイパスされています。パネルから再起動できます。"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:144
msgctxt "@title a notification"
msgid "Disk nearly full"
msgstr "ディスクの空きが残りわずかです"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:146
msgctxt "@info %1 is a recording's file name; %2 is an amount of disk space"
msgid ""
"Only %2 is left on the disk %1 is recorded to. The recording goes on, and "
"stops cleanly before the disk is full."
msgstr "%1 の録音先ディスクの空き容量は残り %2 です。録音は続き、ディスクがいっぱいになる前にきれいに停止します。"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:152
msgctxt "@title a notification"
msgid "Feedback prevented"
msgstr "フィードバックを防止しました"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:154
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"A connection would have fed a session's sound back into itself, so it wasn't "
"made."
msgstr "セッションの音を自身に戻してしまう接続だったため、作成しませんでした。"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:170
msgctxt "@title a notification"
msgid "Device disconnected"
msgstr "デバイスが切断されました"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:172
msgctxt "@info %1 is a device's name; %2 is a session's name"
msgid ""
"%1 went away while %2 was running. The session waits for it and carries on "
"when it is back."
msgstr "%2 の実行中に %1 が切断されました。セッションはデバイスを待ち、戻ってくると処理を続けます。"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:181
msgctxt "@title a notification"
msgid "Application stopped playing"
msgstr "アプリケーションの再生が止まりました"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:183
msgctxt "@info %1 is an application's name; %2 is a session's name"
msgid "%1 is no longer playing into %2."
msgstr "%1 はもう %2 に音を流していません。"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:193
msgctxt "@title a notification"
msgid "Application playing again"
msgstr "アプリケーションが再生を再開しました"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:195
msgctxt "@info %1 is an application's name; %2 is a session's name"
msgid "%1 is playing into %2 again."
msgstr "%1 が再び %2 に音を流しています。"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:211
msgctxt "@title a notification"
msgid "Recording finished"
msgstr "録音が完了しました"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:213
msgctxt "@info %1 is a recording's file name; %2 how long it is, as 1:05"
msgid "%1 is saved, %2 long."
msgstr "%1 を保存しました（長さ %2）。"
